('19596712', 'Abyss-scale of Cetus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/19596712.jpg', 'Equip only to a "Mermail" monster. It gains 800 ATK. When a Trap effect that was activated on your opponent''s side of the field resolves, negate that effect, then send this card to the Graveyard.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
