('43583400', 'Antialian', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43583400.jpg', 'Once per turn, if this card battled a monster this Battle Phase, you can (Quick Effect): Immediately after this effect resolves, Normal Summon 1 Cyberse monster. If this face-up card you control leaves the field because of an opponent''s card effect: Draw 1 card.', '4', '1900', '600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('31539614', 'Antidote Nurse', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31539614.jpg', '2+ Level 3 monsters\\r\\n(Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card, then target 1 monster on the field whose current ATK or DEF is different from its original value; its ATK/DEF become their original values, also if you targeted a monster on your field, it cannot be destroyed by battle or card effects this turn. Once per turn, if another monster(s) is Special Summoned to your field and this card has 3 or more materials (except during the Damage Step): You can make that monster(s) gain 900 ATK.', '3', '1800', '1200', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('58844135', 'Antihuman Intelligence ME-PSY-YA', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/58844135.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nAny card sent to the GY is banished instead, except Monster Cards.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\nYou can reveal this card in your hand; add 1 other Pendulum Monster from your hand, or 1 card from your Pendulum Zone, to its owner''s Extra Deck face-up, and if you do, Special Summon this card. You can only use this effect of "Antihuman Intelligence ME-PSY-YA" once per turn. If another monster(s) is Normal or Special Summoned while you control this card: Send that monster(s) to the GY during the End Phase of this turn.', '8', '2500', '3000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('60411677', 'Anubis the Last Judge', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/60411677.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand or GY) while you have 3 or more cards in your GY with different names that are "Temple of the Kings" and/or Traps, by placing 2 of them on the bottom of the Deck in any order. You can send this card from your hand to the GY; add 1 "The Man with the Mark" from your Deck to your hand. If a Spell/Trap(s) you control is destroyed by card effect: You can target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy it. You can only use each effect of "Anubis the Last Judge" once per turn.', '10', '3000', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('41098335', 'Ape Fighter', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41098335.jpg', 'If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle: This card gains 300 ATK. If this card does not attack during your turn, the ATK gained from this effect returns to 0 during the End Phase of that turn.', '4', '1900', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('31975743', 'Ape Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31975743.jpg', 'Cannot be Special Summoned. Once per turn, if this card is in face-up Attack Position: You can send 1 monster from your hand to the Graveyard to target 1 face-up Defense Position monster your opponent controls; take control of it until the End Phase. It cannot change its battle position this turn.', '3', '800', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('25573115', 'Apex Predation', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/25573115.jpg', 'If you control a Normal Summoned/Set monster: Destroy all Special Summoned monsters on the field. Until the end of your next turn after this card is activated, you cannot Normal Summon/Set. You can only activate 1 "Apex Predation" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('41158734', 'Apocatequil', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41158734.jpg', 'While this card is face-up on the field, it is Level 5 if you control a face-up Tuner monster. When this card on the field is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, you can select and Special Summon 1 "Oracle of the Sun" from your Graveyard.', '4', '1800', '1200', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('28531163', 'Apocavities', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/28531163.jpg', 'When this card is activated: Place C Counters on this card, equal to the number of cards your opponent controls. You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls and remove up to 4 C Counters from your field; apply this effect to that monster, based on the number removed.\\r\\n● 1: It loses 500 ATK.\\r\\n● 2: Its ATK becomes 0.\\r\\n● 3: Its effects are negated.\\r\\n● 4: Destroy it.\\r\\nYou can only activate 1 "Apocavities" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('4280258', 'Apollousa, Bow of the Goddess', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/4280258.jpg', '2+ monsters with different names, except Tokens\\r\\nYou can only control 1 "Apollousa, Bow of the Goddess". The original ATK of this card becomes 800 x the number of Link Materials used for its Link Summon. Once per Chain, when your opponent activates a monster effect (Quick Effect): You can make this card lose exactly 800 ATK, and if you do, negate the activation.', '0', '0', '0', 'WIND', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('95561146', 'Apophis the Serpent', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95561146.jpg', 'Special Summon this card as a Normal Monster (Reptile/EARTH/Level 4/ATK 1600/DEF 1800) (this card is also still a Trap), then you can Set 1 "Apophis" Trap from your Deck, except "Apophis the Serpent". It can be activated this turn. If this card is sent to the GY: You can add 1 "Embodiment of Apophis" from your Deck to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Apophis the Serpent" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('85888377', 'Apophis the Swamp Deity', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85888377.jpg', 'During the Main Phase: Special Summon this card as a Normal Monster (Reptile/EARTH/Level 6/ATK 2000/DEF 2200) (this card is also still a Trap), then, you can negate the effects of face-up cards your opponent controls, up to the number of other Continuous Traps you control, until the end of this turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('40061558', 'Apoqliphort Skybase', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40061558.jpg', 'Cannot be Special Summoned. Requires 3 "Qli" Tributes to Normal Summon/Set. If this card is Normal Summoned/Set, it is unaffected by Spell/Trap effects and by activated effects from any monster whose original Level/Rank is lower than this card''s current Level. Once per turn: You can target 1 monster your opponent controls; take control of it until the End Phase.', '9', '2900', '2500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('27279764', 'Apoqliphort Towers', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/27279764.jpg', 'Cannot be Special Summoned. Requires 3 "Qli" Tributes to Normal Summon/Set. If this card is Normal Summoned/Set, it is unaffected by Spell/Trap effects and by activated effects from any monster whose original Level/Rank is lower than this card''s current Level. All Special Summoned monsters lose 500 ATK and DEF. Once per turn: You can make your opponent send 1 monster from their hand or their side of the field to the Graveyard (their choice).', '10', '3000', '2600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('91392974', 'Apparition', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91392974.jpg', 'If a face-up "HERO" monster(s) you control is destroyed by battle or card effect: Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Vision HERO" monster from your Deck, then you can halve the original ATK/DEF of 1 monster your opponent controls. You can only activate 1 "Apparition" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('56132807', 'Apple Magician Girl', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/56132807.jpg', 'Once per turn, if this card is targeted for an attack: You can Special Summon 1 Level 5 or lower Spellcaster-Type monster from your hand, then change the attack target to it, and if you do, the attacking monster''s ATK becomes half its current ATK. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can target up to 3 other "Magician Girl" monsters with different names in your Graveyard; add them to your hand.', '3', '1200', '800', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('43341600', 'Apple of Enlightenment', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43341600.jpg', 'Target cards in your opponent''s GY, up to the number of "Valkyrie" monsters you control; banish them. If this Set card in its owner''s control has left the field because of an opponent''s effect, and is now in the GY or banished: You can draw cards equal to the number of "Valkyrie" monsters you control +1.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('5846183', 'Appliancer Breakerbuncle', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/5846183.jpg', 'During damage calculation, if an "Appliancer" monster you control battles an opponent''s monster (Quick Effect): You can discard this card; for that battle, that monster you control cannot be destroyed, also you take no battle damage. If an "Appliancer" monster(s) you control would be destroyed by a card effect, you can banish this card from your field or GY instead.', '1', '0', '0', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('78225596', 'Appliancer Celtopus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78225596.jpg', '2 "Appliancer" monsters\\r\\nThis linked card cannot be targeted by your opponent''s card effects, or their monsters'' attacks. During damage calculation, if an "Appliancer" Link Monster you control co-linked to this card battles an opponent''s monster: Your battling monster gains ATK equal to the number of monsters co-linked to this card x 1000, during that damage calculation only. Once per turn, if an "Appliancer" Link Monster(s) you control that is not co-linked to this card is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can draw 1 card.', '0', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('27157996', 'Appliancer Conversion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/27157996.jpg', 'Banish as many "Appliancer" Link Monsters from your Main Monster Zone as possible, then you can Special Summon your banished "Appliancer" Link Monsters up to the number banished by this effect. During your Main Phase, if this card is in your GY, except the turn it was sent there: You can banish 1 other "Appliancer" Spell/Trap from your GY; add this card to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Appliancer Conversion" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('41830887', 'Appliancer Copybokkle', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41830887.jpg', 'You can target 1 "Appliancer" monster you control; Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, this card''s name becomes that monster''s name until the End Phase. During your Main Phase, except the turn this card was sent to the GY: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 "Appliancer" monster you control; Special Summon 1 monster with the same name from your hand or GY. You can only use each effect of "Appliancer Copybokkle" once per turn.', '1', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('3507053', 'Appliancer Dryer Drake', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/3507053.jpg', '1 "Appliancer" monster\\r\\nCannot be used as Link Material the turn it is Link Summoned. This linked card gains 1000 ATK. Once per turn, during your Battle Phase, if this card is co-linked (except during the Damage Step): You can switch the locations of 2 "Appliancer" monsters in your Main Monster Zones, including this card, and if you do, the other monster can make a second attack during each Battle Phase this turn. Once per turn, when this card that is not co-linked is targeted for an attack: You can negate that attack.', '0', '0', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('3875465', 'Appliancer Electrilyrical World', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/3875465.jpg', 'When this card is activated: You can add 1 "Appliancer" card from your Deck to your hand, except a Field Spell. Once per turn, if you Link Summon an "Appliancer" Link Monster(s): You can add 1 "Appliancer" monster from your GY to your hand. Once per turn, when a monster declares an attack: You can move 1 "Appliancer" monster you control to another of your Main Monster Zones. You can only activate 1 "Appliancer Electrilyrical World" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('4729591', 'Appliancer Kappa Scale', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/4729591.jpg', '1 "Appliancer" monster\\r\\nCannot be used as Link Material the turn it is Link Summoned. You can Tribute this co-linked card; Special Summon 1 "Appliancer" Link Monster from your GY, except "Appliancer Kappa Scale". You can Tribute this card that is not co-linked; Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Appliancer" monster from your GY. You can only use each effect of "Appliancer Kappa Scale" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', 'WATER', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('77102944', 'Appliancer Laundry Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/77102944.jpg', '1 "Appliancer" monster\\r\\nCannot be used as Link Material the turn it is Link Summoned. Neither player takes any battle damage from attacks involving this card. Once per turn, after damage calculation, if this co-linked card battles an opponent''s monster: You can banish that opponent''s monster. Once per turn, after damage calculation, if this monster that is not co-linked battles an opponent''s monster: You can destroy that opponent''s monster, and if you do, inflict damage to your opponent equal to its original ATK.', '0', '1500', '0', 'WATER', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('81769387', 'Appliancer Propelion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/81769387.jpg', '1 "Appliancer" monster\\r\\nCannot be used as Link Material the turn it is Link Summoned. This card can attack directly. Once per turn, during damage calculation, if your monster battles an opponent''s monster, while this card is co-linked (Quick Effect): You can make that opponent''s monster''s ATK 0 during that damage calculation only. Once per turn, during damage calculation, if this monster that is not co-linked battles an opponent''s monster (Quick Effect): You can make that opponent''s monster''s ATK 0 during that damage calculation only.', '0', '1200', '0', 'WIND', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('30996652', 'Appliancer Reuse', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30996652.jpg', 'Target 1 "Appliancer" monster in your GY; Special Summon it, but place it on the bottom of the Deck when it leaves the field.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('78447174', 'Appliancer Socketroll', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78447174.jpg', 'If you control an "Appliancer" monster: You can Special Summon this card from your hand. If another "Appliancer Socketroll" is Special Summoned to your field while you control this monster (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon 1 "Appliancer Socketroll" from your Deck. You can only use each effect of "Appliancer Socketroll" once per turn.', '1', '100', '100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('66380357', 'Appliancer Test', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66380357.jpg', 'Target 1 "Appliancer" Link Monster you control; Special Summon as many Link-1 "Appliancer" monsters from your GY as possible to your zones that monster points to, but banish them during the End Phase. You can only activate 1 "Appliancer Test" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('30118200', 'Appliancer Vacculephant', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30118200.jpg', '1 "Appliancer" monster\\r\\nCannot be used as Link Material the turn it is Link Summoned. Can attack directly while it is not co-linked. You can send 1 card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy it. If this card is co-linked: You can target 1 monster in your opponent''s Main Monster Zone; destroy it. You can only use 1 "Appliancer Vacculephant" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '1000', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('43262273', 'Appointer of the Red Lotus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43262273.jpg', 'Pay 2000 Life Points and reveal all cards in your hand. Look at your opponent''s hand and select 1 card. Remove that card from play until your opponent''s next End Phase.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('30603688', 'Apprentice Illusion Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30603688.jpg', 'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by discarding 1 card. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Dark Magician" from your Deck to your hand. During damage calculation, if your other DARK Spellcaster monster battles an opponent''s monster (Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand or face-up field to the GY; that monster you control gains 2000 ATK/DEF during that damage calculation only.', '6', '2000', '1700', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('9156135', 'Apprentice Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/9156135.jpg', 'If this card is Summoned: Target 1 face-up card on the field that you can place a Spell Counter on; place 1 Spell Counter on that target. If this card is destroyed by battle: You can Special Summon 1 Level 2 or lower Spellcaster monster from your Deck in face-down Defense Position.', '2', '400', '800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('64977888', 'Apprentice Piper', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64977888.jpg', 'FLIP: You can Special Summon 1 monster from your hand.\\r\\nIf this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can Special Summon 1 monster from your hand.', '2', '100', '1500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('48539234', 'Appropriate', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/48539234.jpg', 'Activate only when your opponent draws a card(s) outside of either Draw Phase. After that, each time your opponent draws a card(s) outside of either Draw Phase, immediately draw 2 cards.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('96427353', 'Aqua Armor Ninja', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/96427353.jpg', 'When your opponent''s monster declares a direct attack, if you have another "Ninja" monster in your Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard to target the attacking monster; negate that attack.', '4', '800', '1600', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('95132338', 'Aqua Chorus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95132338.jpg', 'If there are monsters with the same name on the field, increase the ATK and DEF of all of those monsters with the same name by 500 points.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('59131526', 'Aqua Chorus Round', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59131526.jpg', 'Banish 1 card from your hand, and if you do, during your next Standby Phase, you can add up to 2 cards with the same name as that banished card from your Deck to your hand. If you activated this card while your opponent controlled no cards, for the rest of this turn you cannot activate cards, or the effects of cards, with the same original name as that banished card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('86164529', 'Aqua Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86164529.jpg', '"Fairy Dragon" + "Amazon of the Seas" + "Zone Eater"', '6', '2250', '1900', 'WATER', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('7653207', 'Aqua Jet', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/7653207.jpg', 'Target 1 face-up Fish, Sea Serpent, or Aqua-Type monster you control; it gains 1000 ATK.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('32278723', 'Aqua Jet Surface', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32278723.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower Fish, Sea Serpent, or Aqua monster from your hand or GY, but you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck, except Xyz Monsters, while you control that face-up monster. If your opponent controls an Attack Position monster: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 Fish, Sea Serpent, or Aqua monster you control; it gains 1000 ATK until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of "Aqua Jet Surface" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('85639257', 'Aqua Madoor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85639257.jpg', 'A wizard of the waters that conjures a liquid wall to crush any enemies that oppose him.', '4', '1200', '2000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('12436646', 'Aqua Snake', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12436646.jpg', '''''This monster hypnotizes an opponent with the ball on its tail and draws them to a watery doom.''''', '3', '1050', '900', 'WATER', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('40916023', 'Aqua Spirit', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40916023.jpg', 'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card can only be Special Summoned by removing from play 1 WATER monster in your Graveyard. During each of your opponent''s Standby Phases, you can change the battle position of 1 of your opponent''s face-up Monster Cards. Once changed, the monster must remain in this position for the rest of the turn.', '4', '1600', '1200', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('28325165', 'Aqua Story - Urashima', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/28325165.jpg', 'If you have an "Aquaactress" monster in your Graveyard: Target 1 monster on the field; until the end of this turn, its effects are negated, its ATK and DEF become 100, also it is unaffected by your opponent''s card effects.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('92053608', 'Aquaactress Arowana', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/92053608.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can add 1 "Aquaactress" monster from your Deck to your hand.', '6', '2000', '2000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('66668900', 'Aquaactress Guppy', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66668900.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can Special Summon 1 "Aquaactress" monster from your hand.', '2', '600', '600', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('39260991', 'Aquaactress Tetra', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/39260991.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can add 1 "Aquarium" card from your Deck to your hand.', '1', '300', '300', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('78910579', 'Aquamirror Cycle', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78910579.jpg', 'Target 1 WATER monster you control and 2 WATER monsters in your Graveyard; shuffle the first target into the Deck, and if you do, add the second targets to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('64437633', 'Aquamirror Illusion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64437633.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 "Gishki" Ritual Monster from your hand. It cannot attack, and is returned to the hand during the End Phase.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('46337945', 'Aquamirror Meditation', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46337945.jpg', 'Reveal 1 Ritual Spell Card in your hand to target 2 "Gishki" monsters in your Graveyard; return them to the hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('36151751', 'Arma Knight', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/36151751.jpg', '''''An ammonite warrior that has protected the seas throughout history.''''', '4', '1000', '1200', 'WATER', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('22377815', 'Aquarian Alessa', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22377815.jpg', 'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:\\n● When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard, they discard 1 random card.', '4', '1500', '500', 'WATER', NULL, 'Gemini Monster'),
('91831066', 'Aquarium Lighting', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91831066.jpg', 'If an "Aquaactress" monster you control battles an opponent''s monster, during damage calculation: Your battling monster''s ATK and DEF each become double its current ATK and DEF during that damage calculation only. If this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard: You can target 1 Aqua-Type monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it, also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except Aqua-Type monsters. You can only control 1 "Aquarium Lighting".', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('65446452', 'Aquarium Set', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65446452.jpg', 'All WATER monsters you control gain 300 ATK and DEF. All "Aquaactress" monsters you control gain 300 ATK and DEF. If this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard: You can target 1 Aqua-Type monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it, also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except Aqua-Type monsters.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('29047353', 'Aquarium Stage', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/29047353.jpg', 'WATER monsters you control cannot be destroyed by battle with a non-WATER monster. "Aquaactress" monsters you control are unaffected by your opponent''s monster effects. If this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard: You can target 1 Aqua-Type monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it, also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except Aqua-Type monsters.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('75771170', 'Arahime the Manifested Mikanko', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75771170.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with "Mikanko Kagura". Cannot be destroyed by battle, also your opponent takes any battle damage you would have taken from battles involving this card. If you have this card in your hand or GY, and another "Mikanko" card in your GY: You can target 1 face-up monster on the field; equip this card to it as an Equip Spell. You can only use this effect of "Arahime the Manifested Mikanko" once per turn. Once per turn, during the End Phase, while this card is equipped to a monster: You can return this card and the equipped monster to the hand.', '9', '0', '0', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('16889337', 'Aratama', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/16889337.jpg', 'Cannot be Special Summoned. During the End Phase of the turn this card is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up: Return it to the hand. When this card is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up: You can add 1 Spirit monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Aratama".', '4', '800', '1800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Spirit Monster'),
('57964143', 'Arbitration of White', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57964143.jpg', 'You can target 1 Fish monster you control; it is treated as a Tuner this turn. When an opponent''s monster declares an attack: You can discard 1 Fish monster; change all monsters your opponent controls to Defense Position. If your Fish monster is destroyed by battle or sent to your GY: You can send this face-up card from your Spell & Trap Zone to the GY; Special Summon 1 Fish monster from your GY. You can only use each effect of "Arbitration of White" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('64276752', 'Arc Rebellion Xyz Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64276752.jpg', '3 Level 5 monsters\\r\\nThis Xyz Summoned card cannot be destroyed by card effects. You can detach 1 material from this card; this card gains ATK equal to the total original ATK of all other monsters on the field, then, if this card has a DARK Xyz Monster as material, negate the effects of all other face-up monsters on the field. After this effect resolves, you cannot declare attacks with other monsters for the rest of this turn. You can only use this effect of "Arc Rebellion Xyz Dragon" once per turn.', '5', '3000', '2500', 'DARK', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('99189322', 'Arcana Call', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/99189322.jpg', 'Select 1 "Arcana Force" monster you control. Remove from play 1 "Arcana Force" monster from either player''s Graveyard. Until the End Phase, the selected monster''s effect becomes the removed monster''s effect for the same coin toss result.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('64454614', 'Arcana Extra Joker', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64454614.jpg', '3 Warrior monsters with different names\\r\\nOnce per turn, when a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, is activated that targets this face-up card on the field or a monster this card points to (Quick Effect): You can discard the same type of card (Monster, Spell, or Trap); negate the activation. When this Link Summoned card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: You can Special Summon 1 Level 4 Warrior Normal Monster from your Deck, and if you do, add 1 Level 4 Warrior monster from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '2800', '0', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('62892347', 'Arcana Force 0 - The Fool', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/62892347.jpg', 'This card cannot be destroyed by battle. This card cannot be changed to Defense Position, except with a card effect. When this card is Summoned: Toss a coin and gain the appropriate effect. ● Heads: Negate your card effects that target this card, and destroy them. ● Tails: Negate your opponent''s card effects that target this card, and destroy them.', '1', '0', '0', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('12686296', 'Arcana Force EX - The Chaos Ruler', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12686296.jpg', '3 "Arcana Force" monsters with different names\\r\\nMust be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by sending the above cards from either field to the GY. If this card is Special Summoned: Toss a coin.\\r\\n● Heads: Special Summon 1 Level 10 "Arcana Force" monster from your hand or Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions.\\r\\n● Tails: Add 1 card from your Deck to your hand that has a coin tossing effect.\\r\\nWhile "Light Barrier" is in the Field Zone, your opponent cannot activate the effects of monsters on the field.', '10', '3300', '3300', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('69831560', 'Arcana Force EX - The Dark Ruler', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/69831560.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by sending 3 monsters you control to the Graveyard, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. When this card is Special Summoned: Toss a coin and gain the appropriate effect.\\n● Heads: This card can make a second attack during each Battle Phase, but if it does so using this effect, change it to Defense Position at the end of the Battle Phase. Its battle position cannot be changed until the end of your next turn.\\n● Tails: If this card is destroyed, destroy all cards on the field.', '10', '4000', '4000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('88033975', 'Armades, Keeper of Boundaries', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/88033975.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters\\nIf this card attacks or is attacked, your opponent cannot activate cards or effects until the end of the Damage Step.', '5', '2300', '1500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('5861892', 'Arcana Force EX - The Light Ruler', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/5861892.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by sending 3 monsters you control to the Graveyard, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. When this card is Special Summoned: Toss a coin and gain the appropriate effect.\\n● Heads: When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard: You can target 1 card in your Graveyard; add that target to your hand.\\n● Tails: During either player''s turn, when a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, that targets this card is activated: This card loses exactly 1000 ATK and you negate the activation, and if you do, destroy it.', '10', '4000', '4000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('8396952', 'Arcana Force I - The Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/8396952.jpg', 'When this card is Summoned, toss a coin:\\n● Heads: When a Spell Card is activated, this card''s ATK becomes double its original ATK until the End Phase of that turn.\\n● Tails: When a Spell Card is activated, your opponent gains 500 Life Points.', '4', '1100', '1100', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('35781051', 'Arcana Force III - The Empress', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/35781051.jpg', 'When this card is Summoned, toss a coin: ● Heads: Each time your opponent Normal Summons or Sets a monster, you can Special Summon 1 "Arcana Force" monster from your hand. ● Tails: Each time your opponent Normal Summons or Sets a monster, send 1 card from your hand to the Graveyard.', '4', '1300', '1300', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('61175706', 'Arcana Force IV - The Emperor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/61175706.jpg', 'When this card is Summoned, toss a coin: ● Heads: All "Arcana Force" monsters you control gain 500 ATK. ● Tails: All "Arcana Force" monsters you control lose 500 ATK.', '4', '1400', '1400', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('3376703', 'Arcana Force V - The Hierophant', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/3376703.jpg', 'You can discard this card; this turn, your opponent cannot activate cards or effects when an "Arcana Force" monster(s) is Summoned to your field. If this card is Summoned: Toss a coin.\\r\\n● Heads: Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Arcana Force" monster from your Deck with a different name from the monsters you control and in your GY.\\r\\n● Tails: Special Summon 1 "Arcana Force" monster from your Deck to your opponent''s field.', '4', '1500', '1500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('97574404', 'Arcana Force VI - The Lovers', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/97574404.jpg', 'When this card is Summoned, toss a coin: ● Heads: This card can be treated as 2 Tributes for the Tribute Summon of an "Arcana Force" monster. ● Tails: You cannot Tribute Summon "Arcana Force" monsters.', '4', '1600', '1600', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('34568403', 'Arcana Force VII - The Chariot', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/34568403.jpg', 'When this card is Summoned, toss a coin:\\n● Heads: If this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle, you can Special Summon that monster to your side of the field.\\n● Tails: Your opponent gains control of this card.', '4', '1700', '1700', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('60953118', 'Arcana Force XIV - Temperance', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/60953118.jpg', 'During damage calculation, in either player''s turn: You can discard this card; you take no Battle Damage from that battle. When this card is Summoned: Toss a coin and apply this effect. The effect lasts while this card is face-up on the field.\\n● Heads: Halve all Battle Damage you take.\\n● Tails: Halve all Battle Damage your opponent takes.', '6', '2400', '2400', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('39761418', 'Arcana Force XIX - The Sun', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/39761418.jpg', 'If a card that has a coin tossing effect is on the field: You can Special Summon this card from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Arcana Force XIX - The Sun" once per turn. If this card is Summoned: Toss a coin.\\r\\n● Heads: Set 1 Spell from your Deck that has a coin tossing effect.\\r\\n● Tails: Destroy all cards in the Spell & Trap Zones.', '7', '2900', '2900', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('59712426', 'Arcana Force XV - The Fiend', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59712426.jpg', 'You can discard this card; add 1 "Light Barrier" from your Deck or GY to your hand. If this card is Summoned: Toss a coin and this card gains the appropriate effect.\\r\\n● Heads: When an attack is declared involving this card: You can target 1 monster on the field; destroy it, and if you do, inflict 500 damage to its controller.\\r\\n● Tails: If an attack is declared involving this card: Destroy all monsters on the field.', '7', '2500', '2500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('97452817', 'Arcana Force XVIII - The Moon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/97452817.jpg', 'When this card is Summoned, toss a coin: ● Heads: During your Standby Phase, you can Special Summon 1 "Moon Token" (Fairy-Type/LIGHT/Level 1/ATK 0/DEF 0). ● Tails: During each of your End Phases, select 1 monster you control and give control of it to your opponent.', '7', '2800', '2800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('23846921', 'Arcana Force XXI - The World', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/23846921.jpg', 'When this card is Summoned, toss a coin: ● Heads: During your End Phase, you can send 2 monsters you control to the Graveyard to skip your opponent''s next turn. ● Tails: During your opponent''s Draw Phase, add the top card of their Graveyard to their hand.', '8', '3100', '3100', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('6150044', 'Arcana Knight Joker', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/6150044.jpg', '"Queen''s Knight" + "Jack''s Knight" + "King''s Knight"\\r\\nA Fusion Summon of this card can only be done with the above materials. Once per turn, when a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, is activated that targets this face-up card on the field (Quick Effect): You can discard the same type of card (Monster, Spell, or Trap); negate the effect.', '9', '3800', '2500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
