('22796548', 'Archfiend''s Oath', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22796548.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can pay 500 Life Points, then declare 1 card name; excavate the top card of your Deck, and if it is the declared card, add it to your hand. Otherwise, send it to the Graveyard.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('56246017', 'Archfiend''s Roar', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/56246017.jpg', 'Pay 500 Life Points, then target 1 "Archfiend" monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon that target. It cannot be Tributed. Destroy it during the End Phase of this turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('21438286', 'Archfiend''s Staff of Despair', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/21438286.jpg', 'Equip only to a monster you control. During your Main Phase: You can make all monsters your opponent currently controls lose ATK equal to half the equipped monster''s ATK, until the end of this turn (even if this card leaves the field). If this card is sent to the GY while equipped to a monster: You can pay 1000 LP; return this card to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Archfiend''s Staff of Despair" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('90764871', 'Archfiend''s Strategy Game', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90764871.jpg', 'Fiend monsters in the Extra Monster Zone gain 1000 ATK. You can activate 1 of these effects;\\r\\n● Banish 1 Fiend monster or "Archfiend" card from your hand or GY; add 1 "Archfiend" card from your Deck to your hand, except a Field Spell.\\r\\n● Add 1 "Archfiend" Pendulum Monster from your Deck to your Extra Deck face-up.\\r\\nYou can only use this effect of "Archfiend''s Strategy Game" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('86915847', 'Armored Bee', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86915847.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; halve that target''s ATK until the End Phase.', '4', '1600', '1200', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('13379114', 'Archfiend''s Vigor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/13379114.jpg', 'If you control an "Archfiend" Ritual Monster in the Extra Monster Zone: You can target 1 face-up card your opponent controls; negate its effects until the end of this turn. If this card is banished from the hand or field: You can add 1 "Archfiend" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Archfiend''s Vigor". You can only use each effect of "Archfiend''s Vigor" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('59509952', 'Archlord Kristya', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59509952.jpg', 'If you have exactly 4 Fairy monsters in your GY, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). If Summoned this way: Target 1 Fairy monster in your GY; add that target to your hand. Neither player can Special Summon monsters. If this face-up card would be sent from the field to the GY, place it on top of the Deck, instead.', '8', '2800', '2300', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('18378582', 'Archlord Zerato', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/18378582.jpg', 'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card cannot be Special Summoned except by Tributing 1 face-up "Warrior of Zera" on your side of the field while "The Sanctuary in the Sky" is on the field. If "The Sanctuary in the Sky" is on your side of the field, by discarding 1 LIGHT Monster Card from your hand to the Graveyard, destroy all monsters on your opponent''s side of the field. If "The Sanctuary in the Sky" is not on your side of the field, this effect is not applied.', '8', '2800', '2300', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('33212663', 'Archnemeses Eschatos', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33212663.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing 3 monsters with different Types from your GY and/or face-up field. Cannot be destroyed by card effects. You can declare 1 Monster Type on the field; destroy all monsters on the field with that Type, also until the end of the next turn, neither player can Special Summon monsters with that Type. You can only use this effect of "Archnemeses Eschatos" once per turn.', '11', '3000', '2500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('6728559', 'Archnemeses Protos', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/6728559.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing 3 monsters with different Attributes from your GY and/or face-up field. Cannot be destroyed by card effects. You can declare 1 monster Attribute on the field; destroy all monsters on the field with that Attribute, also until the end of the next turn, neither player can Special Summon monsters with that Attribute. You can only use this effect of "Archnemeses Protos" once per turn.', '11', '2500', '3000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('38173725', 'Arcjet Lightcraft', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38173725.jpg', 'If you control no monsters, you can Normal Summon this card without Tributing. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can target 1 Level 8 or lower Machine monster in your GY; Special Summon it in Defense Position, and if you do, its Level becomes 9, also negate its effects. You can only use this effect of "Arcjet Lightcraft" once per turn. You cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck, except Machine Xyz Monsters.', '9', '0', '2100', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('40725446', 'Arequus the Shining Mars Saint', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40725446.jpg', 'If you control a face-up card in your Spell & Trap Zone, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You can only Special Summon "Arequus the Shining Mars Saint" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of "Arequus the Shining Mars Saint" once per turn. You can target 1 face-up Spell/Trap you control; destroy both it and this card, then draw 1 card. If this card is destroyed: You can target 1 Xyz Monster you control; attach this card to it.', '5', '2000', '1800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('40706444', 'Argostars - Adventurous Arion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40706444.jpg', '2 Level 4 monsters\\r\\nOnce per turn, you can also Xyz Summon "Argostars - Adventurous Arion" by using 1 "Argostars" monster you control (transfer its materials to this card). If this card is Xyz Summoned: You can add 1 "Argostars" Spell from your Deck to your hand. During the Standby Phase: You can detach 2 materials from this card; place up to 3 "Argostars" Continuous Traps from your GY, face-up in your Spell & Trap Zone. You can only use each effect of "Argostars - Adventurous Arion" once per turn.', '4', '2200', '2200', 'DARK', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('21050476', 'Argostars - Fierce Parthe', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/21050476.jpg', 'Gains 700 ATK/DEF for each "Argostars" monster with a different name you control, except this card. You can only use each of the following effects of "Argostars - Fierce Parthe" once per turn. (Quick Effect): You can reveal this card in your hand; return 1 "Argostars" Continuous Trap you control to the hand, and if you do, Special Summon this card. You can banish this card you control; Set 1 Continuous Trap from your hand. It can be activated this turn.', '4', '1400', '1400', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('30964246', 'Argostars - Giantslaying', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30964246.jpg', 'Add 1 "Argostars" monster from your Deck to your hand, then immediately after this effect resolves, if a Continuous Trap is in your Monster Zone, or a Continuous Trap with an effect that Special Summons itself as a monster is in your Spell & Trap Zone, you can Normal Summon 1 Warrior monster. During your Main Phase: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 2 cards on the field, including an "Argostars" Continuous Trap you control; return them to the hand. You can only use 1 "Argostars - Giantslaying" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('91438674', 'Argostars - Glorious Adra', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91438674.jpg', 'During your opponent''s turn, if you control a Continuous Trap Card (Quick Effect): You can banish this card from your hand; make the ATK of 1 monster on the field 0 until the end of this turn. If this card is Normal Summoned: This turn, your opponent cannot activate cards or effects in response to the activation of your Continuous Trap Cards or their effects. You can banish this card you control; place up to 2 "Argostars" Continuous Traps with different names from your hand and/or Deck face-up in your Spell & Trap Zone. You can only use this effect of "Argostars - Glorious Adra" once per turn.', '4', '1800', '1800', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('2674965', 'Argostars - Home Stadium', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/2674965.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can pay 1000 LP; add 1 "Argostars" card from your GY or banishment to your hand. Each time a Continuous Trap in the Spell & Trap Zone is Special Summoned to your field, inflict 500 damage to your opponent. Once per Chain, if a Continuous Trap activates its effect in your Monster Zone, while you have a banished "Argostars" monster: You can target 1 face-up card your opponent controls; negate its effects until the end of this turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('90374791', 'Armed Changer', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90374791.jpg', 'Send 1 Equip Spell Card from your hand to the Graveyard to activate this card. If the equipped monster destroys a monster by battle, the controller of this Equip Card can add 1 monster with ATK equal to or less than the equipped monster from their Graveyard to their hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('65889305', 'Argostars - Lightning Tydeu', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65889305.jpg', 'While this card is face-up in the Spell & Trap Zone, Warrior monsters you control gain 500 ATK/DEF. Once per turn: You can discard 1 card; Special Summon this card as an Effect Monster (Warrior/LIGHT/Level 4/ATK 2000/DEF 2000) with the following effect (this card is also still a Trap), then you can add 1 "Argostars" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Argostars - Lightning Tydeu".\\r\\n● Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can place this card face-up in your Spell & Trap Zone.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('38379052', 'Argostars - Slayer Eteo', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38379052.jpg', 'While this card is face-up in the Spell & Trap Zone, Warrior monsters you control cannot be destroyed by card effects. Once per turn, when your opponent activates a card or effect: You can Special Summon this card as an Effect Monster (Warrior/LIGHT/Level 4/ATK 800/DEF 800) with the following effect (this card is also still a Trap), then if you have a banished "Argostars" monster, you can return 1 card on the field to the hand.\\r\\n● Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can place this card face-up in your Spell & Trap Zone.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('91284003', 'Argostars - Swift Capane', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91284003.jpg', 'While this card is face-up in the Spell & Trap Zone, Warrior monsters you control cannot be destroyed by battle. Once per turn, if a Continuous Trap is in a Monster Zone: You can Special Summon this card as an Effect Monster (Warrior/LIGHT/Level 4/ATK 1800/DEF 1800) with the following effect (this card is also still a Trap), then if you have a banished "Argostars" monster, you gain 500 LP.\\r\\n● Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can place this card face-up in your Spell & Trap Zone.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('40502912', 'Aria the Melodious Diva', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40502912.jpg', 'While this Special Summoned card is on the field, "Melodious" monsters you control cannot be targeted by card effects, or be destroyed by battle.', '4', '1600', '1200', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('75730490', 'Ariane the Labrynth Servant', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75730490.jpg', 'You can send 1 Normal Trap from your hand or that''s Set on your field to the GY; Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower Fiend monster from your Deck in Defense Position, except "Ariane the Labrynth Servant". If another monster(s) leaves the field by your Normal Trap effect (except during the Damage Step): You can draw 1 card, then you can apply this effect.\\r\\n● From your hand, either Special Summon 1 Fiend monster, or Set 1 Spell/Trap.\\r\\nYou can only use each effect of "Ariane the Labrynth Servant" once per turn.', '4', '1800', '1100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('1225009', 'Arianna the Labrynth Servant', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1225009.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Labrynth" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Arianna the Labrynth Servant". If another monster(s) leaves the field by your Normal Trap effect (except during the Damage Step): You can draw 1 card, then you can apply this effect.\\r\\n● From your hand, either Special Summon 1 Fiend monster, or Set 1 Spell/Trap.\\r\\nYou can only use 1 "Arianna the Labrynth Servant" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '4', '1600', '2100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('73602965', 'Arias the Labrynth Butler', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/73602965.jpg', 'During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand or field to the GY; Special Summon 1 "Labrynth" monster, or Set 1 Normal Trap, from your hand. The Set Normal Trap can be activated this turn. When your opponent activates a card or effect in response to your card or effect activation of a Normal Trap or a "Labrynth" card, except "Arias the Labrynth Butler" (Quick Effect): You can activate this effect in the GY; Special Summon this card. You can only use each effect of "Arias the Labrynth Butler" once per turn.', '6', '1500', '2500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('56827051', 'Ariel, Priestess of the Nekroz', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/56827051.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can reveal any number of "Nekroz" cards in your hand; increase or reduce this card''s Level by the number of revealed cards until the end of this turn. If this card is Tributed by a card effect: You can add 1 "Nekroz" monster from your Deck to your hand, except a Ritual Monster. You can only use this effect of "Ariel, Priestess of the Nekroz" once per turn.', '4', '1000', '1800', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('65910922', 'Arionpos, Serpent of the Ghoti', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65910922.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nIf this card is Synchro Summoned: You can banish 1 Level 6 or lower Fish monster from your Deck. If this card is sent to the GY as Synchro Material: You can target 1 Fish monster in your GY; banish that target, then you can add 1 Fish monster with an equal or lower Level from your Deck to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Arionpos, Serpent of the Ghoti" once per turn.', '6', '2100', '0', 'WATER', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('29904964', 'Arisen Gaia the Fierce Knight', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/29904964.jpg', 'If your opponent controls more monsters than you do, you can Normal Summon this card without Tributing. If this card is Tributed: You can Special Summon 1 "Black Luster Soldier" monster from your hand or Graveyard. You can only use this effect of "Arisen Gaia the Fierce Knight" once per turn. When you Ritual Summon a "Black Luster Soldier" monster, you can banish this card from your Graveyard as 1 of the monsters required for the Ritual Summon.', '7', '2300', '2100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('33282498', 'Arkbrave Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33282498.jpg', 'If this card is Special Summoned from the Graveyard: You can banish as many face-up Spell/Trap Cards your opponent controls as possible, and if you do, this card gains 200 ATK and DEF for each card banished. Once per turn, during the Standby Phase, if this card is in the Graveyard because it was sent there last turn: You can target 1 Level 7 or 8 Dragon-Type monster in your Graveyard, except "Arkbrave Dragon"; Special Summon it.', '7', '2400', '2000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('50687050', 'Arktos XII - Chronochasm Vaylantz', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/50687050.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nYou can activate 1 of these effects;\\r\\n● Special Summon this card to your Main Monster Zone in its same column.\\r\\n● Move 1 monster in your Main Monster Zone to an adjacent (horizontal) Monster Zone.\\r\\nYou can only use this effect of "Arktos XII - Chronochasm Vaylantz" once per turn.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\n2 Level 5 or higher "Vaylantz" monsters\\r\\nMust first be Special Summoned (from your face-down Extra Deck) by Tributing the above cards. (Quick Effect): You can switch the locations of 2 monsters in your Main Monster Zones or 2 monsters in your opponent''s Main Monster Zones. If a card in the Monster Zone moves to another Monster Zone (except during the Damage Step): You can destroy 1 card on the field. You can only use each effect of "Arktos XII - Chronochasm Vaylantz" once per turn.', '12', '3000', '3000', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Fusion Monster'),
('14708569', 'Arlownay', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14708569.jpg', '''''A lady monster dwelling in a flower, she sprinkles the air with poisonous pollen.''''', '3', '800', '1000', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('61606250', 'Armed Dragon Blitz', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/61606250.jpg', 'Target 1 "Armed Dragon" monster you control; take 1 monster with the same name from your Deck or GY, and either add it to your hand or Special Summon it, ignoring its Summoning conditions, but it cannot attack directly. You can only activate 1 "Armed Dragon Blitz" per turn. You cannot Special Summon monsters the turn you activate this card, except Dragon monsters.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('75906310', 'Armed Dragon Catapult Cannon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75906310.jpg', '"VWXYZ-Dragon Catapult Cannon" + "Armed Dragon LV7"\\r\\nMust first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) during a Duel you Special Summoned both the above cards, by banishing the above cards from your field and/or GY. (You do not use "Polymerization".) Your opponent cannot activate cards or effects with the same name as any banished card. Once per turn, during your opponent''s turn (Quick Effect): You can banish 1 card from your Deck or Extra Deck, face-up; banish all cards your opponent controls and in their GY.', '10', '3500', '3000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('34611551', 'Armed Dragon Flash', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/34611551.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 Level 3 "Armed Dragon" monster from your Deck in Defense Position. You can only activate 1 "Armed Dragon Flash" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('97091969', 'Armed Dragon Lightning', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/97091969.jpg', 'If an "Armed Dragon" monster(s) you control would be destroyed by card effect, you can send this card to the GY instead. You can target 1 "Armed Dragon" monster you control, then activate 1 of these effects;\\r\\n● It gains ATK equal to its Level x 100 (even if this card leaves the field).\\r\\n● Add 1 "Armed Dragon" monster with an equal or lower Level than it from your GY to your hand.\\r\\nYou can only use this effect of "Armed Dragon Lightning" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('59464593', 'Armed Dragon LV10', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59464593.jpg', 'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card cannot be Special Summoned except by Tributing 1 "Armed Dragon LV7". You can send 1 card from your hand to the Graveyard to destroy all face-up monsters your opponent controls.', '10', '3000', '2000', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('84425220', 'Armed Dragon LV10 White', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/84425220.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned by its own effect. You can banish "Armed Dragon" monsters from your field and/or GY whose total Levels equal 10; Special Summon this card from your hand, then you can add 1 "White Veil" from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Armed Dragon LV10 White" once per turn. You take no effect damage. At the start of the Damage Step, if this card attacks: You can destroy 1 card on the field.', '10', '3000', '2000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('980973', 'Armed Dragon LV3', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/980973.jpg', 'During your Standby Phase: You can send this card to the GY; Special Summon 1 "Armed Dragon LV5" from your hand or Deck.', '3', '1200', '900', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('46384672', 'Armed Dragon LV5', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46384672.jpg', 'You can send 1 monster from your hand to the GY, then target 1 monster your opponent controls with ATK less than or equal to the sent monster''s ATK; destroy that target. During the End Phase, if this card destroyed a monster by battle this turn: You can send this card to the GY; Special Summon 1 "Armed Dragon LV7" from your hand or Deck.', '5', '2400', '1700', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('73879377', 'Armed Dragon LV7', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/73879377.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned by "Armed Dragon LV5". You can send 1 monster from your hand to the GY; destroy all monsters your opponent controls with ATK less than or equal to that sent monster''s ATK.', '7', '2800', '1000', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('58153103', 'Armed Dragon Thunder LV10', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/58153103.jpg', 'If this card was Special Summoned by the effect of an "Armed Dragon" monster, it gains the following effects based on its ATK.\\r\\n● 1+: Its name becomes "Armed Dragon LV10". ● 10+: Control of it cannot switch. ● 100+: Cannot be destroyed by battle. ● 1000+: Once per opponent''s turn (Quick Effect): You can send 1 card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 other card on the field; destroy it, and if you do, this card gains 1000 ATK. ● 10000+: Once per turn: You can destroy all other cards on the field.', '10', '3000', '2000', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('57030525', 'Armed Dragon Thunder LV3', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57030525.jpg', 'This card''s name becomes "Armed Dragon LV3" while on the field or in the GY. You can only use each of the following effects of "Armed Dragon Thunder LV3" once per turn. You can send 1 monster from your hand to the GY; send this card from the field to the GY, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Level 5 or lower "Armed Dragon" monster from your hand or Deck. If this card is sent to the GY to activate a Dragon monster''s effect: You can draw 1 card.', '3', '1200', '900', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('21546416', 'Armed Dragon Thunder LV5', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/21546416.jpg', 'This card''s name becomes "Armed Dragon LV5" while on the field or in the GY. You can only use each of the following effects of "Armed Dragon Thunder LV5" once per turn. You can send 1 monster from your hand to the GY; send this card from the field to the GY, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Level 7 or lower "Armed Dragon" monster from your hand or Deck. If this card is sent to the GY to activate a Dragon monster''s effect: You can add 1 Level 5 or higher WIND Dragon monster from your Deck to your hand.', '5', '2400', '1700', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('94141712', 'Armed Dragon Thunder LV7', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94141712.jpg', 'This card''s name becomes "Armed Dragon LV7" while on the field or in the GY. You can only use each of the following effects of "Armed Dragon Thunder LV7" once per turn. You can send 1 monster from your hand to the GY; send this card from the field to the GY, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Level 10 or lower "Armed Dragon" monster from your hand or Deck. If this card is sent to the GY to activate a Dragon monster''s effect: You can add 1 "Armed Dragon" card from your Deck to your hand.', '7', '2800', '1000', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('57605303', 'Armed Dragon Thunderbolt', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57605303.jpg', 'Target 1 "Armed Dragon" monster you control; it gains 1000 ATK for each "Armed Dragon" monster in your GY with an equal or lower Level than it and with different names from each other, also for the rest of this turn, your opponent takes no battle damage from its attacks. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 "Armed Dragon" Spell in your GY; add it to your hand. You can only use 1 "Armed Dragon Thunderbolt" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('75220074', 'Armed Dragon, the Armored Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75220074.jpg', 'When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle: You can Special Summon 1 Level 5 or lower WIND Dragon monster from your hand or Deck, except "Armed Dragon, the Armored Dragon", but it cannot attack directly this turn.', '4', '1900', '1400', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('31817415', 'Armed Neos', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31817415.jpg', '"Elemental HERO Neos" + 1 "Armed Dragon" monster\\r\\nMust be Fusion Summoned. If this card is Special Summoned: You can choose 1 Dragon monster in your GY and destroy all monsters your opponent controls with an equal or lower Level than it. When this card destroys a monster by battle: You can make this card gain the following effect.\\r\\n● During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 "Elemental HERO" Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions.', '10', '3500', '3000', 'WIND', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('9076207', 'Armed Ninja', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/9076207.jpg', 'FLIP: Target 1 Spell Card on the field; destroy that target. (If the target is Set, reveal it, and destroy it if it is a Spell Card. Otherwise, return it to its original position.)', '1', '300', '300', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('29330706', 'Armed Protector Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/29330706.jpg', 'Face-up Equip Cards you control cannot be destroyed by card effects. This card gains 500 ATK for each Equip Card equipped to this card.', '8', '2000', '2800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('21056275', 'Armed Rebeellion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/21056275.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 Insect monster with 1000 or less ATK from your hand or Deck, then if you Special Summoned from the Deck, send 1 monster you control to the GY, also you cannot Special Summon for the rest of this turn after this card resolves, except Insect monsters. If a face-up Insect Synchro Monster(s) you control is destroyed by battle or card effect, while this card is in your GY: You can banish this card; add 1 "Summoning Swarm" from your Deck to your hand. You can only activate 1 "Armed Rebeellion" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('84430950', 'Armed Samurai - Ben Kei', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/84430950.jpg', 'For each Equip Card equipped to this card, it gains 1 additional attack during each Battle Phase.', '4', '500', '800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
