('38148100', 'Aromaseraphy Rosemary', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38148100.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters\\nWhile your LP is higher than your opponent''s, all Plant-Type monsters you control gain 500 ATK and DEF. Once per turn, if you gain LP: Target 1 face-up card your opponent controls; that face-up card has its effects negated until the end of this turn.', '5', '2000', '900', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
