('78161361', 'Bravedrive', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78161361.jpg', 'Once per turn, when your Cyberse monster declares an attack: You can discard 1 monster; that attacking monster gains 600 ATK, until the end of this turn.', '4', '1500', '1000', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
