('55838342', 'Crusadia Krawler', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/55838342.jpg', 'Special Summon this card as an Effect Monster (Insect/EARTH/Level 2/ATK 300/DEF 2100). (This card is also still a Trap.) If this card is Special Summoned by this effect to a zone a Link Monster points to: You can add 1 "World Legacy" card from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
