('87259933', 'Crystal Conclave', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/87259933.jpg', 'Once per turn, if a face-up "Crystal Beast" monster(s) you control is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can Special Summon 1 "Crystal Beast" monster from your Deck. You can send this face-up card from the field to the GY, then target 1 "Crystal Beast" card you control and 1 card on the field; return them to the hand. You cannot activate these effects in the same Chain.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
