('49202331', 'CXyz Skypalace Babylon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/49202331.jpg', '3 Level 11 monsters\\nWhen this card destroys a monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard: Inflict damage to your opponent equal to half the original ATK of the destroyed monster in the Graveyard. If this card has "Skypalace Gangaridai" as an Xyz Material, it gains this effect.\\n● Once per turn, if this card destroys a monster by battle: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; it can make a second attack in a row.', '11', '3800', '4000', 'WIND', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('77235086', 'Cyber Angel Benten', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/77235086.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with "Machine Angel Ritual". If this card destroys a monster by battle and sends it to the GY: Inflict damage to your opponent equal to that monster''s original DEF in the GY. If this card is Tributed: You can add 1 LIGHT Fairy monster from your Deck to your hand.', '6', '1800', '1500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
