('93317313', 'D/D Defense Soldier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/93317313.jpg', 'You can activate 1 of these effects;\\r\\n● Target 1 "D/D" card in your Pendulum Zone; Special Summon it.\\r\\n● Banish 1 "D/D" monster from your GY; if your "D/D/D" monster attacks this turn, your opponent cannot activate cards or effects until the end of the Damage Step.\\r\\nYou can banish this card from your GY; add 1 "D/D" Pendulum Monster from your face-up Extra Deck or GY to your hand. You can only use each effect of "D/D Defense Soldier" once per turn.', '4', '0', '1800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
