('19580308', 'D/D Lamia', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/19580308.jpg', 'If this card is in your hand or Graveyard: You can send 1 "D/D" or "Dark Contract" card from your hand or face-up from your field to the Graveyard, except "D/D Lamia"; Special Summon this card, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use this effect of "D/D Lamia" once per turn.', '1', '100', '1900', 'DARK', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
