('72291412', 'D/D Necro Slime', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/72291412.jpg', 'If this card is in your Graveyard: You can Fusion Summon 1 "D/D/D" Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, by banishing Fusion Materials listed on it from your Graveyard, including this card. You can only use this effect of "D/D Necro Slime" once per turn.', '1', '300', '300', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
