('99745551', 'Danger!? Tsuchinoko?', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/99745551.jpg', 'You can reveal this card in your hand; your opponent randomly chooses 1 card from your entire hand, then you discard the chosen card. Then, if the discarded card was not "Danger!? Tsuchinoko?", Special Summon 1 "Danger!? Tsuchinoko?" from your hand, and if you do, draw 1 card. If this card is discarded: You can Special Summon this card. You can only use this effect of "Danger!? Tsuchinoko?" once per turn.', '3', '1300', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('80071763', 'Dark Balter the Terrible', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/80071763.jpg', '"Possessed Dark Soul" + "Frontier Wiseman"\\nA Fusion Summon of this monster can only be conducted with the above Fusion Material Monsters. When a Normal Spell Card is activated, negate the effect by paying 1000 Life Points. The effect of an Effect Monster that this monster destroys as a result of battle is negated.', '5', '2000', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('58468105', 'Dangerous Frightfur Nightmary', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/58468105.jpg', '1 "Edge Imp" monster + 2 "Fluffal" monsters\\r\\nGains 300 ATK for each Fairy and Fiend monster in your GY, during your turn only. When this Fusion Summoned card destroys a monster by battle: You can send "Frightfur", "Fluffal", and/or "Edge Imp" monsters from your Deck to the GY, equal to the original Level of that destroyed monster. When your opponent activates a card or effect that targets this card on the field (Quick Effect): You can banish 1 "Frightfur" monster from your Extra Deck; negate that effect.', '10', '2000', '3000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('76895648', 'Dangerous Machine Type-6', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/76895648.jpg', 'During each of your Standby Phases: Roll a six-sided die and apply the result.\\n● 1: Discard 1 card.\\n● 2: Your opponent discards 1 card.\\n● 3: Draw 1 card.\\n● 4: Your opponent draws 1 card.\\n● 5: Destroy 1 monster your opponent controls.\\n● 6: Destroy this card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('22082432', 'Dangers of the Divine', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22082432.jpg', 'Pay half your LP, then Tribute 1 monster; Special Summon 1 "The Winged Dragon of Ra" from your hand or banishment, ignoring its Summoning conditions, and make its ATK/DEF 4000, but it cannot attack, also during the End Phase of the next turn, return it to the hand. If this card is sent from the field to the GY: Choose 1 "The Winged Dragon of Ra" in your Monster Zone and send all other monsters on the field to the GY. You can only use each effect of "Dangers of the Divine" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('48588176', 'Danipon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/48588176.jpg', 'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: You can add 1 Insect monster with 1000 or less DEF from your Deck to your hand.', '2', '600', '600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('66192538', 'Danmari @Ignister', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66192538.jpg', 'When an attack is declared involving your "@Ignister" monster: You can Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, negate that attack. While you control a Link-6 monster (Quick Effect): You can banish this card from your field or GY, then target 1 face-up card your opponent controls; negate its effects until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of "Danmari @Ignister" once per turn.', '6', '2300', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('18386170', 'Dante, Pilgrim of the Burning Abyss', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/18386170.jpg', '3 "Burning Abyss" monsters with different names\\nMust be Fusion Summoned and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. Cannot be targeted by an opponent''s card effects. Once per turn, during either player''s turn: You can send 1 "Burning Abyss" card from your hand to the Graveyard; draw 1 card. If this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, or if this card you control is sent to your Graveyard by an opponent''s card effect: You can send 1 random card from your opponent''s hand to the Graveyard.', '9', '2800', '2500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('83531441', 'Dante, Traveler of the Burning Abyss', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/83531441.jpg', '2 Level 3 monsters\\r\\nOnce per turn: You can detach 1 material from this card and choose a number from 1 to 3, then send that many cards from the top of your Deck to the GY; until the end of this turn, this card gains 500 ATK for each card sent to the GY this way. If this card attacks, it is changed to Defense Position at the end of the Battle Phase. If this card is sent to the GY: You can target 1 "Burning Abyss" card in your GY, except this card; add it to your hand.', '3', '1000', '2500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('97001138', 'Dark Advance', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/97001138.jpg', 'During either player''s Main Phase or Battle Phase: Target 1 monster in your Graveyard with 2400 or more ATK and 1000 DEF; add it to your hand, then immediately after this effect resolves, you can Tribute Summon 1 monster with 2400 or more ATK and 1000 DEF in face-up Attack Position. You can only activate 1 "Dark Advance" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('34479658', 'Dark Alligator', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/34479658.jpg', 'You can Tribute Summon this card by Tributing 1 Reptile monster. When this card is Tribute Summoned: You can Special Summon "Alligator Tokens" (Reptile/DARK/Level 1/ATK 2000/DEF 0), up to the number of Reptile monsters Tributed for this card''s Summon. If this Tribute Summoned card is destroyed by battle, or is destroyed by an opponent''s card effect while in its owner''s Monster Zone: You can add 1 Reptile monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Dark Alligator".', '8', '2500', '2300', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('28593329', 'Dark Angel', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/28593329.jpg', 'When your Fairy monster is targeted for an attack: You can Tribute it and send this card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 face-up monster you control; change the attack target to your targeted monster, and if you do, it gains ATK equal to the original ATK of the Tributed monster, until the end of this turn.', '5', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('95685352', 'Dark Anthelion Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95685352.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nOnce per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; halve its original ATK until the end of this turn (even if this card leaves the field).\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\n2 Level 7 monsters\\r\\nIf you can Pendulum Summon Level 7, you can Pendulum Summon this face-up card in your Extra Deck. Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card, then target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; until the end of this turn, its ATK becomes half its current ATK, and if it does, this card gains that lost ATK. If this card in the Monster Zone is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone.', '7', '3000', '2500', 'DARK', NULL, 'XYZ Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('65192027', 'Dark Armed Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65192027.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by having exactly 3 DARK monsters in your GY. You can banish 1 DARK monster from your GY, then target 1 card on the field; destroy that target.', '7', '2800', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('78144171', 'Dark Armed, the Dragon of Annihilation', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78144171.jpg', '2+ Level 7 monsters\\r\\nOnce per turn, if you have exactly 5 DARK monsters in your GY, you can also Xyz Summon "Dark Armed, the Dragon of Annihilation" by using 1 Level 5 or higher DARK Dragon monster you control as material. You can detach 1 material from this card, then target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy it, then banish 1 card from your GY, also, this card cannot attack for the rest of this turn.', '7', '2800', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('72520073', 'Dark Artist', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/72520073.jpg', 'If this card is being attacked by a LIGHT monster, its DEF is halved during damage calculation only.', '3', '600', '1400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('41949033', 'Dark Assailant', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41949033.jpg', 'Armed with the Psycho Sword, this sinister assassin rules the bad land.', '4', '1200', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('67049542', 'Dark Bat', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/67049542.jpg', 'Bats from the netherworld that use their hyper senses to detect their enemies.', '3', '1000', '1000', 'WIND', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('81034083', 'Dark Beckoning Beast', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/81034083.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can add 1 "Uria, Lord of Searing Flames", "Hamon, Lord of Striking Thunder", or "Raviel, Lord of Phantasms", OR 1 card that specifically lists any of those cards in its text, from your Deck to your hand, except "Dark Beckoning Beast". You can only use this effect of "Dark Beckoning Beast" once per turn. During your Main Phase, you can Normal Summon 1 Fiend monster with 0 ATK/DEF in addition to your Normal Summon/Set. (You can only gain this effect once per turn.)', '2', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('11321183', 'Dark Blade', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/11321183.jpg', 'They say he is a dragon-manipulating warrior from the dark world. His attack is tremendous, using his great swords with vicious power.', '4', '1800', '1500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('57784563', 'Dark Blade the Captain of the Evil World', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57784563.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can banish 1 DARK monster from your Graveyard to target 1 Level 4 or lower LIGHT monster your opponent controls; equip it to this card. (You can only equip 1 monster at a time to this card with this effect.) If this card on the field would be destroyed, the monster equipped to it with this effect is destroyed, instead.', '4', '1800', '1500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('86805855', 'Dark Blade the Dragon Knight', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86805855.jpg', '"Dark Blade" + "Pitch-Dark Dragon"\\nEach time this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent, you can select up to 3 Monster Cards from your opponent''s Graveyard and remove them from play.', '6', '2200', '1500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('77538567', 'Dark Bribe', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/77538567.jpg', 'When your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card: Your opponent draws 1 card, also negate the Spell/Trap activation, and if you do, destroy it.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Counter Trap'),
('44341034', 'Dark Bug', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/44341034.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned, select and Special Summon 1 Level 3 Tuner monster from your Graveyard. The effect(s) of that monster is negated.', '1', '100', '100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('49702428', 'Dark Burning Attack', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/49702428.jpg', 'If you control a "Dark Magician Girl" monster: Destroy all face-up monsters your opponent controls.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('75190122', 'Dark Burning Magic', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75190122.jpg', 'If you control monsters whose original names are "Dark Magician" and "Dark Magician Girl": Destroy all cards your opponent controls.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('12071500', 'Dark Calling', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12071500.jpg', 'Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, that must be Special Summoned with "Dark Fusion", by banishing the Fusion Materials listed on it from your hand and/or GY. (This is treated as a Fusion Summon with "Dark Fusion".)', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('8634636', 'Dark Cat with White Tail', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/8634636.jpg', 'FLIP: Return 2 Monster Cards on your opponent''s side of the field and 1 Monster Card on your side of the field to their owners'' hands.', '2', '800', '500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('33875961', 'Dark Catapulter', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33875961.jpg', 'During your Standby Phase, if this card is in Defense Position, put 1 counter on this card. You can remove from play a number of card(s) in your Graveyard equal to the number of counters on this card to destroy that many Spell or Trap Card(s) on the field. Then remove all counter(s) from this card.', '4', '1000', '1500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('73452089', 'Dark Cavalry', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/73452089.jpg', '"Dark Magician" + 1 Warrior monster\\r\\nGains 100 ATK for each Spell/Trap on the field and in the GYs. If this card attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage. When a card or effect is activated that targets a card on the field (Quick Effect): You can discard 1 card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy it.', '8', '2800', '2300', 'DARK', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('32344688', 'Dark Chimera', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32344688.jpg', '''''A fire-breathing monster that dwells in the netherworld.''''', '5', '1610', '1460', 'DARK', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('53527835', 'Dark City', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53527835.jpg', 'When a "Destiny HERO" monster attacks, if its ATK is lower than the ATK of the attack target, the attacking monster gains 1000 ATK during damage calculation only.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('1804528', 'Dark Coffin', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1804528.jpg', 'When this face-down card is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, your opponent selects and executes 1 of the following effects:\\n● Discard 1 random card in their hand.\\n● Select 1 monster on their side of the field and destroy it.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('77124096', 'Dark Contact', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/77124096.jpg', 'Activate 1 of these effects (but you can only use each effect of "Dark Contact" once per turn);\\r\\n● Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck that must be Special Summoned with "Dark Fusion", by shuffling its materials from your field, GY, and/or banishment into the Deck. (This is treated as a Fusion Summon with "Dark Fusion".)\\r\\n● Add 1 "Supreme King''s Castle" or "Dark Fusion" from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('37209439', 'Dark Contract with Errors', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/37209439.jpg', 'Once per turn, if you control a "D/D" monster: You can negate all Trap Card effects on the field (other than this card''s) for the rest of this turn (even if this card leaves the field). Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('33814281', 'Dark Contract with Patent License', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33814281.jpg', 'If your opponent Special Summons a monster(s) with the same card type (Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link) as a "D/D/D" monster you control (except during the Damage Step): You can inflict 1000 damage to your opponent, also, while this card is on the field, your opponent cannot Special Summon monsters with the same card type as that Special Summoned monster for the rest of this turn. If this card is sent to the GY: You can add 1 "D/D" monster from your GY, or 1 face-up "D/D" Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck, to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Dark Contract with Patent License" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('54936778', 'Dark Contract with the Different Dimension', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54936778.jpg', 'Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage. You can only use each of the following effects of "Dark Contract with the Different Dimension" once per turn. You can shuffle 2 "Dark Contract" cards from your GY into the Deck, then target 1 card in your opponent''s field or GY; banish it. If this card is destroyed: You can gain 500 LP, then if it was destroyed by an opponent''s card effect, gain another 500 LP.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('41722932', 'Dark Mambele', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41722932.jpg', 'If you control 3 or more DARK monsters: Target 1 face-up card on the field; banish that target.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('60168186', 'Dark Contract with the Entities', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/60168186.jpg', 'When a "D/D/D" monster of the below card type is Special Summoned from the Extra Deck to your field: You can activate the appropriate effect once per turn;\\r\\n● Fusion: Gain 1000 LP.\\r\\n● Synchro: Your opponent cannot target that Special Summoned monster with card effects.\\r\\n● Xyz: Banish 1 card from the field or the Graveyard.\\r\\n● Pendulum: Draw 1 card, then discard 1 card.\\r\\nOnce per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 2000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('9030160', 'Dark Contract with the Eternal Darkness', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/9030160.jpg', 'While you have 2 "D/D" cards in your Pendulum Zones, your opponent cannot target monsters on the field with Spell/Trap effects, Tribute them for a Tribute Summon, nor use them as Materials for a Fusion, Synchro, or Xyz Summon. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('46372010', 'Dark Contract with the Gate', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46372010.jpg', 'During your Main Phase: You can add 1 "D/D" monster from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Dark Contract with the Gate" once per turn. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('73360025', 'Dark Contract with the Swamp King', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/73360025.jpg', 'During your Main Phase: You can Fusion Summon 1 Fiend-Type Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field as Fusion Materials. You can only use this effect of "Dark Contract with the Swamp King" once per turn. If Summoning a "D/D" Fusion Monster this way, you can also banish monsters from your Graveyard as Fusion Material. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('9765723', 'Dark Contract with the Witch', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/9765723.jpg', 'You can send 1 "D/D" or "Dark Contract" card from your hand to the Graveyard, then target 1 card on the field; destroy it. You can only use this effect of "Dark Contract with the Witch" once per turn. All Fiend-Type monsters you control gain 1000 ATK during your opponent''s turn only. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('45974017', 'Dark Contract with the Yamimakai', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/45974017.jpg', 'Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage.\\nYou can only use 1 of the following effects of "Dark Contract with the Yamimakai" per turn, and only once that turn.\\n● During your Main Phase: You can target 1 "D/D" Pendulum Monster in your Graveyard; place it in your Pendulum Zone.\\n● During your Main Phase: You can place 1 face-up "D/D" Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck in your Pendulum Zone.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('32665564', 'Dark Contract with the Zero King', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32665564.jpg', '(This card is always treated as a "D/D" card.)\\r\\nYou can target 1 "D/D" card you control, except "Dark Contract with the Zero King"; destroy it, and if you do, Special Summon 1 "D/D" monster from your Deck, also you cannot Special Summon for the rest of this turn, except "D/D" monsters. You can only use this effect of "Dark Contract with the Zero King" once per turn. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('70231910', 'Dark Core', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70231910.jpg', 'Discard 1 card, then target 1 face-up monster on the field; banish that target.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('98696958', 'Dark Corridor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/98696958.jpg', 'Add 1 "Dark World" monster from your Deck to your hand, then discard 1 card. You can only activate 1 "Dark Corridor" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('91596726', 'Dark Crusader', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91596726.jpg', 'You can send 1 DARK monster from your hand to the Graveyard; this card gains 400 ATK.', '4', '1600', '200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('3701074', 'Dark Cure', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/3701074.jpg', 'When your opponent Summons a monster(s), they gain Life Points equal to half the ATK of 1 of the Summoned monsters of your choice.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('65824822', 'Dark Deal', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65824822.jpg', 'When your opponent activates a Normal Spell Card: Pay 1000 Life Points; the effect of that Normal Spell Card becomes "Your opponent discards 1 random card".', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('70187958', 'Dark Desertapir', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70187958.jpg', 'When this card is removed from play, you can select 1 Level 4 or lower Beast-Type monster in your Graveyard and Special Summon it.', '2', '1100', '300', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('78053598', 'Dark Designator', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78053598.jpg', 'Declare 1 Monster Card name. If the declared card is in your opponent''s Deck, add 1 of that card to your opponent''s hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('109401', 'Dark Dimension Soldier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/109401.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nYou can banish 1 card from your hand, then target 1 of your banished DARK monsters; Special Summon that monster in face-up or face-down Defense Position. During the End Phase: Inflict 100 damage to your opponent for each Set card on the field. You can only use each effect of "Dark Dimension Soldier" once per turn.', '5', '1200', '2400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('31919988', 'Dark Diviner', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31919988.jpg', '1 DARK Tuner + 1 non-Tuner Insect-Type monster\\nThis card cannot be destroyed by battle. When this card declares an attack, if the ATK of the attack target is higher than this card: The ATK of the attack target becomes equal to this face-up card''s current ATK. This change lasts until the end of the Battle Phase. When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard: Send the top 3 cards of your opponent''s Deck to the Graveyard.', '4', '2000', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('62312469', 'Dark Doriado', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/62312469.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nAll EARTH, WATER, FIRE, and WIND monsters you control gain 200 ATK/DEF for every different Attribute among the monsters you control.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\nIf this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can choose 4 monsters from your Deck (1 EARTH, 1 WATER, 1 FIRE, and 1 WIND), then place them on top of the Deck in any order.', '4', '1800', '1400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('18803791', 'Dark Dragon Ritual', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/18803791.jpg', 'This card is used to Ritual Summon "Paladin of Dark Dragon". You must also Tribute monsters from your hand or field whose total Levels equal 4 or more. During your Main Phase, except the turn this card was sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; add 1 "Red-Eyes" Spell/Trap Card from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Ritual Spell'),
('65287621', 'Dark Driceratops', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65287621.jpg', 'If this card attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage.', '6', '2400', '1500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('89111398', 'Dark Dust Spirit', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/89111398.jpg', 'Cannot be Special Summoned. During the End Phase of the turn this card is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up: Return it to the hand. When this card is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up: Destroy all other face-up monsters on the field.', '6', '2200', '1800', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Spirit Monster'),
('81755371', 'Dark Effigy', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/81755371.jpg', 'If you Tribute Summon a DARK Normal Monster, you can treat this 1 monster as 2 Tributes.', '4', '1500', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('53194323', 'Dark Element', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53194323.jpg', 'If you have a "Gate Guardian" monster in your GY: Pay half your LP; Special Summon 1 Level 11 or higher "Gate Guardian" monster from your hand, Deck, or Extra Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions. You can banish this card from your GY; add 1 of your "Sanga of the Thunder", "Kazejin", or "Suijin" from your Deck or banishment to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Dark Element" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('21417692', 'Dark Elf', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/21417692.jpg', 'This card requires a cost of 1000 of your own Life Points to attack.', '4', '2000', '800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('88643579', 'Dark End Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/88643579.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner DARK monsters\\nOnce per turn: You can target 1 monster your opponent controls; this card loses 500 ATK and DEF, and you send that target to the Graveyard.', '8', '2600', '2100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('62002838', 'Dark End Evaporation Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/62002838.jpg', 'You can banish 1 Level 8 Dragon monster from your Extra Deck; Special Summon this card from your hand, also you cannot Special Summon for the rest of this turn, except Dragon monsters. You can activate 1 of these effects;\\r\\n● Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field.\\r\\n● Target 1 other Attack Position monster on the field; make this card lose exactly 500 ATK/DEF, and if you do, destroy that monster.\\r\\nYou can only use each effect of "Dark End Evaporation Dragon" once per turn.', '8', '2600', '2100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('4614116', 'Dark Energy', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/4614116.jpg', 'Increase the ATK and DEF of a Fiend-Type monster equipped with this card by 300 points.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
