('70583986', 'Dewloren, Tiger King of the Ice Barrier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70583986.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner WATER monsters\\nOnce per turn, you can return any number of face-up cards you control to the owner''s hand. For each card returned to the owner''s hand by this effect, this card gains 500 ATK until the End Phase.', '6', '2000', '1400', 'WATER', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('32302078', 'Dhampir Vampire Sheridan', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32302078.jpg', '2+ Level 6 monsters\\r\\nIf you use a monster(s), with a Level, that is owned by your opponent for the Xyz Summon of this card, treat it as Level 6. Once per turn: You can detach 1 material from this card, then target 1 card your opponent controls; send it to the GY. Once per turn, if a Monster Card(s) is sent from the field to your opponent''s GY by a card effect, or a monster is destroyed by battle and sent to your opponent''s GY: You can detach 1 material from this card; Special Summon 1 of those monsters to your field in Defense Position.', '6', '2600', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
