('14307929', 'Diabell, Queen of the White Forest', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14307929.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nIf this card is Synchro Summoned using a Tuner Synchro Monster: You can target 1 Spell/Trap in your GY; add it to your hand. When your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can send 1 Spell/Trap from your hand or field to the GY; Special Summon 1 Level 7 or lower Tuner Synchro Monster from your Extra Deck, GY, or banishment. You can only use each effect of "Diabell, Queen of the White Forest" once per turn.', '8', '2500', '2000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('72270339', 'Diabellstar the Black Witch', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/72270339.jpg', 'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by sending 1 card from your hand or field to the GY. You can only Special Summon "Diabellstar the Black Witch" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of "Diabellstar the Black Witch" once per turn. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can Set 1 "Sinful Spoils" Spell/Trap directly from your Deck. During your opponent''s turn, if this card is sent from its owner''s hand or field to the GY: You can send 1 card from your hand or field to the GY, and if you do, Special Summon this card.', '7', '2500', '2000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
