('6021033', 'Doomkaiser Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/6021033.jpg', '"Plaguespreader Zombie" + 1 or more non-Tuner Zombie-Type monsters\\nWhen this card is Special Summoned: You can target 1 Zombie-Type monster in your opponent''s Graveyard; Special Summon that target to your side of the field in face-up Attack Position, but destroy it when this card leaves the field.', '6', '2400', '1500', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
