('52566270', 'Epsilon The Magnet Warrior', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52566270.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can send 1 Level 4 or lower "Magnet Warrior" monster from your Deck to the GY, except "Epsilon The Magnet Warrior"; this card''s name becomes the sent monster''s name (until the End Phase), then you can Special Summon 1 "Magnet Warrior" or "Magna Warrior" monster from your GY with a different name than the cards you control. You can only use this effect of "Epsilon The Magnet Warrior" once per turn.', '4', '1300', '1500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('98049934', 'Epurrely Beauty', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/98049934.jpg', '2 Level 2 monsters\\r\\nOnce per turn: You can target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; negate its effects until the end of this turn. This is a Quick Effect if this card has "Purrely Pretty Memory" as material. Up to thrice per turn, when you activate a "Purrely" Quick-Play Spell Card (Quick Effect): You can attach that card on the field to this card as material, then you can change the battle position of 1 monster your opponent controls.', '2', '1600', '1100', 'WATER', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
