('89719143', 'Final Fusion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/89719143.jpg', 'During either player''s Battle Step, when a Fusion Monster you control battles an opponent''s Fusion Monster: Target both those Fusion Monsters; negate the attack, and if you do, each player takes damage equal to the combined ATK of both those Fusion Monsters.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
