('9260791', 'Galaxy-Eyes Cloudragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/9260791.jpg', 'You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 "Galaxy-Eyes" monster from your hand or Graveyard, except "Galaxy-Eyes Cloudragon". You can only use this effect of "Galaxy-Eyes Cloudragon" once per turn. If this card is in the Graveyard: You can target 1 "Galaxy-Eyes" Xyz Monster you control; attach this card to it as an Xyz Material. You can only use this effect of "Galaxy-Eyes Cloudragon" once per Duel.', '1', '300', '250', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
