('59797187', 'Gonogo', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59797187.jpg', 'At the end of the Damage Step, if this card battled an opponent''s monster: Change that monster to face-down Defense Position.', '3', '1350', '1600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
