('29099860', 'Gouki Machine Suprex', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/29099860.jpg', 'You can reveal this card and 1 "Gouki" monster in your hand; Special Summon both monsters, but for each one, as long as it remains face-up in your Monster Zone, you cannot Special Summon, except "Gouki" monsters. If this card is sent from the field to the GY: You can add 1 "Gouki" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Gouki Machine Suprex". You can only use each effect of "Gouki Machine Suprex" once per turn.', '4', '1800', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
