('22510667', 'Gouki The Solid Ogre', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22510667.jpg', '2+ "Gouki" monsters\\r\\nCannot be destroyed by battle or card effects while it points to a "Gouki" monster. Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can target 1 "Gouki" monster in your Main Monster Zone, except "Gouki The Solid Ogre"; move that monster you control to your Main Monster Zone this card points to.', '0', '2400', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
