('97688360', 'Gouki Twistcobra', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/97688360.jpg', '(Quick Effect): You can Tribute 1 "Gouki" monster, then target 1 "Gouki" monster you control; it gains ATK equal to the original ATK of the Tributed monster until the end of this turn. If this card is sent from the field to the GY: You can add 1 "Gouki" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Gouki Twistcobra". You can only use each effect of "Gouki Twistcobra" once per turn.', '3', '1600', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
