('57809669', 'Hecahands Tartarus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57809669.jpg', 'Activate 1 of these effects (but you can only use each effect of "Hecahands Tartarus" once per turn);\\r\\n● If you control a "Hecahands" monster: Target 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls; return it to the hand.\\r\\n● Fusion Summon 1 "Hecahands" Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, by banishing its materials from your field and/or GY. If you use a face-up monster(s) you control owned by your opponent, you can treat it as a "Hecahands" monster.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
