('66789970', 'Hieratic Dragon of Sutekh', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66789970.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing 3 Dragon-Type Normal Monsters from your Graveyard. Once per turn: You can banish 1 Dragon-Type monster from your Graveyard to target 1 card on the field; destroy that target.', '8', '2800', '2000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
