('13140300', 'Hieratic Seal of the Sun Dragon Overlord', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/13140300.jpg', 'A mysterious engraved Hieratic relic. It was thought to be a simple stone, but it was actually infused with the power of a sun-wielding dragon. Aeons passed, and the power of the relic grew and grew until it finally shone like the sun itself.', '8', '0', '0', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
