('92918648', 'Hierophant of Prophecy', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/92918648.jpg', '2 Level 7 Spellcaster-Type monsters\\n Once per turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; destroy Spell/Trap Card(s) your opponent controls, up to the number of "Spellbook" Spell Cards in your Graveyard.', '7', '2800', '2600', 'DARK', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
