('759393', 'Hiita the Fire Charmer', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/759393.jpg', 'FLIP: Target 1 face-up FIRE monster your opponent controls; take control of that target while this card is face-up on the field.', '3', '500', '1500', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
