('1845204', 'Instant Fusion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1845204.jpg', 'Pay 1000 LP; Special Summon 1 Level 5 or lower Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, but it cannot attack, also it is destroyed during the End Phase. (This is treated as a Fusion Summon.) You can only activate 1 "Instant Fusion" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
