('12435193', 'Koa''ki Meiru Drago', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12435193.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Dragon-Type monster in your hand. Neither player can Special Summon LIGHT or DARK monsters.', '4', '1900', '1600', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('5817857', 'Koa''ki Meiru Ghoulungulate', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/5817857.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Zombie-Type monster in your hand. If a "Koa''ki Meiru" monster you control would be destroyed by battle or by a card effect, you can remove from play 1 "Koa''ki Meiru" monster in your Graveyard instead.', '5', '2500', '1700', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('41201555', 'Koa''ki Meiru Gravirose', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41201555.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Plant-Type monster in you hand. During each of your Standby Phases, you can send 1 Level 3 or lower monster from your Deck to your Graveyard.', '4', '1900', '1300', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('45041488', 'Koa''ki Meiru Guardian', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/45041488.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the GY or reveal 1 Rock monster in your hand. When a monster effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that monster.', '4', '1900', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('31692182', 'Koa''ki Meiru Hydro Barrier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31692182.jpg', 'You can return 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the top of the Deck. If you do, the effect(s) of all face-up Effect Monsters are negated until the Standby Phase of your next turn, except "Koa''ki Meiru" monsters.', '3', '1000', '1900', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('54520292', 'Koa''ki Meiru Ice', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54520292.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Continuous Spell Card in your hand. You can send 1 card from your hand to the Graveyard to destroy 1 Special Summoned monster on the field.', '4', '1900', '1200', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('91985515', 'Koa''ki Meiru Initialize!', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91985515.jpg', 'Tribute 1 "Koa''ki Meiru" monster to add 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your Deck or Graveyard to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('65026212', 'Koa''ki Meiru Maximus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65026212.jpg', 'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card can only be Special Summoned by removing from play 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand. During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" or 1 "Koa''ki Meiru" monster from your hand to the Graveyard. Once per turn, during your Main Phase, you can select and destroy 1 card your opponent controls.', '8', '3000', '2500', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('14309486', 'Koa''ki Meiru Overload', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14309486.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the GY or reveal 1 Rock monster in your hand. When your opponent would Summon a monster(s) (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; negate the Summon, and if you do, destroy that monster(s).', '4', '1900', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('50847759', 'Last Hope of Nephthys', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/50847759.jpg', 'Target 1 other "Nephthys" card you control and 1 card your opponent controls; destroy them. You can only activate 1 "Last Hope of Nephthys" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('19642889', 'Koa''ki Meiru Powerhand', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/19642889.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Normal Trap Card in your hand. If this card battles a LIGHT or DARK monster, any of that monster''s effects that activate or apply on the field are negated during that Battle Phase, while this card remains on the field.', '4', '2100', '1600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('176392', 'Koa''ki Meiru Prototype', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/176392.jpg', 'If a face-up "Koa''ki Meiru" monster(s) on the field would be destroyed during the End Phase, you can destroy this card instead. When a face-up "Koa''ki Meiru" monster(s) on the field is destroyed during the End Phase, you can Special Summon 1 "Koa''ki Meiru Token" (Rock-Type/EARTH/Level 4/ATK 1800/DEF 1800).', '4', '1800', '1800', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('10060427', 'Koa''ki Meiru Rooklord', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/10060427.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Warrior-Type monster in your hand. You can Tribute Summon this card by Tributing 1 "Koa''ki Meiru" monster. When this card is Normal Summoned, you can remove from play 1 "Koa''ki Meiru" card in your Graveyard to destroy up to 2 cards your opponent controls.', '7', '2800', '2200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('49680980', 'Koa''ki Meiru Sandman', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/49680980.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the GY or reveal 1 Rock monster in your hand. When your opponent activates a Trap Card (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card.', '4', '1900', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('74576482', 'Koa''ki Meiru Sea Panther', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/74576482.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 WATER monster in your hand. Once per turn, you can send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard to return 1 Spell Card from your Graveyard to the top of your Deck.', '4', '1900', '1200', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('12216615', 'Koa''ki Meiru Shield', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12216615.jpg', 'Activate only when your opponent''s monster declares an attack if you have 2 or more "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" in your Graveyard. Destroy all face-up Attack Position monsters your opponent controls.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('68809475', 'Koa''ki Meiru Speeder', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/68809475.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Machine-Type monster in your hand. If you draw "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" during your Draw Phase, you can reveal it to your opponent to draw 1 more card.', '3', '1200', '2200', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('80839052', 'Koa''ki Meiru Supplier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/80839052.jpg', 'If a face-up Rock monster you control is sent to the GY (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is Special Summoned: You can add from your Deck to your hand, 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" or 1 card that specifically lists "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" in its text, except "Koa''ki Meiru Supplier". You can only use each effect of "Koa''ki Meiru Supplier" once per turn.', '4', '1400', '1600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('95204084', 'Koa''ki Meiru Tornado', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95204084.jpg', 'You can return 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the top of the Deck to destroy all Special Summoned monsters your opponent controls.', '4', '1500', '1200', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('30936186', 'Koa''ki Meiru Urnight', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30936186.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Beast-Warrior-Type monster in your hand. Once per turn, you can reveal 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" in your hand to Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Koa''ki Meiru" monster from your Deck, except "Koa''ki Meiru Urnight".', '4', '2000', '1500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('72258771', 'Koa''ki Meiru Valafar', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/72258771.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard. You can Tribute Summon this monster by Tributing 1 "Koa''ki Meiru" monster. This card cannot be destroyed by the effects of Trap Cards. During battle between this attacking card and a Defense Position monster whose DEF is lower than the ATK of this card, inflict the difference as Battle Damage to your opponent.', '8', '3000', '2100', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('66816282', 'Koa''ki Meiru Wall', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66816282.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the GY or reveal 1 Rock monster in your hand. When your opponent activates a Spell Card (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card.', '4', '1900', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('95090813', 'Koa''ki Meiru War Arms', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95090813.jpg', 'During each of your End Phases, destroy this card unless you send 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" from your hand to the Graveyard or reveal 1 Warrior-Type monster in your hand. Once per turn: You can target 1 Level 3 or lower Warrior-Type monster in your Graveyard; equip that target to this card. This card gains ATK equal to half the combined ATK of the monsters equipped to it by this effect. If this card would be destroyed by battle, destroy all monsters equipped to it by this effect instead.', '4', '1400', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('46089249', 'Koa''ki Ring', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46089249.jpg', 'Reveal 1 "Iron Core of Koa''ki Meiru" in your hand to select 1 face-up monster on the field. Destroy that monster, and both players take 1000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('7243511', 'Koalo-Koala', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/7243511.jpg', '"Sea Koala" + "Tree Otter"\\nYou can send 1 Beast-Type monster from your hand to the Graveyard to target 1 monster your opponent controls; destroy it.', '6', '2800', '200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('55359571', 'Kochobo''s Hinamatsuri', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/55359571.jpg', 'If this card is in your hand or GY: You can target 1 Machine monster on the field; for the rest of this turn, you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck, except Xyz Monsters, also Special Summon this card (but banish it when it leaves the field), and if you do, halve that monster''s ATK, also this card''s Level becomes that monster''s. You can only use this effect of "Kochobo''s Hinamatsuri" once per turn.', '7', '2200', '2200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('97970833', 'Last Resort', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/97970833.jpg', 'Activate only when your opponent''s monster declares an attack. You can select 1 "Ancient City - Rainbow Ruins" from your Deck and activate it. If your opponent had an active Field Spell Card when this card was activated, they can draw 1 card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('69456283', 'Koitsu', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/69456283.jpg', 'Once per turn, during your Main Phase, if you control this card on the field, you can equip it to your "Aitsu" as an Equip Spell Card, OR unequip the Union equipment and Special Summon this card in face-up Attack Position. While equipped to a monster by this card''s effect, increase the ATK of the equipped monster by 3000 points. When it attacks with an ATK that is higher than the DEF of a Defense Position monster, inflict the difference as Battle Damage to your opponent''s Life Points. (1 monster can only be equipped with 1 Union Monster at a time. If the equipped monster is destroyed as a result of battle, destroy this card instead.)', '10', '200', '100', 'WATER', NULL, 'Union Effect Monster'),
('1184620', 'Kojikocy', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1184620.jpg', 'A man-hunter with powerful arms that can crush boulders.', '4', '1500', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('57722593', 'Konohanasakuya', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57722593.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by controlling a Spirit monster. You can only Special Summon "Konohanasakuya" once per turn this way. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card was Special Summoned this turn: Return it to the hand. Once per turn, during the End Phase: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 Spirit monster you control; neither player can activate that face-up monster''s effects on the field for the rest of this turn.', '3', '1300', '1300', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Spirit Monster'),
('32569498', 'Korogashi', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32569498.jpg', '''''A high-powered dung beetle that can roll dung larger than itself. It crushes its foes with its massive ball of dung.''''', '2', '550', '400', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('19406822', 'Kotodama', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/19406822.jpg', 'If there are face-up monsters with the same name on the field, destroy those monsters. (If a monster is Summoned or flipped face-up that has the same name as a monster that is already face-up on the field, the new face-up monster is destroyed. If they are Summoned or flipped face-up at the same time, they are all destroyed.)', '3', '0', '1600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('67724379', 'Koumori Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/67724379.jpg', 'A vicious, fire-breathing dragon whose wicked flame corrupts the souls of its victims.', '4', '1500', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('99171160', 'Kozaky', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/99171160.jpg', 'A workaholic fiend who devotes everything to his research into the languages of Dark World. His mind has collapsed because of working too hard.', '1', '400', '400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('21908319', 'Kozaky''s Self-Destruct Button', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/21908319.jpg', 'Inflict 1000 damage to the player who destroyed this Set card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('55885348', 'Kozmo Dark Destroyer', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/55885348.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can target 1 monster on the field; destroy it. Cannot be targeted by an opponent''s card effects. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; Special Summon 1 Level 7 or lower "Kozmo" monster from your Deck.', '8', '3000', '1800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('64063868', 'Kozmo Dark Eclipser', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64063868.jpg', 'Cannot be targeted by an opponent''s card effects. During either player''s turn, when a Trap Card is activated: You can banish 1 "Kozmo" monster from your Graveyard; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; add 1 Level 8 or lower "Kozmo" monster from your Deck to your hand.', '9', '3000', '2600', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('85991529', 'Kozmo Dark Planet', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85991529.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing "Kozmo" monsters from your hand whose total Levels equal 10 or more, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. Cannot be targeted by an opponent''s card effects. During either player''s turn, when a Spell Card is activated: You can banish 1 "Kozmo" monster from your Graveyard; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; add 1 Level 9 or lower "Kozmo" monster from your Deck to your hand.', '10', '4000', '4000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('37679169', 'Kozmo Delta Shuttle', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/37679169.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can send 1 "Kozmo" monster from your Deck to the Graveyard, then target 1 face-up monster on the field; it loses ATK and DEF equal to the sent monster''s Level x 100. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Kozmo" monster from your Deck.', '5', '2000', '2000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('29491334', 'Kozmo DOG Fighter', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/29491334.jpg', 'Once per turn, during the Standby Phase: You can Special Summon 1 "DOG Fighter Token" (Machine-Type/DARK/Level 6/ATK 2000/DEF 2400). If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; Special Summon 1 Level 5 or lower "Kozmo" monster from your Deck.', '6', '2000', '2400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('31061682', 'Kozmo Farmgirl', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31061682.jpg', 'During either player''s turn: You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 Level 4 or higher "Kozmo" monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmo Farmgirl" once per turn. When this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent: You can pay 500 LP; add 1 "Kozmo" card from your Deck to your hand.', '3', '1500', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('20849090', 'Kozmo Forerunner', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/20849090.jpg', 'Cannot be targeted by an opponent''s card effects. During your Standby Phase: Gain 1000 LP. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; Special Summon 1 Level 6 or lower "Kozmo" monster from your Deck.', '7', '2800', '1400', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('67050396', 'Kozmo Goodwitch', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/67050396.jpg', 'During either player''s turn: You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 Level 5 or higher "Kozmo" monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmo Goodwitch" once per turn. Once per turn: You can pay 500 LP, then target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; change it to face-down Defense Position.', '4', '1800', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('59496924', 'Kozmo Landwalker', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59496924.jpg', 'If a "Kozmo" card(s) you control would be destroyed by battle or an opponent''s card effect, you can destroy 1 other "Kozmo" card you control instead. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; Special Summon 1 Level 5 or lower "Kozmo" monster from your Deck.', '6', '2400', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('6256844', 'R-Genex Turbo', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/6256844.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned, you can add 1 Level 1 "Genex" monster from your Deck to your hand.', '4', '1500', '1300', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('82270047', 'Kozmo Lightsword', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/82270047.jpg', 'Equip only to a Psychic-Type "Kozmo" monster. It gains 500 ATK and DEF, it can make up to 2 attacks on monsters during each Battle Phase, also if it attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage to your opponent. If this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard: You can pay 800 LP; add this card to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmo Lightsword" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('86013171', 'Kozmo Scaredy Lion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86013171.jpg', 'During either player''s turn: You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 Level 3 or higher "Kozmo" monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmo Scaredy Lion" once per turn. Once per turn: You can pay 500 LP, then target 3 of your banished "Kozmo" monsters; return them to the Graveyard, and if you do, inflict 500 damage to your opponent.', '2', '1200', '500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('94454495', 'Kozmo Sliprider', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94454495.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can target 1 Spell/Trap Card on the field; destroy it. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Kozmo" monster from your Deck.', '5', '2300', '800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('1274455', 'Kozmo Soartroopers', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1274455.jpg', 'During either player''s turn: You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 Level 4 or higher "Kozmo" monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmo Soartroopers" once per turn. Once per turn: You can pay 1000 LP, then target 1 Psychic-Type "Kozmo" monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it.', '3', '1000', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('56907986', 'Kozmo Strawman', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/56907986.jpg', 'During either player''s turn: You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 Level 3 or higher "Kozmo" monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmo Strawman" once per turn. Once per turn: You can pay 500 LP, then target 1 of your banished "Kozmo" monsters; Special Summon it, but its effects are negated, also destroy it during the End Phase.', '2', '500', '1800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('64280356', 'Kozmo Tincan', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64280356.jpg', 'During either player''s turn: You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 Level 2 or higher "Kozmo" monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmo Tincan" once per turn. Once per turn, during the End Phase: You can pay 500 LP; reveal 3 "Kozmo" cards with different names from your Deck, your opponent randomly picks 1 for you to add to your hand, and you send the rest to the Graveyard.', '1', '0', '0', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('90452877', 'Kozmojo', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90452877.jpg', 'Target 1 "Kozmo" monster you control; destroy it, and if you do, banish 1 card your opponent controls or in their Graveyard. You can only activate 1 "Kozmojo" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('12408276', 'Kozmoll Dark Lady', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12408276.jpg', 'During either player''s turn: You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 Level 6 or higher "Kozmo" monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmoll Dark Lady" once per turn. Once per turn, during either player''s turn, when another monster''s effect is activated: You can pay 1000 LP; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that monster.', '5', '2200', '1800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('93302695', 'Kozmoll Wickedwitch', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/93302695.jpg', 'During either player''s turn: You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 Level 5 or higher "Kozmo" monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kozmoll Wickedwitch" once per turn. Once per turn, during either player''s turn: You can pay 1000 LP; this turn, this card cannot be destroyed by battle or card effects.', '4', '1900', '300', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('67237709', 'Kozmotown', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/67237709.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can target 1 of your banished "Kozmo" monsters; return it to the hand, and if you do, lose LP equal to its original Level x 100. Once per turn: You can reveal any number of "Kozmo" monsters in your hand and shuffle them into the Deck, then draw cards equal to the number of cards you shuffled into the Deck. If this card in the Field Zone is destroyed by a card effect: You can add 1 "Kozmo" card from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('12385638', 'Kozmourning', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12385638.jpg', 'Monsters destroyed by battle with "Kozmo" monsters you control are shuffled into the Deck instead of going to the Graveyard. You can banish this card from your Graveyard; the first time you would take battle damage from a battle involving a "Kozmo" monster you control this turn, gain that much LP, instead.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('15710054', 'Krawler Axon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/15710054.jpg', 'FLIP: You can target 1 Spell/Trap on the field; destroy it.\\r\\nIf this face-up card in its owner''s control leaves the field because of an opponent''s card effect: You can Special Summon 2 "Krawler" monsters with different names from your Deck in face-down Defense Position, except "Krawler Axon". You can only use each effect of "Krawler Axon" once per turn.', '2', '500', '1800', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('46083111', 'Krawler Dendrite', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46083111.jpg', 'FLIP: You can send 1 monster from your Deck to the GY.\\r\\nIf this face-up card in its owner''s control leaves the field because of an opponent''s card effect: You can Special Summon 2 "Krawler" monsters with different names from your Deck in face-down Defense Position, except "Krawler Dendrite". You can only use each effect of "Krawler Dendrite" once per turn.', '2', '1300', '600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
