('24384095', 'Kujakujaku', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/24384095.jpg', 'If this card on the field is Tributed and sent to the Graveyard: You can add 1 Level 4 or lower WIND monster from your Deck or Graveyard to your hand, except "Kujakujaku". You can only use the effect of "Kujakujaku" once per turn.', '3', '1200', '900', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
