('70914287', 'Kuribabylon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70914287.jpg', 'Gains 300 ATK/DEF for each "Kuriboh" monster you control and in your GY. You can only use 1 of the following effects of "Kuribabylon" per turn, and only once that turn.\\r\\n● If you have more monsters in your GY than your opponent: You can Special Summon this card from your hand.\\r\\n● During your Main or Battle Phase: You can return this card to the hand, and if you do, Special Summon 5 monsters (1 "Kuribah", 1 "Kuribee", 1 "Kuriboo", 1 "Kuribeh", and 1 "Kuriboh") from your hand and/or GY in Attack Position.', '5', '1500', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
