('16404809', 'Kuribandit', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/16404809.jpg', 'During the End Phase, if this card was Normal Summoned this turn: You can Tribute this card; excavate the top 5 cards of your Deck, you can add 1 excavated Spell/Trap to your hand, also send the remaining cards to the GY.', '3', '1000', '700', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
