('34419588', 'Kuribeh', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/34419588.jpg', '(This card is always treated as a "Kuriboh" card.)\\r\\n(Quick Effect): You can discard this card, then target 1 "Kuriboh" monster you control; it gains 1500 ATK. You can Tribute this card you control and 1 each of "Kuribah", "Kuribee", "Kuriboo" and "Kuriboh" from your hand and/or field; add 1 "Kuribandit" from your Deck or GY to your hand, then, immediately after this effect resolves, you can Normal Summon 1 Fiend monster from your hand.', '1', '300', '200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('40640057', 'Kuriboh', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40640057.jpg', 'During damage calculation, if your opponent''s monster attacks (Quick Effect): You can discard this card; you take no battle damage from that battle.', '1', '300', '200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
