('35112613', 'Kuriphoton', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/35112613.jpg', '(Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand to the GY and pay 2000 LP; you take no damage this turn. If this card is in your GY: You can send 1 "Photon" monster from your hand to the GY, except "Kuriphoton"; add this card from your GY to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Kuriphoton" once per turn.', '1', '300', '200', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
