('68762510', 'Lucky Pied Piper', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/68762510.jpg', 'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:\\n● When this card destroys an opponent''s monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard, draw 1 card.', '4', '1500', '500', 'WIND', NULL, 'Gemini Monster'),
