('39238953', 'Lullaby of Obedience', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/39238953.jpg', 'Pay 2000 LP and declare 1 Monster Card name; your opponent looks at their Deck, reveals 1 of the declared monsters if there is any, and chooses 1 of these effects to be applied.\\r\\n● The declared monster is added to the hand of the player who activated this card.\\r\\n● The player who activated this card Special Summons the declared monster to their field in Attack Position, ignoring its Summoning conditions.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
