('95503687', 'Lumina, Lightsworn Summoner', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95503687.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can discard 1 card, then target 1 Level 4 or lower "Lightsworn" monster in your GY; Special Summon that target. Once per turn, during your End Phase: Send the top 3 cards of your Deck to the GY.', '3', '1000', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
