('87769556', 'Magician''s Right Hand', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/87769556.jpg', 'Negate the effect of your opponent''s first Spell Card or effect that resolves each turn while you control a Spellcaster monster, and if you do, or if it did not have an effect, destroy that card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
