('17658803', 'Luster Dragon #2', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/17658803.jpg', 'This dragon feeds on emerald. Enchanted by this monster even when attacked, few people live to tell of its beauty.', '6', '2400', '1400', 'WIND', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
