('52945066', 'Marincess Wave', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52945066.jpg', 'If you control a "Marincess" Link Monster: Target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; negate that face-up monster''s effects until the end of this turn, then, if you control a Link-2 or higher "Marincess" monster, all face-up monsters you currently control are unaffected by your opponent''s card effects until the end of this turn. If you control a Link-3 or higher "Marincess" monster, you can activate this card from your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
