('60666820', 'Nefarious Archfiend Eater of Nefariousness', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/60666820.jpg', 'You can only control 1 "Nefarious Archfiend Eater of Nefariousness". If you control a Spellcaster-Type monster, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). Once per turn, during your opponent''s End Phase, if this card is in your Graveyard: You can target 1 face-up monster you control; destroy it, and if you do, Special Summon this card.', '4', '1500', '200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
