('66675911', 'Nehshaddoll Genius', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66675911.jpg', 'FLIP: You can target 1 "Shaddoll" monster you control; that face-up monster is unaffected by monster effects this turn, except its own.\\r\\nIf this card is sent to the GY by card effect: You can target 1 Effect Monster on the field; neither player can activate that target''s effects on the field this turn. You can only use 1 "Nehshaddoll Genius" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '4', '1800', '1000', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('18189187', 'Neiroy, the Dream Mirror Disciple', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/18189187.jpg', 'If a "Dream Mirror" monster(s) is on the field: You can Special Summon this card from your hand, then, you can make this card become DARK. If this card is Special Summoned by the effect of a "Dream Mirror" monster: Activate this effect; if "Dream Mirror of Joy" is on the field, you can return 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls to the hand, also, after that, if "Dream Mirror of Terror" is on the field, draw 1 card, then shuffle 1 card from your hand into the Deck. You can only use each effect of "Neiroy, the Dream Mirror Disciple" once per turn.', '3', '1000', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('90176467', 'Neiroy, the Dream Mirror Traitor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90176467.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Neiroy, the Dream Mirror Disciple" from your Deck to your hand, then you can make this card become LIGHT. You can Tribute 1 other "Dream Mirror" monster; choose 1 "Dream Mirror" monster from your Deck with a different Level than the Tributed monster, add 1 "Dream Mirror of Joy" or 1 "Dream Mirror of Terror" from your Deck to your hand that is mentioned on that chosen monster, and Special Summon that chosen monster in Defense Position. You can only use each effect of "Neiroy, the Dream Mirror Traitor" once per turn.', '3', '1000', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('11021521', 'Neko Mane King', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/11021521.jpg', 'During your opponent''s turn, when this card in your possession is sent to your Graveyard by an opponent''s card effect: It becomes the End Phase of this turn.', '1', '0', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('1761063', 'Nekogal #1', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1761063.jpg', 'A pussycat-fairy. Contrary to her lovely beauty, she claws on her enemies.', '3', '1100', '900', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('43352213', 'Nekogal #2', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43352213.jpg', 'A fast and lethal creature with very dangerous claws.', '6', '1900', '2000', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('97211663', 'Nekroz Cycle', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/97211663.jpg', 'This card can be used to Ritual Summon any "Nekroz" Ritual Monster. Tribute monsters from your hand or field, then Ritual Summon 1 "Nekroz" Ritual Monster from your hand or GY whose Level exactly equals the total Levels of those monsters. You can only use this effect of "Nekroz Cycle" once per turn. If you control no monsters: You can banish this card and 1 "Nekroz" monster from your GY; add 1 "Nekroz" Spell from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Ritual Spell'),
('50596425', 'Nekroz Divinemirror', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/50596425.jpg', 'During the Main Phase: Ritual Summon 1 "Nekroz" Ritual Monster from your hand or banishment, by Tributing monsters from your hand/field, and/or sending "Nekroz" monsters from your Extra Deck to the GY, whose total Levels equal or exceed its Level. During your Main Phase: You can banish this card and 1 "Nekroz" monster from your GY; add 1 "Nekroz" Spell from your Deck to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Nekroz Divinemirror" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('51124303', 'Nekroz Kaleidoscope', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/51124303.jpg', 'This card can be used to Ritual Summon any number of "Nekroz" Ritual Monsters. Tribute 1 monster from your hand or field, or send 1 monster from your Extra Deck to the GY, also after that, Ritual Summon any number of "Nekroz" monsters whose total Levels exactly equal the Level of that monster. You can only use this effect of "Nekroz Kaleidoscope" once per turn. If you control no monsters: You can banish this card and 1 "Nekroz" monster from your GY; add 1 "Nekroz" Spell from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Ritual Spell'),
('14735698', 'Nekroz Mirror', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14735698.jpg', 'This card can be used to Ritual Summon any "Nekroz" Ritual Monster. Tribute monsters from your hand or field, and/or banish "Nekroz" monsters from your GY, then Ritual Summon 1 "Nekroz" Ritual Monster from your hand whose Level exactly equals the total Levels of those monsters. You can only use this effect of "Nekroz Mirror" once per turn. If you control no monsters: You can banish this card and 1 "Nekroz" monster from your GY; add 1 "Nekroz" Spell from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Ritual Spell'),
('39468724', 'Nekroz of Areadbhair', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/39468724.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell. Must be Ritual Summoned, without using any Level 10 monsters. You can only use each of these effects of "Nekroz of Areadbhair" once per turn.\\r\\n● You can discard this card; Tribute up to 2 "Nekroz" monsters from your hand and/or field, and if you do, send that many "Nekroz" cards from your Deck to the GY.\\r\\n● When a monster effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can Tribute 1 monster from your hand or field; negate the activation, and if you do, banish that card.', '10', '3300', '3200', 'WATER', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('26674724', 'Nekroz of Brionac', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/26674724.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell. Must be Ritual Summoned, without using "Nekroz of Brionac". You can only use each of these effects of "Nekroz of Brionac" once per turn.\\r\\n● You can discard this card; add 1 "Nekroz" monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Nekroz of Brionac".\\r\\n● You can target up to 2 face-up monsters on the field that were Special Summoned from the Extra Deck; shuffle them into the Deck.', '6', '2300', '1400', 'WATER', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('52846880', 'Nekroz of Catastor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52846880.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell Card. Must be Ritual Summoned without using "Nekroz of Catastor", and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. You can discard this card, then target 1 "Nekroz" monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it. You can only use this effect of "Nekroz of Catastor" once per turn. At the start of the Damage Step, if a "Nekroz" monster you control battles an opponent''s face-up monster that was Special Summoned from the Extra Deck: Destroy that monster.', '5', '2200', '1200', 'WATER', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('99185129', 'Nekroz of Clausolas', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/99185129.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell. Must be Ritual Summoned. You can only use each of these effects of "Nekroz of Clausolas" once per turn.\\r\\n● You can discard this card; add 1 "Nekroz" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand.\\r\\n● (Quick Effect): You can target 1 face-up monster on the field that was Special Summoned from the Extra Deck; until the end of this turn, that target''s ATK becomes 0, also that target''s effects are negated.', '3', '1200', '2300', 'WATER', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('88240999', 'Nekroz of Decisive Armor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/88240999.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell Card. Must be Ritual Summoned without using any Level 10 monsters, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. You can only use each of these effects of "Nekroz of Decisive Armor" once per turn.\\n● During either player''s turn: You can discard this card, then target 1 "Nekroz" monster you control; it gains 1000 ATK and DEF until the end of this turn.\\n● You can target 1 Set card your opponent controls; destroy it, and if you do, banish it.', '10', '3300', '2300', 'WATER', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('74122412', 'Nekroz of Gungnir', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/74122412.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell Card. Must be Ritual Summoned, without using any Level 7 monsters, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. You can only use each of these effects of "Nekroz of Gungnir" once per turn.\\n● During either player''s turn: You can discard this card, then target 1 "Nekroz" monster you control; it cannot be destroyed by battle or by card effects this turn.\\n● During either player''s turn: You can discard 1 "Nekroz" card, then target 1 card on the field; destroy it.', '7', '2500', '1700', 'WATER', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('13408726', 'Nekroz of Metaltron', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/13408726.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nIf your "Nekroz" card(s) is banished face-up (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 Spell/Trap on the field; banish it. You can only use this effect of "Nekroz of Metaltron" once per turn.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\nYou can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell. Must be Ritual Summoned, using monsters, and you cannot use Level 9 monsters. During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; banish this card (until the End Phase), and if you do, banish that monster. You can only use this effect of "Nekroz of Metaltron" once per turn. Any monster destroyed by battle with your "Nekroz" monster is banished.', '9', '2500', '3000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Ritual Monster'),
('21105106', 'Nekroz of Sophia', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/21105106.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell Card. Must be Ritual Summoned from your hand by using 3 monsters you control with different Types, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. During either player''s Main Phase 1: You can discard this card and 1 "Nekroz" Spell Card; your opponent cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck during this phase. When this card is Ritual Summoned: You can banish all other cards on the field and in the Graveyards. You cannot Normal Summon/Set or Special Summon other monsters the turn you activate this effect.', '11', '3600', '3400', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('52068432', 'Nekroz of Trishula', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52068432.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell. Must be Ritual Summoned, without using any Level 9 monsters. You can only use each of these effects of "Nekroz of Trishula" once per turn.\\r\\n● When a card or effect is activated that targets a "Nekroz" monster(s) you control (Quick Effect): You can discard this card; negate the activation.\\r\\n● When this card is Ritual Summoned, you can: Banish exactly 3 of your opponent''s cards, 1 each from their hand, field, and GY. (The card in the hand is chosen at random.)', '9', '2700', '2000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('89463537', 'Nekroz of Unicore', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/89463537.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with any "Nekroz" Ritual Spell. Must be Ritual Summoned. You can discard this card, then target 1 "Nekroz" card in your GY, except "Nekroz of Unicore"; add it to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Nekroz of Unicore" once per turn. Negate the effects of face-up monsters on the field that were Special Summoned from the Extra Deck.', '4', '2300', '1000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
