('4849037', 'Performance of Sword', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/4849037.jpg', 'This monster can only be Ritual Summoned with the Ritual Spell Card, "Commencement Dance". You must also offer monsters whose total Level Stars equal 6 or more as a Tribute from the field or your hand.', '6', '1950', '1850', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Ritual Monster'),
