('42562690', 'Performapal Skeeter Skimmer', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/42562690.jpg', 'When this face-up Attack Position card is targeted for an attack: You can change this card to face-up Defense Position, and if you do, negate that attack.', '4', '500', '1600', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
