('29169993', 'Performapal Teeter Totter Hopper', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/29169993.jpg', 'The first time this Special Summoned card would be destroyed by battle each turn, it is not destroyed. Once per turn, during your opponent''s End Phase: You can target 1 Level 3 or lower "Performapal" monster in your Graveyard; send this card to the Graveyard, and if you do, add that monster to your hand. If a "Performapal" monster is sent from the hand to your Graveyard (except during the Damage Step), while this card is in your Graveyard: You can Special Summon this card. You can only use this effect of "Performapal Teeter Totter Hopper" once per turn.', '4', '100', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
