('44088292', 'Poly-Chemicritter Dioxogre', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/44088292.jpg', 'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is a Normal Monster on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it become an Effect Monster with these effects.\\n● The Normal Summon of a Gemini monster cannot be negated.\\n● Once per turn: You can banish 1 Gemini monster from your Graveyard, then target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy it.', '8', '2800', '200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Gemini Monster'),
('80476891', 'Poly-Chemicritter Hydragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/80476891.jpg', 'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is a Normal Monster on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it become an Effect Monster with these effects.\\n● When another Gemini monster is Normal Summoned: You can make that monster gain 500 ATK and DEF.\\n● If a Gemini monster(s) you control would be destroyed by a card effect, you can destroy 1 other card you control instead.', '8', '200', '2800', 'WATER', NULL, 'Gemini Monster'),
