('52792430', 'Predaplant Spinodionaea', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52792430.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; place 1 Predator Counter on it, and if it is Level 2 or higher, it becomes Level 1 as long as it has a Predator Counter. After damage calculation, if this card battled a monster with an equal or lower Level: You can Special Summon 1 "Predaplant" monster from your Deck, except "Predaplant Spinodionaea".', '4', '1800', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
