('65471349', 'Psychic Bounder', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65471349.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Jinzo" or 1 Spell/Trap that specifically lists that card in its text, from your Deck to your hand. When another monster you control is attacked by an opponent''s monster, before damage calculation: You can destroy both the attacking monster and this card. You can only use each effect of "Psychic Bounder" once per turn.', '4', '1700', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
