('53154400', 'Psychic Rover', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53154400.jpg', 'If this card is Special Summoned: You can roll a six-sided die, and if you roll a 1 or 6, destroy up to 2 cards on the field. If this card is sent to the GY: You can roll a six-sided die, and if you roll a 2, 3, 4, or 5, Special Summon this card. The player who Summoned it cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck, while it is face-up in the Monster Zone.', '2', '0', '700', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
