('19747827', 'Red-Eyes Black Dragon Sword', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/19747827.jpg', 'Must be Special Summoned with "The Claw of Hermos", using a Dragon monster. If this card is Special Summoned: Target 1 other face-up monster on the field; equip this card to it. It gains 1000 ATK, and 500 ATK/DEF for each Dragon monster on the field and in the GYs.', '7', '2400', '2000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('30079770', 'Red-Eyes Black Flare Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30079770.jpg', 'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is a Normal Monster on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it become an Effect Monster with this effect.\\n● If damage calculation is performed involving this card, at the end of the Battle Phase: You can inflict damage to your opponent equal to this card''s original ATK. You can only use this effect of "Red-Eyes Black Flare Dragon" once per turn.', '7', '2400', '2000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Gemini Monster'),
('80870883', 'Red-Eyes Black Fullmetal Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/80870883.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned with "Max Metalmorph" that was activated by Tributing a Level 5 or higher Dragon monster. You can reveal this card in your hand; Set 1 "Metalmorph" Trap from your Deck, and if you do, shuffle this card into the Deck. When your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can negate the activation, then you can inflict damage to your opponent equal to the original ATK of 1 Attack Position monster your opponent controls. You can only use each effect of "Red-Eyes Black Fullmetal Dragon" once per turn.', '8', '3400', '2400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
