('2851070', 'Reflect Bounder', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/2851070.jpg', 'Before damage calculation, if this card is being attacked by an opponent''s monster, and was in face-up Attack Position at the start of the Damage Step: Inflict damage to your opponent equal to the attacking monster''s ATK. If you do, after damage calculation: Destroy this card.', '4', '1700', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('39000945', 'Reflection of Endymion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/39000945.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nEach time a Spell Card is activated, place 1 Spell Counter on this card when that Spell resolves. You can remove 3 Spell Counters from this card; Special Summon both this card from your Pendulum Zone and 1 monster from your hand that you can place a Spell Counter on, and if you do, place 1 Spell Counter on each.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\nYou can only Special Summon "Reflection(s) of Endymion" once per turn. If this card is Special Summoned: You can target 1 card your opponent controls, and 1 card you control with a Spell Counter, except this card; return that opponent''s card and your card to the hand, then place the same number of Spell Counters on this card that your returned card had. When this card with a Spell Counter is destroyed by battle: You can add 1 "Endymion" card from your Deck to your hand.', '7', '1850', '2700', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('64881644', 'Refrain the Melodious Songstress', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64881644.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nYou can target 1 "Melodious" Fusion Monster you control; send 1 "Melodious" monster from your Deck to the GY, and if you do, the targeted monster gains ATK equal to the Level of that monster sent to the GY x 200 until the end of this turn. You can only use this effect of "Refrain the Melodious Songstress" once per turn.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\nIf this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Melodious" monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Refrain the Melodious Songstress". If a "Melodious" Fusion Monster(s) is Special Summoned to your field, while this card is face-up in your Extra Deck (except during the Damage Step): You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone. You can only use each effect of "Refrain the Melodious Songstress" once per turn.', '4', '1600', '800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('70821187', 'Regenerating Mummy', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70821187.jpg', 'When this card is sent from your hand to your Graveyard by an opponent''s card effect: Return this card to the hand.', '4', '1800', '1500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('31986288', 'Regenerating Rose', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31986288.jpg', 'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can Special Summon 2 "Regenerating Rose Tokens" (Plant-Type/DARK/Level 3/ATK 1200/DEF 1200).', '7', '0', '1500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('31786838', 'Regenesis', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31786838.jpg', 'Take 1 "Regenesis" monster from your Deck, and either add it to your hand or send it to the GY, or, if you control a "Regenesis" monster, you can add 1 monster with 2500 ATK and DEF from your Deck to your hand instead. If this card is in your GY, except the turn it was sent there: You can banish it, then target 1 "Regenesis" monster in your GY; Special Summon it. You can only use each effect of "Regenesis" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('50185950', 'Relinkuriboh', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/50185950.jpg', 'If this card is Tributed: Draw 1 card. If your monster would be destroyed by battle, you can banish this card from your GY instead.', '1', '300', '200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('95718355', 'Regenesis Archfiend', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95718355.jpg', 'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by revealing another monster with 2500 ATK or DEF in your hand. You can only Special Summon "Regenesis Archfiend" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of "Regenesis Archfiend" once per turn. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Regenesis" card from your Deck or banishment to your hand, except "Regenesis Archfiend". During your opponent''s End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add this card to your hand.', '8', '2500', '2500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('27781371', 'Regenesis Birth', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/27781371.jpg', 'You can send 1 "Regenesis" monster from your Deck to the GY, then target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; change it to face-down Defense Position. During your opponent''s turn: You can send this card to the GY; Special Summon as many "Regenesis" monsters as possible with different names from your hand, GY, and/or banishment, but send them to the GY during the End Phase. You can only use 1 "Regenesis Birth" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('67171933', 'Regenesis Code', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/67171933.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 "Regenesis" monster from your Deck (but send it to the GY during your opponent''s End Phase), also until the end of the next turn after this card resolves, you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck. During your Main Phase, if this card is in your GY, except the turn it was sent there: You can banish it, then target 1 of your banished "Regenesis" monsters; Special Summon it. You can only use each effect of "Regenesis Code" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('95382988', 'Regenesis Commands', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95382988.jpg', 'Apply these effects to all cards your opponent controls in the same column as your "Regenesis" monsters.\\r\\n● Face-up cards: Negate their effects.\\r\\n● Face-down monsters: Cannot change their battle positions.\\r\\n● Face-down Spells/Traps: Cannot be activated until the end of the next turn.\\r\\nYou can only activate 1 "Regenesis Commands" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('36672909', 'Regenesis Cycle', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/36672909.jpg', 'If you control a monster with 2500 original ATK or DEF: Target 1 card your opponent controls, or you can target 2 if you control "Regenesis Lord"; banish that card(s). If this card is in your GY, except the turn it was sent there: You can banish it; Special Summon 1 monster with 2500 ATK or DEF from your hand. You can only use each effect of "Regenesis Cycle" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('59323650', 'Regenesis Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59323650.jpg', 'If a monster with 2500 original ATK or DEF is on the field, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You can only Special Summon "Regenesis Dragon" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of "Regenesis Dragon" once per turn. (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card, then target 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls; banish it. During your opponent''s End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add this card to your hand.', '8', '2500', '2500', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('22812963', 'Regenesis Lord', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22812963.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by banishing 1 face-up monster you control with 2500 original ATK and DEF. You can only Special Summon "Regenesis Lord" once per turn this way. If this card is Special Summoned: You can Set 1 "Regenesis" Spell/Trap from your Deck. Gains 2500 ATK during the Battle Phase only. If this card attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage to your opponent.', '10', '2500', '2500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('47082621', 'Regenesis Overlord', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/47082621.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your GY) by banishing 2 monsters from your GY with 2500 ATK or DEF. You can only Special Summon "Regenesis Overlord" once per turn this way. If this card is Special Summoned: You can target cards in your opponent''s field and/or GY, up to the number of your banished monsters with 2500 ATK or DEF; return them to the hand. Monsters your opponent controls lose 2500 ATK during the Battle Phase only.', '10', '2500', '2500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('22938501', 'Regenesis Sage', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22938501.jpg', 'If a monster with 2500 original ATK or DEF is on the field, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You can only Special Summon "Regenesis Sage" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of "Regenesis Sage" once per turn. When your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can send 1 other "Regenesis" card from your hand or face-up field to the GY; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card. During your opponent''s End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add this card to your hand.', '7', '2500', '2500', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('96540807', 'Regenesis Warrior', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/96540807.jpg', 'If a monster with 2500 original ATK or DEF is on the field, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You can only Special Summon "Regenesis Warrior" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of "Regenesis Warrior" once per turn. (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card, then target 1 monster your opponent controls; return it to the hand. During your opponent''s End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add this card to your hand.', '7', '2500', '2500', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('79544790', 'Regretful Rebirth', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/79544790.jpg', 'When a monster you control is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard: Target that monster; Special Summon it in face-up Defense Position, but it is destroyed during your End Phase.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('20210570', 'Regulus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/20210570.jpg', 'Once per turn, you can select 1 Field Spell Card in your Graveyard. Return it to the Deck.', '4', '1700', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('61480937', 'Regulus the Fairy Beast', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/61480937.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 Spell/Trap that mentions "Ancient Fairy Dragon" from your Deck to your hand. During your Main Phase: You can Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower LIGHT monster (Beast, Plant, or Fairy) from your hand in Defense Position. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 Field Spell in your GY; place it on the bottom of the Deck, then draw 1 card. You can only use each effect of "Regulus the Fairy Beast" once per turn.', '4', '1700', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('64631466', 'Relinquished', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64631466.jpg', 'You can Ritual Summon this card with "Black Illusion Ritual". Once per turn: You can target 1 monster your opponent controls; equip that target to this card (max. 1). This card''s ATK/DEF become equal to that equipped monster''s. If this card would be destroyed by battle, destroy that equipped monster instead. While equipped with that monster, any battle damage you take from battles involving this card inflicts equal effect damage to your opponent.', '1', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Ritual Effect Monster'),
('41406613', 'Reign-Beaux, Overking of Dark World', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41406613.jpg', 'You can Special Summon this card (from your GY) by returning 1 Level 7 or lower "Dark World" monster you control to the hand. If this card is discarded to the GY by card effect: You can add 1 Level 5 or higher "Dark World" monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Reign-Beaux, Overking of Dark World", then, if this card was discarded from your hand to your GY by an opponent''s card effect, you can Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower "Dark World" monster from your Deck or GY to either field.', '8', '3000', '1800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('99458769', 'Reign-Beaux, Overlord of Dark World', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/99458769.jpg', 'If this card is discarded from your hand to your Graveyard by an opponent''s card effect: Special Summon this card from the Graveyard. When this card is Special Summoned this way: Destroy all monsters your opponent controls OR all Spell/Trap Cards they control.', '7', '2500', '1800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('57499304', 'Reincarnation of the Seventh Emperors', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57499304.jpg', 'During damage calculation, if your "Number" Xyz Monster that has a number between "101" and "107" in its name, or your Xyz Monster that has any such monsters as material, battles: Banish that monster you control (also banish its materials). During the End Phase of the turn you activated this card, Special Summon 1 Rank 3 or lower Xyz Monster from your Extra Deck, except a "Number" monster, and if you do, inflict damage to your opponent equal to its original ATK.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('68663427', 'Reincarnation Unveiling Mail', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/68663427.jpg', '(This card is always treated as an "Armored Xyz" card.)\\r\\nAn Xyz Monster equipped with this card gains these effects.\\r\\n● Cannot be destroyed by battle.\\r\\n● Once per turn, if this card battled this turn (Quick Effect): You can return 1 card equipped to this card to the hand, then immediately after this effect resolves, Xyz Summon 1 WATER Xyz Monster.\\r\\nOnce per turn, during the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can equip this card to 1 Xyz Monster you control. You can only activate 1 "Reincarnation Unveiling Mail" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('10118318', 'Reinforce Truth', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/10118318.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 Level 2 or lower Warrior-Type monster from your Deck. You cannot conduct your Battle Phase the turn you activate this card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('71948047', 'REINFORCE!', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/71948047.jpg', '(This card is always treated as a "Rescue-ACE" card.)\\r\\nTarget 1 "Rescue-ACE" monster you control; for the rest of this turn, that monster you control gains 1500 ATK/DEF, is unaffected by your opponent''s monster effects, and the next time it would be destroyed by battle, it is not destroyed. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 "Rescue-ACE" Spell in your GY; Set that card. You can only use this effect of "REINFORCE!" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('80102359', 'Reinforced Human Psychic Borg', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/80102359.jpg', 'Up to twice per turn, you can remove from play 1 Psychic-Type monster from your Graveyard to have this card gain 500 ATK.', '4', '1500', '800', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('11224934', 'Reinforced Space', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/11224934.jpg', 'Each face-up Xyz Monster you control gains 300 ATK for each Xyz Material attached to it, until the End Phase.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('32807846', 'Reinforcement of the Army', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32807846.jpg', 'Add 1 Level 4 or lower Warrior monster from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('79371897', 'Reinforcement of the Army''s Troops', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/79371897.jpg', 'When an attack is declared involving your Warrior monster: You can Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower Warrior monster from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Reinforcement of the Army''s Troops" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('17814387', 'Reinforcements', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/17814387.jpg', 'Target 1 face-up monster on the field; it gains 500 ATK until the end of this turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('78161960', 'Reject Reborn', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78161960.jpg', 'When an opponent''s monster declares a direct attack: End the Battle Phase, then you can Special Summon 1 Tuner and 1 Synchro Monster from your Graveyard, but they have their effects negated.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('74845897', 'Rekindling', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/74845897.jpg', 'Special Summon from your GY as many FIRE monsters as possible with 200 DEF, but banish them during the End Phase of this turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('61434639', 'Rekindling the Ashened', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/61434639.jpg', 'Place 1 of your "Ashened" cards that is banished or in your GY on the bottom of your Main Deck, except "Rekindling the Ashened", then target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; negate its effects until the end of this turn. You can only activate 1 "Rekindling the Ashened" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('42776960', 'Relay Soul', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/42776960.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 monster from your hand. While it is face-up on your side of the field, you take no damage. When it leaves the field, your opponent wins the Duel.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('85395151', 'Release Brainwashing', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85395151.jpg', 'If a monster(s) is Tributed from the hand or field (except during the Damage Step): Target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; apply the following effect, based on which player owns that face-up monster.\\r\\n● You: Take control of it, but return it to the hand during the End Phase.\\r\\n● Your opponent: Negate its effects until the end of this turn.\\r\\nYou can only activate 1 "Release Brainwashing" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('26956670', 'Release from Stone', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/26956670.jpg', 'Select 1 of your removed from play Rock-Type monsters, and Special Summon it. When this card is removed from the field, destroy that monster. When that monster is destroyed, destroy this card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('75417459', 'Release Restraint', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75417459.jpg', 'Tribute 1 "Gearfried the Iron Knight"; Special Summon 1 "Gearfried the Swordmaster" from your hand or Deck.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('98847704', 'Release Restraint Wave', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/98847704.jpg', 'Target 1 face-up Equip Spell Card you control; destroy the Equip Spell Card and all face-down Spell and Trap Cards your opponent controls.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('38777931', 'Release, Reverse, Burst', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38777931.jpg', 'Tribute 1 "Utopia" monster; destroy all Set Spell and Trap Cards your opponent controls.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('78636495', 'Slate Warrior', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78636495.jpg', 'FLIP: This card gains 500 ATK and DEF.\\nIf this card is destroyed by battle: The monster that destroyed it loses 500 ATK and DEF.', '4', '1900', '400', 'WIND', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('94259633', 'Relinquished Anima', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94259633.jpg', '1 Level 1 monster, except a Token\\r\\nYou can target 1 face-up monster this card points to; equip that face-up monster to this card (max. 1). You can only use this effect of "Relinquished Anima" once per turn. This card gains ATK equal to that equipped monster''s.', '0', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('78063197', 'Relinquished Fusion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78063197.jpg', 'Fusion Summon 1 "Eyes Restrict" Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, by banishing materials from your hand, field and/or GY. During your Main Phase: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; equip that target to an "Eyes Restrict" Fusion Monster or "Relinquished" you control, as if it were equipped by that monster''s effect. You can only use each effect of "Relinquished Fusion" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('54248491', 'Relinquished Spider', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54248491.jpg', 'If you have 4 or more Insect-Type monsters in your Graveyard, you can Tribute this card to destroy all face-up Defense Position monsters your opponent controls.', '2', '300', '500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('22589918', 'Reload', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22589918.jpg', 'Add all cards in your hand to your Deck and shuffle it. Then draw the same number of cards that you added to your Deck.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('54658815', 'Remote Rebirth', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54658815.jpg', 'Target 1 monster in your opponent''s GY; Special Summon it in an opponent''s Main Monster Zone your Link Monster points to.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('61656650', 'Remote Revenge', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/61656650.jpg', 'Activate only when a monster you control is targeted by a Spell, Trap, or Effect Monster''s effect that destroys 1 monster on the field. Switch the target to an appropriate monster your opponent controls.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('94739788', 'Remove Brainwashing', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94739788.jpg', 'The control of all monsters on the field returns to the owners.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('51482758', 'Remove Trap', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/51482758.jpg', 'Select 1 face-up Trap Card on the field and destroy it.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('81306186', 'Renewal of the World', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/81306186.jpg', 'When this card is activated: Banish 1 Ritual Monster from your Deck. You can send this card to the GY, then activate 1 of these effects;\\r\\n● Tribute 1 monster from your hand or field, or shuffle 1 Ritual Monster from your GY into the Deck, whose Level equals or exceeds the Level of the monster banished by this card''s effect, then Ritual Summon that monster.\\r\\n● Add the monster banished by this card''s effect to your hand.\\r\\nYou can only use 1 "Renewal of the World" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('60606759', 'Renge, Gatekeeper of Dark World', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/60606759.jpg', 'His renowned athletic physique has made him famous with the populace of Dark World. They call him "Iron Wall Renge" because no one can break through his incredible defenses.', '4', '100', '2100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('8173184', 'Repair Genex Controller', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/8173184.jpg', '1 Level 4 or lower "Genex" monster\\r\\nYou can only Special Summon "Repair Genex Controller(s)" once per turn. If this card is Link Summoned: You can add 1 "Genex" monster from your GY to your hand. Once per Chain, if a "Genex" monster(s) is added to your hand, except by drawing it, you can (except during the Damage Step): Immediately after this effect resolves, Normal Summon 1 "Genex" monster, also you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck for the rest of this turn, except Synchro Summon using a "Genex" Tuner as material.', '0', '1200', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('1665819', 'Replicard LAD', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1665819.jpg', 'You can banish 1 other Level 7 or higher monster from your hand; Special Summon this card from your hand. You can target 1 face-up monster you control; Special Summon 1 monster from your Deck with a different name that has 2 or more of the same Level, ATK, and/or DEF, but it cannot activate its effects this turn. You can only use each effect of "Replicard LAD" once per turn.', '7', '2500', '2500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('34989413', 'Reprodocus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/34989413.jpg', '2 monsters\\r\\nYou can activate 1 of these effects.\\r\\n● Declare 1 Monster Type; all face-up monsters this card points to become that Type until the end of this turn.\\r\\n● Declare 1 Attribute; all face-up monsters this card points to become that Attribute until the end of this turn.\\r\\nYou can only use this effect of "Reprodocus" once per turn.', '0', '800', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('81782101', 'Reptia Egg', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/81782101.jpg', 'Cannot be destroyed by battle. During the Standby Phase of your next turn after this card was Normal Summoned: You can Tribute this card; Special Summon up to 3 Level 4 or lower Reptile and/or Rock monsters from your hand and/or Deck (if you Special Summon 2 or more monsters, they must have the same name), but banish them during the End Phase. You can only use this effect of "Reptia Egg" once per turn.', '1', '0', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('89594399', 'Reptilianne Coatl', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/89594399.jpg', 'If you control a DARK Reptile monster: You can Special Summon this card from your hand, then, if your opponent controls any monsters with 0 ATK, you can Special Summon up to an equal number of "Reptilianne" monsters from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Reptilianne Coatl" once per turn. If this card you control would be used as Synchro Material for a Reptile monster, you can treat it as a non-Tuner.', '4', '1400', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('8602351', 'Reptilianne Echidna', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/8602351.jpg', '2 monsters, including a Reptile monster\\r\\nIf this card is Link Summoned: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; change its ATK to 0. During your Main Phase, if your opponent controls a monster(s) with 0 ATK: You can add Reptile monsters with different names from your Deck to your hand, up to the number of monsters your opponent controls with 0 ATK, also, you cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck for the rest of this turn, except Reptile monsters. You can only use each effect of "Reptilianne Echidna" once per turn.', '0', '200', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('43002864', 'Reptilianne Gardna', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43002864.jpg', 'When this card you control is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard, add 1 "Reptilianne" monster from your Deck to your hand.', '4', '0', '2000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('43426903', 'Reptilianne Gorgon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43426903.jpg', 'If this card attacks a monster, after damage calculation: The ATK of that monster becomes 0, also it cannot change its battle position.', '3', '1400', '1400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
