('57288064', 'Shiranui Samuraisaga', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57288064.jpg', '1 Zombie-Type Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner Zombie-Type monsters\\nOnce per turn, during either player''s turn: You can target 1 of your banished Zombie-Type monsters; shuffle it into the Deck, and if you do, change to Defense Position all monsters your opponent controls with ATK less than or equal to that monster''s. If this card is banished: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; it loses 500 ATK. You can only Special Summon "Shiranui Samuraisaga(s)" once per turn.', '6', '2500', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('83283063', 'Shiranui Shogunsaga', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/83283063.jpg', '1 Zombie-Type Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner Zombie-Type monsters\\nIf this card is Special Summoned: You can banish 1 Zombie-Type monster from your Graveyard; this card gains ATK equal to the banished monster''s original ATK, until the end of this turn. If this card on the field is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the Graveyard: You can target 1 of your banished Zombie-Type monsters with 0 DEF; return it to the Graveyard. You can only Special Summon "Shiranui Shogunsaga(s)" once per turn.', '8', '3000', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('86926989', 'Shiranui Skillsaga Supremacy', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86926989.jpg', '2+ Zombie monsters\\r\\nSynchro Monsters you control cannot be destroyed by card effects. FIRE monsters you control cannot be destroyed by battle. During your opponent''s turn (Quick Effect): You can target 1 of your banished Zombie Synchro Monsters; Special Summon it to your zone this card points to. You can only use this effect of "Shiranui Skillsaga Supremacy" once per turn.', '0', '2300', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('62038047', 'Shiranui Smith', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/62038047.jpg', 'If this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard as a Synchro Material: You can add 1 "Shiranui" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Shiranui Smith". You can only use this effect of "Shiranui Smith" once per turn. If this card is banished: You can activate this effect; this turn, Zombie-Type monsters you control cannot be destroyed by battle.', '4', '1000', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('94801854', 'Shiranui Solitaire', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94801854.jpg', 'You can Tribute 1 Zombie monster; Special Summon 1 Zombie Tuner with 0 DEF from your Deck. If this card is banished: You can target 1 of your banished "Shiranui" monsters, except "Shiranui Solitaire", or up to 2 instead if "Shiranui Style Synthesis" is on the field; Special Summon them. You can only use each effect of "Shiranui Solitaire" once per turn.', '4', '500', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('36630403', 'Shiranui Spectralsword', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/36630403.jpg', 'If this card is in your GY, except the turn this card was sent to the GY: You can target 1 non-Tuner Zombie monster in your GY; banish both it and this card, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Zombie Synchro Monster from your Extra Deck whose Level equals the total Levels those 2 monsters had. You can only use this effect of "Shiranui Spectralsword" once per turn.', '2', '800', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('79783880', 'Shiranui Spectralsword Shade', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/79783880.jpg', 'You can Tribute this card, then target 2 of your banished Zombie monsters, except "Shiranui Spectralsword Shade", including a "Shiranui" monster; Special Summon them in Defense Position, but negate their effects, also, you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except Zombie monsters. You can only use this effect of "Shiranui Spectralsword Shade" once per turn.', '3', '800', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('99423156', 'Shiranui Spiritmaster', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/99423156.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 "Shiranui" monster from your hand or GY, except "Shiranui Spiritmaster", but banish it when it leaves the field. If this card is banished: You can target 1 face-up card your opponent controls; destroy it. You can only use this effect of "Shiranui Spiritmaster" once per turn.', '4', '1500', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('41562624', 'Shiranui Squire', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41562624.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned, you can: Special Summon 1 "Shiranui Spectralsword" monster from your hand or Deck, also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except Zombie monsters. If this card is banished: You can draw 1 card, then discard 1 card. You can only use each effect of "Shiranui Squire" once per turn.', '4', '1500', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('52711246', 'Shiranui Squiresaga', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52711246.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nYou can only Special Summon "Shiranui Squiresaga(s)" once per turn. Once per turn: You can banish 1 face-up monster you control or in your GY, then apply these effects, in sequence, depending on what the monster was before it was banished, if it was any of these.\\r\\n● Zombie: You can have all monsters you control gain 300 ATK.\\r\\n● FIRE: You can destroy 1 Spell/Trap on the field.\\r\\n● Synchro: You can destroy 1 monster on the field.', '7', '2100', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('78765160', 'Shiranui Style Samsara', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78765160.jpg', 'This card''s name becomes "Shiranui Style Synthesis" while it is in the Spell & Trap Zone. Once per turn: You can activate 1 of these effects.\\r\\n● Banish 1 face-up Zombie-Type monster you control; you take no damage this turn (even if this card leaves the field).\\r\\n● Target 2 of your banished Zombie-Type monsters with 0 DEF; shuffle them both into the Deck, then draw 1 card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('40364916', 'Shiranui Style Solemnity', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40364916.jpg', 'This card''s name becomes "Shiranui Style Synthesis" while in the Spell & Trap Zone. Once per turn, you can activate 1 of these effects.\\r\\n● Banish 1 Zombie monster from your GY; the Normal and Special Summons of your Zombie monsters cannot be negated for the rest of this turn (even if this card leaves the field).\\r\\n● Target 1 Zombie monster you control; banish it, then you can send 1 Zombie monster with 0 DEF from your Deck to the GY.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('74798297', 'Shiranui Style Success', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/74798297.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 Zombie monster from your hand, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 Zombie monster you control; that Zombie monster is unaffected by card effects this turn, except its own. You can only use 1 "Shiranui Style Success" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('4333086', 'Shiranui Style Swallow''s Slash', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/4333086.jpg', 'Tribute 1 Zombie-Type monster, then target 2 cards on the field; destroy them, then banish 1 "Shiranui" monster from your Deck. You can only activate 1 "Shiranui Style Swallow''s Slash" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('40005099', 'Shiranui Style Synthesis', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40005099.jpg', 'Once per turn, if you control no monsters: You can send 1 card from your hand to the Graveyard, then activate 1 of these effects.\\r\\n● Target 1 Zombie-Type monster with 0 DEF in your Graveyard; Special Summon it.\\r\\n● Target 1 of your banished Zombie-Type monsters with 0 DEF; return it to the Graveyard.\\r\\nYou can only activate 1 "Shiranui Style Synthesis" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('59843383', 'Shiranui Sunsaga', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59843383.jpg', '1 Zombie Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner Zombie monsters\\r\\nIf this card is Special Summoned: You can return any number of your Zombie Synchro Monsters, that are banished or are in your GY, to the Extra Deck, then you can destroy cards your opponent controls, equal to the number of cards returned. If a Zombie monster(s) you control would be destroyed by battle or card effect, you can banish 1 "Shiranui" monster from your GY instead. You can only Special Summon "Shiranui Sunsaga(s)" once per turn.', '10', '3500', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('5177985', 'Shiranui Swordmaster', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/5177985.jpg', 'If this card is in your GY and you control 2 or more "Shiranui" monsters with different names: You can Special Summon this card, but banish it when it leaves the field. If this card is banished: You can target 1 Zombie monster you control; it gains 600 ATK until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of "Shiranui Swordmaster" once per turn.', '2', '600', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('26326541', 'Shiranui Swordsaga', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/26326541.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nYou can only Special Summon "Shiranui Swordsaga(s)" once per turn. If this card is Special Summoned: You can target 1 monster on the field; change its battle position. If this card is banished: You can Special Summon 1 "Shiranui Token" (Zombie/FIRE/Level 1/ATK 0/DEF 0). You can only use this effect of "Shiranui Swordsaga" once per turn.', '5', '1900', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('2420921', 'Shire, Lightsworn Spirit', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/2420921.jpg', 'This card gains 300 ATK for each "Lightsworn" monster with a different name in your Graveyard. During each of your End Phases: Send the top 2 cards of your Deck to the Graveyard.', '3', '400', '1400', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('15609017', 'Shock Surprise', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/15609017.jpg', 'Banish up to 2 "Speedroid" monsters from your Graveyard, then target that many cards on the field; destroy them.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('38528901', 'Shock Troops of the Ice Barrier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38528901.jpg', 'You can Tribute this card to select 1 face-up WATER monster on the field, destroy it, and add 1 "Ice Barrier" monster from your Deck to your hand.', '3', '1500', '800', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('2584136', 'Shocktopus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/2584136.jpg', 'When this card is destroyed by battle with an opponent''s monster and sent to the Graveyard: You can equip this card to that opponent''s monster. That monster''s ATK becomes 0, also it cannot change its battle position.', '4', '1600', '800', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('41493640', 'Shogi Knight', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41493640.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can target 1 Set card in your opponent''s Spell & Trap Card Zone; reveal that target, then destroy it if it is a Trap Card. Otherwise, return it to its original position. When you destroy a Trap Card by this effect: You can Special Summon 1 Level 3 EARTH monster from your hand in face-up Defense Position.', '3', '800', '400', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('32476434', 'Shogi Lance', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32476434.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can target 1 other Level 3 Beast-Warrior-Type monster you control; the Levels of that monster and this card become the combined Levels of those monsters.', '3', '500', '500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('40939228', 'Shooting Majestic Star Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40939228.jpg', '"Majestic Dragon" + 1+ non-Tuner monsters, including a Dragon Synchro Monster\\r\\nMust first be Synchro Summoned. Once per turn: You can negate the effects of 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls. This card gains 1 additional attack each Battle Phase for every monster in your GY that is "Stardust Dragon" or is a Synchro Monster with "Stardust Dragon" in its text. Once per turn, when your opponent activates a card or effect (Quick Effect): You can banish this card (until the End Phase), and if you do, negate the activation, and if you do that, banish that card.', '11', '4000', '3300', 'WIND', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('35952884', 'Shooting Quasar Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/35952884.jpg', '1 Tuner Synchro Monster + 2 or more non-Tuner Synchro Monsters\\nMust be Synchro Summoned, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. This card''s maximum number of attacks per Battle Phase equals the number of non-Tuner monsters used as its Synchro Material. Once per turn, during either player''s turn, when a card or effect is activated: You can negate the activation, and if you do, destroy it. When this card leaves the field: You can Special Summon 1 "Shooting Star Dragon" from your Extra Deck.', '12', '4000', '4000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('68431965', 'Shooting Riser Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/68431965.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nIf this card is Synchro Summoned: You can send 1 monster from your Deck to the GY, whose Level is lower than this card''s on the field, and if you do, reduce this card''s Level by that monster''s, but for the rest of this turn, you cannot activate the effects of monsters with the same name the sent monster had in the GY. You can only use this effect of "Shooting Riser Dragon" once per turn. Once per Chain, during your opponent''s Main Phase, you can (Quick Effect): Immediately after this effect resolves, Synchro Summon using this card you control.', '7', '2100', '1700', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Tuner Monster');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('47264717', 'Shooting Star', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/47264717.jpg', 'If a "Stardust" monster is on the field: Target 1 card on the field; destroy that target.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('95638658', 'Shooting Star Bow - Ceal', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/95638658.jpg', 'The equipped monster loses 1000 ATK, but it can attack your opponent directly.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('24696097', 'Shooting Star Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/24696097.jpg', '1 Tuner Synchro Monster + "Stardust Dragon"\\nOnce per turn: You can excavate the top 5 cards of your Deck, shuffle them back in, also this card''s maximum number of attacks per Battle Phase this turn equals the number of Tuner monsters excavated. Once per turn, during either player''s turn, when a card or effect is activated that would destroy a card(s) on the field: You can negate the effect, and if you do, destroy it. Once per turn, when an opponent''s monster declares an attack: You can target the attacking monster; banish this card, and if you do, negate that attack. During the next End Phase: Special Summon this card banished by this effect.', '10', '3300', '2500', 'WIND', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('596051', 'Snake Fang', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/596051.jpg', 'Decrease 1 selected monster''s DEF by 500 points during the turn this card is activated.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('63180841', 'Shooting Star Dragon T.G. EX', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/63180841.jpg', '1 Tuner Synchro Monster + 1+ non-Tuner Synchro Monsters\\r\\nWhen a monster effect is activated that targets a monster(s) you control (Quick Effect): You can banish 1 Tuner from your GY; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card. You can only use each of the following effects of "Shooting Star Dragon T.G. EX" once per turn.\\r\\n● When an opponent''s monster declares an attack: You can negate the attack.\\r\\n● During your opponent''s turn, if this card is in your GY (Quick Effect): You can Tribute 2 Synchro Monsters; Special Summon this card.', '10', '3300', '2500', 'WIND', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('33897356', 'Shootingcode Talker', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33897356.jpg', '2+ Cyberse monsters\\r\\nAt the start of your Battle Phase: You can activate this effect; this Battle Phase, this card can make attacks on your opponent''s monsters, up to the number of monsters this card currently points to +1, but this turn, when it attacks your opponent''s only monster, this card loses 400 ATK during that damage calculation only. At the end of each Battle Phase: You can draw cards equal to the number of monsters this card destroyed by battle this turn.', '0', '2300', '0', 'WATER', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('5908650', 'Shopina the Melodious Maestra', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/5908650.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can target 1 LIGHT Fairy-Type monster in your Graveyard; add it to your hand. You cannot activate non-LIGHT monster effects during the turn you activate this effect.', '7', '2300', '1700', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('14771222', 'Shore Knight', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14771222.jpg', 'Once per turn, if the battle position of this face-up card on the field is changed: Send 1 WATER monster from your Deck to the GY.', '4', '1400', '1200', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('75967082', 'Short Circuit', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75967082.jpg', 'Activate only if you control 3 or more "Batteryman" monsters. Destroy all cards your opponent controls.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('71950093', 'Shovel Crusher', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/71950093.jpg', 'Armed with a pair of shovels, this monster will destroy anything that stands in its way.', '3', '900', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('92080692', 'Showdown of the Secret Sense Scroll Techniques', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/92080692.jpg', 'When your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, with the same name as a card in their GY: Negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Counter Trap'),
('3603242', 'Shreddder', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/3603242.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can send 1 Machine-Type monster from your hand to the Graveyard, then target 1 monster your opponent controls with a Level less than or equal to the sent monster''s; destroy that target.', '4', '1600', '1000', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('4215636', 'Shrine of Mist Valley', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/4215636.jpg', 'Once per turn, when a WIND monster(s) is destroyed by a card effect and sent to your Graveyard (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon 1 Level 3 or lower WIND monster from your hand or Deck. Its effects are negated.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('55713623', 'Shrink', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/55713623.jpg', 'Target 1 face-up monster on the field; its original ATK becomes halved until the end of this turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('14816688', 'Shuffle Reborn', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14816688.jpg', 'If you control no monsters: Target 1 monster in your GY; Special Summon it, but it has its effects negated, also banish it during the End Phase. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 card you control; shuffle it into the Deck, then draw 1 card, also during the End Phase of this turn, banish 1 card from your hand. You can only use this effect of "Shuffle Reborn" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('32615065', 'Shura the Combat Star', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32615065.jpg', '"Idaten the Conqueror Star" + 1 Level 5 or higher Warrior monster\\r\\nOnce per turn, during the Battle Phase (Quick Effect): You can make the ATK of all face-up monsters your opponent currently controls 0. Once per battle, if a monster battles another monster, during damage calculation (Quick Effect): You can make each battling monster gain ATK equal to its own Level x 200, during that damage calculation only. If this Fusion Summoned card you control is destroyed by an opponent''s card and sent to your GY: You can Special Summon 1 "Idaten the Conqueror Star" from your Extra Deck. (This is treated as a Fusion Summon.)', '12', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('90307777', 'Shurit, Strategist of the Nekroz', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90307777.jpg', 'If you Ritual Summon exactly 1 "Nekroz" Ritual Monster with a card effect that requires use of monsters, this card can be used as the entire requirement. If this card is Tributed by a card effect: You can add 1 Warrior "Nekroz" Ritual Monster from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Shurit, Strategist of the Nekroz" once per turn.', '3', '300', '1800', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('65422840', 'Shutendoji', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65422840.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can activate 1 of these effects.\\n● Banish 2 Zombie monsters from your GY; draw 1 card.\\n● Target 1 of your banished Zombie monsters; place that target on the top of your Deck.', '4', '1500', '800', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('10449150', 'Shuttleroid', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/10449150.jpg', 'When this card is targeted for an attack: You can banish this card. During your next Standby Phase: Special Summon this card banished by this effect. If Summoned this way: Inflict 1000 damage to your opponent.', '4', '1000', '1200', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('30922149', 'Side Effects?', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30922149.jpg', 'Your opponent draws 1 to 3 cards, then you gain 2000 LP for each card they drew with this effect.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('9634146', 'Signal Warrior', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/9634146.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nOnce per turn, during the Standby Phase: Place 1 Signal Counter on each face-up card in the Field Zone, also place 1 on this card. This card with a Signal Counter(s) cannot be destroyed by battle or your opponent''s card effects. Once per turn: You can remove 4, 7, or 10 Signal Counters from anywhere on the field; apply this effect, depending on the number removed.\\r\\n● 4: Inflict 800 damage to your opponent. ● 7: Draw 1 card. ● 10: Destroy 1 card on the field.', '7', '2400', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('85277313', 'Signs of the Tistina', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85277313.jpg', 'Activate this card by targeting 1 face-up monster on the field; Special Summon this card as an Effect Monster (Aqua/LIGHT/Level 10/ATK 0/DEF 0) with the following effect (this card is also still a Trap).\\r\\n● During your opponent''s turn, when that target leaves the field, destroy this card. During your opponent''s turn, when this card leaves the field, destroy that target.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('86442081', 'Silent Abyss', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86442081.jpg', 'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, destroy all face-down and non-WATER monsters.', '7', '2000', '1500', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('44968459', 'Silent Burning', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/44968459.jpg', 'During the Battle Phase, if you control a "Silent Magician" monster, and have more cards in your hand than your opponent: Each player draws until they have 6 cards in their hand. This card''s activation and effect cannot be negated. You can banish this card from your Graveyard; add 1 "Silent Magician" monster from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('42534368', 'Silent Doom', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/42534368.jpg', 'Target 1 Normal Monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it in face-up Defense Position, but it cannot attack.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('53778229', 'Silent Graveyard', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53778229.jpg', 'Discard 1 card; effects that activate in the GY this turn are negated.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('40867519', 'Silent Insect', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40867519.jpg', 'This card is changed to Defense Position when it is Normal Summoned or Flip Summoned. Negate the effects of all Continuous Spell Cards and Continuous Trap Cards.', '2', '200', '300', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('41175645', 'Silent Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41175645.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by Tributing 1 Spellcaster-Type monster, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. This card gains 500 ATK for each card in your hand. Once per turn, during either player''s turn, when a Spell Card is activated: You can negate the activation. If this card is destroyed by battle, or if this card in its owner''s control is destroyed by an opponent''s card effect: You can Special Summon 1 "Silent Magician" monster from your hand or Deck, except "Silent Magician", ignoring its Summoning conditions.', '4', '1000', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('73665146', 'Silent Magician LV4', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/73665146.jpg', 'Each time your opponent draws a card(s), place 1 Spell Counter on this card (max. 5). This card gains 500 ATK for each Spell Counter on it. During the Standby Phase of your next turn after the 5th Spell Counter is placed on this card: You can send this face-up card with 5 Spell Counters on it to the Graveyard; Special Summon 1 "Silent Magician LV8" from your hand or Deck.', '4', '1000', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('72443568', 'Silent Magician LV8', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/72443568.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned by "Silent Magician LV4" and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. Unaffected by your opponent''s Spell effects.', '8', '3500', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('65726770', 'Silent Magician Zero', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65726770.jpg', 'If your opponent draws a card(s): Increase this card''s Level by the number drawn. While this card''s Level is higher than its original Level, it gains ATK equal to the difference x 500. When your opponent activates a Spell Card or effect, while you control "Shining Sarcophagus" (Quick Effect): You can negate the activation, and if you do, increase this card''s Level by 1. You can only use this effect of "Silent Magician Zero" once per turn.', '4', '1000', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('19502505', 'Silent Paladin', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/19502505.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can add 1 "Silent Swordsman LV3" or "Silent Magician LV4" from your Deck to your hand. During either player''s turn, when a Spell Card is activated that targets exactly 1 monster you control (and no other cards): You can negate the activation. This effect can only be used once while this card is face-up on the field. If this card is destroyed by battle, or if this card in its owner''s control is destroyed by an opponent''s card effect: You can target 1 LIGHT "LV" monster in your Graveyard; add it to your hand.', '4', '500', '1500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
