('86489182', 'Simorgh, Bird of Ancestry', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86489182.jpg', 'Both players Tribute Summon WIND monsters with 1 less Tribute than required. If you Tribute Summon this card by Tributing only WIND monsters, return up to 2 cards your opponent controls to their owner''s hand. This card is treated as a Normal Monster while in your hand.', '8', '2900', '2000', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
