('19891131', 'Time Thief Regulator', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/19891131.jpg', 'If you control no other monsters: You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 2 "Time Thief" monsters with different names from your Deck in Defense Position, except "Time Thief Regulator". When an Xyz Monster you control is destroyed by battle, while this card is in your GY: You can Special Summon this card, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use each effect of "Time Thief Regulator" once per turn.', '4', '600', '200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('76587747', 'Time Thief Retrograde', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/76587747.jpg', 'When a Spell/Trap Card is activated while you control a "Time Thief" Xyz Monster: Negate the activation, and if you do, attach that card to a "Time Thief" Xyz Monster you control as material. You can only activate 1 "Time Thief Retrograde" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Counter Trap'),
('10877309', 'Time Thief Startup', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/10877309.jpg', 'Special Summon 1 "Time Thief" monster from your hand. During your Main Phase: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 "Time Thief" Xyz Monster you control; attach 3 "Time Thief" cards of different types (1 Monster, 1 Spell, and 1 Trap) from your GY to that monster as material. You can only use 1 "Time Thief Startup" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('52083044', 'Time Thief Temporwhal', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52083044.jpg', 'You can Tribute this card, then target 1 monster your opponent controls; banish it until the End Phase. If this card is in your GY: You can target 1 "Time Thief" monster you control, except "Time Thief Temporwhal"; return that monster to the hand, and if you do, Special Summon this card, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use each effect of "Time Thief Temporwhal" once per turn.', '4', '800', '1400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('56308388', 'Time Thief Winder', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/56308388.jpg', 'You can detach 1 material from an Xyz Monster you control; Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Time Thief" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Time Thief Winder". You can only use each effect of "Time Thief Winder" once per turn.', '4', '1800', '1300', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('68490573', 'Time to Stand Up', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/68490573.jpg', 'If a Dragon Synchro Monster is on the field: Special Summon up to 2 monsters, that are "Resonator" monsters and/or Level 1 Dragon monsters, from your Deck. When a monster effect is activated, while you control a Level 10 or higher DARK Dragon Synchro Monster: You can banish this card from your GY; negate that effect, and if you do, 1 Synchro Monster you control gains 2000 ATK until the end of the next turn. You can only use each effect of "Time to Stand Up" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('71625222', 'Time Wizard', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/71625222.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can toss a coin and call it. If you call it right, destroy all monsters your opponent controls. If you call it wrong, destroy as many monsters you control as possible, and if you do, take damage equal to half the total ATK those destroyed monsters had while face-up on the field.', '2', '500', '400', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('26273196', 'Time Wizard of Tomorrow', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/26273196.jpg', '"Time Wizard" + 1 Effect Monster\\r\\nOnce per turn, while you control this Fusion Summoned card: You can toss a coin and call it. Destroy as many monsters on the field as possible, and if you do, inflict damage equal to half the total original ATK of the destroyed face-up monsters. If you called the coin toss right, your opponent takes the damage, if you called it wrong, you take the damage.', '5', '2000', '1900', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('80335817', 'Timebreaker Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/80335817.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nEach turn, the first Pendulum Monster(s) you control that would be destroyed by an opponent''s card effect, is not destroyed.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\nWhen this card is Pendulum Summoned from the hand (and no other cards are Pendulum Summoned at the same time): You can make this card''s ATK become double its original ATK. Once per turn: You can target 1 monster on the field; banish both it and this card from the field until your next Standby Phase.', '3', '1400', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('20409757', 'Timegazer Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/20409757.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nYou must control no monsters to activate this card. If a Pendulum Monster you control battles, your opponent cannot activate Trap Cards until the end of the Damage Step. Unless you have a "Magician" card or "Odd-Eyes" card in your other Pendulum Zone, this card''s Pendulum Scale becomes 4.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\nEach turn, the first card(s) in your Pendulum Zone that would be destroyed by an opponent''s card effect, is not destroyed.', '3', '1200', '600', 'DARK', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('67508932', 'Timelord Progenitor Vorpgate', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/67508932.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nCannot be destroyed by battle or card effects. You take no battle damage from attacks involving this card. At the end of the Damage Step, if this card that was Special Summoned from the Extra Deck battled: You can activate this effect; banish all monsters your opponent controls, also, for the rest of this turn, halve the battle damage your opponent takes. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this effect was activated this turn: Special Summon as many monsters as possible that you banished with this card''s effect, to your opponent''s field.', '10', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('47349116', 'Timestar Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/47349116.jpg', '2 Level 4 "Magician" Pendulum Monsters\\r\\nMust first be Xyz Summoned with the above Xyz Materials. Once per turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; add to your hand, 1 DARK Spellcaster-Type monster from your Deck, Graveyard, or face-up from your Extra Deck. Once per turn, if a Pendulum Monster Card(s) in your Monster Zone or Pendulum Zone would be destroyed by battle or card effect, you can send 1 Spellcaster-Type monster from your Deck to the Graveyard instead.', '4', '2400', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('40350910', 'Timidity', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/40350910.jpg', 'Neither player can destroy Set Spell and Trap Cards on the field until your opponent''s next End Phase.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('66506689', 'Tin Archduke', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66506689.jpg', '3 Level 4 monsters\\nOnce per turn, during either player''s turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card, then target 1 monster your opponent controls; change its battle position. (Flip monsters'' effects are not activated.)', '4', '2200', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('18063928', 'Tin Goldfish', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/18063928.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 Level 4 monster from your hand.', '4', '800', '2000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('75119040', 'Tindangle Acute Cerberus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75119040.jpg', '3 "Tindangle" monsters\\r\\nGains 3000 ATK if you have 3 or more "Tindangle" monsters with different names in your GY, including "Tindangle Base Gardna". Gains 500 ATK for each "Tindangle" monster it points to. At the end of the Battle Phase, if this card declared an attack: You can Special Summon 1 "Tindangle Token" (Fiend/DARK/Level 1/ATK 0/DEF 0).', '0', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('68860936', 'Tindangle Angel', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/68860936.jpg', 'FLIP: You can Special Summon 1 Flip monster from your hand or GY in face-down Defense Position, except "Tindangle Angel", then, if it is your opponent''s Battle Phase, end the Battle Phase. You can only use this effect of "Tindangle Angel" once per turn.', '4', '500', '1800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('94365540', 'Tindangle Base Gardna', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94365540.jpg', 'If you control a face-down Defense Position monster, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand) in Defense Position. You can only Special Summon "Tindangle Base Gardna" once per turn this way. If a monster is Normal or Special Summoned, and is now pointed to by an opponent''s Link Monster (except during the Damage Step): You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 "Tindangle" monster from your hand or Deck in Attack Position or face-down Defense Position.', '5', '0', '2300', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('99157310', 'Tindangle Delaunay', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/99157310.jpg', 'When you take battle damage from an opponent''s attacking monster, while you have 3 or more "Tindangle" monsters with different names in your GY: You can destroy the attacking monster, and if you do, Special Summon 1 "Tindangle Acute Cerberus" from your Extra Deck. If you control no monsters in the Extra Monster Zone: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 3 "Tindangle" monsters with different names in your GY; Special Summon them in face-down Defense Position.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('12678601', 'Tindangle Dholes', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12678601.jpg', 'FLIP: You can send 1 Spell/Trap from your Deck to the GY.\\r\\nIf this card is sent from the hand or Deck to the GY: You can target 1 "Tindangle" monster in your GY, except "Tindangle Dholes"; Special Summon it in face-down Defense Position. You can only use each of the preceding effects of "Tindangle Dholes" once per turn. A "Tindangle" Link Monster that used this card as material can make 3 attacks during each Battle Phase.', '5', '1000', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('31759689', 'Tindangle Hound', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31759689.jpg', 'FLIP: You can target 1 other face-up monster on the field; this card gains ATK equal to that target''s original ATK, then change that target to face-down Defense Position.\\r\\nEach monster your opponent controls loses 1000 ATK for each monster linked to it. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect and sent to the GY: You can target 1 face-down monster on the field; change it to face-up Defense Position.', '7', '2500', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('94142993', 'Tindangle Intruder', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94142993.jpg', 'FLIP: You can add 1 "Tindangle" card from your Deck to your hand.\\r\\nWhen this card is Normal Summoned: You can send 1 "Tindangle" card from your Deck to the GY. If a monster(s) is Special Summoned to your field in face-down Defense Position while this card is in your GY: Special Summon this card in face-down Defense Position (this is not optional). You can only use each effect of "Tindangle Intruder" once per turn.', '6', '2200', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('24158464', 'Tindangle Jhrelth', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/24158464.jpg', 'FLIP: You can take 1 Flip monster from your Deck, except "Tindangle Jhrelth", and either add it to your hand or send it to the GY.\\r\\nIf this card is in your hand: You can discard 1 other card; send 1 "Tindangle" card from your Deck to the GY, except "Tindangle Jhrelth", and if you do, Special Summon this card in face-down Defense Position. You can only use each effect of "Tindangle Jhrelth" once per turn.', '3', '0', '1800', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('67744384', 'Tindangle Protector', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/67744384.jpg', 'FLIP: You can change up to 3 face-down Defense Position monsters you control to face-up Defense Position, then if all those monsters are "Tindangle" monsters, you can add up to that many "Tindangle" cards from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Tindangle Protector" once per turn.', '3', '800', '1600', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('11375683', 'Tindangle Trinity', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/11375683.jpg', 'FLIP: You can Special Summon 1 "Tindangle Base Gardna" from your Deck.\\r\\nIf this card was flipped face-up, your "Tindangle" monsters cannot be destroyed by battle. If this card is sent to the GY as Link Material for the Link Summon of a "Tindangle" monster: You can add 1 "Gergonne''s End" from your Deck to your hand, and if you do, send 1 Spell/Trap from your Deck to the GY. You can only use this effect of "Tindangle Trinity" once per turn.', '4', '0', '1500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('85640370', 'Tip of the Tongue Reduction', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85640370.jpg', 'When your opponent activates a card or effect by declaring exactly 1 card name: Negate that effect, then you can add 1 card with that name from your Deck to your hand. If this Set card in its owner''s control is destroyed by an opponent''s card effect: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; it loses 500 ATK.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('31386180', 'Tiras, Keeper of Genesis', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31386180.jpg', '2 Level 5 monsters\\nThis card''s effects can only be applied/resolved while it has Xyz Material. This card cannot be destroyed by card effects. At the end of the Battle Phase, if this card attacked or was attacked: Target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy that target. During each of your End Phases: Detach 1 Xyz Material from this card.', '5', '2600', '1700', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('54387923', 'TiSolfachord Beautia', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54387923.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nYour opponent cannot activate a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, when your "Solfachord" Pendulum Monster(s) is Pendulum Summoned.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\n(Quick Effect): You can target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls, or, if you have an even Pendulum Scale in your Pendulum Zone, you can target 1 face-up Spell/Trap your opponent controls; this turn, banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use this effect of "TiSolfachord Beautia" once per turn. Once per turn, at the start of the Damage Step, if this card battles a monster with an equal or higher ATK than the lowest Pendulum Scale in your Pendulum Zone x 300: Destroy that monster.', '7', '2500', '2400', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('87676171', 'Tistina, the Divinity that Defies Darkness', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/87676171.jpg', '2 Level 10 monsters\\r\\nIf this card is Special Summoned: You can send all face-down cards your opponent controls to the GY. You can only use this effect of "Tistina, the Divinity that Defies Darkness" once per turn. Once per turn, if this card has "Crystal God Tistina" as material: You can detach 1 material from this card; it gains 2000 ATK until the end of your opponent''s turn. If this card you control is destroyed by an opponent''s card while it has material: You can Special Summon 1 "Tistina" monster from your GY.', '10', '2000', '3000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('41373230', 'Titaniklad the Ash Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41373230.jpg', '"Fallen of Albaz" + 1 monster with 2500 or more ATK\\r\\nGains ATK equal to the combined original Levels of the monsters used for its Fusion Summon x 100. After this card is Fusion Summoned, for the rest of this turn, it is unaffected by the activated effects of any other monsters Special Summoned from the Extra Deck. During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add to your hand, or Special Summon, 1 "Fallen of Albaz" or "Dogmatika" monster from your Deck. You can only use this effect of "Titaniklad the Ash Dragon" once per turn.', '8', '2500', '2500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('67037924', 'Titanocider', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/67037924.jpg', 'Target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls that was Special Summoned from the Extra Deck; change its ATK to 0, and if you do, negate its effects. If your opponent Special Summons a monster(s) from the Extra Deck while this card is in your GY, except the turn this card was sent to the GY: You can Set this card. You can only use each effect of "Titanocider" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('82319644', 'Tlakalel, His Malevolent Majesty', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/82319644.jpg', 'If this card is Tribute Summoned: You can destroy any number of face-up monsters your opponent controls whose combined ATK is less than or equal to the original ATK of the monster Tributed to Tribute Summon this card.', '5', '2400', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('62671448', 'Toad Master', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/62671448.jpg', '''''A hermit frog that has been in existence for thousands of years, it attacks with tadpoles.''''', '3', '1000', '1000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('90809975', 'Toadally Awesome', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90809975.jpg', '2 Level 2 Aqua-Type monsters\\nOnce per turn, during the Standby Phase: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; Special Summon 1 "Frog" monster from your Deck. Once per turn, during either player''s turn, when your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect: You can send 1 Aqua-Type monster from your hand or face-up from your field to the Graveyard; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card, then you can Set it to your field. If this card is sent to the Graveyard: You can target 1 WATER monster in your Graveyard; add it to your hand.', '2', '2200', '0', 'WATER', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('31887806', 'Tobari the Sky Ninja', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31887806.jpg', 'This card cannot be destroyed by battle or card effect the turn it was Special Summoned or flipped face-up. You can only use each of the following effects of "Tobari the Sky Ninja" once per turn. You can send this card from your hand to the GY; Special Summon 1 "Ninja" monster from your hand in face-up or face-down Defense Position. During your opponent''s Main or Battle Phase (Quick Effect): You can Fusion Summon 1 "Ninja" Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field as material.', '1', '0', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('30118701', 'Todoroki the Earthbolt Star', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30118701.jpg', 'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by sending 1 other monster from your hand to the GY, but this card loses 500 ATK. You can only Special Summon "Todoroki the Earthbolt Star" once per turn this way. During the Battle Phase (Quick Effect): You can pay 500 LP; Fusion Summon 1 Warrior Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field as material. You can only use this effect of "Todoroki the Earthbolt Star" once per turn.', '6', '2100', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('33878931', 'Togex', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33878931.jpg', '''''An agile monster that rolls up to ram its opponents.''''', '5', '1600', '1800', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('35686188', 'Tragedy', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/35686188.jpg', 'When a face-up Attack Position monster(s) your opponent controls is changed to face-up Defense Position: Destroy all Defense Position monsters your opponent controls.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('43534808', 'Token Collector', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43534808.jpg', 'If a Token is Special Summoned (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from the GY (if it was there when the Token was Special Summoned) or hand (even if not). You can only use this effect of "Token Collector" once per turn. If this card is Special Summoned: Destroy as many Tokens on the field as possible, and if you do, this card gains 400 ATK for each Token destroyed. Neither player can Special Summon Tokens.', '4', '0', '2000', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('83675475', 'Token Feastevil', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/83675475.jpg', 'When a Token(s) is Special Summoned: Destroy as many Tokens on the field as possible, and if you do, inflict 300 damage to your opponent for each Token destroyed.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('14342283', 'Token Stampede', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14342283.jpg', 'All Tokens in Attack Position gain 1000 ATK, also they cannot be destroyed by battle.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('52971673', 'Token Sundae', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52971673.jpg', 'Destroy all Tokens you control, then destroy cards on the field up to the number of Tokens destroyed by this effect.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('53545926', 'Token Support', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53545926.jpg', 'You can Tribute any number of Tokens, then target 1 monster you control with 0 ATK; it gains ATK equal to the number Tributed x 1000 (until the end of this turn), and if it does, it can attack monsters up to the number Tributed during each Battle Phase this turn. You can only use this effect of "Token Support" once per turn. At the end of your opponent''s Battle Phase: You can Special Summon "Support Tokens" (Beast/EARTH/Level 1/ATK 0/DEF 0) up to the number of Tokens destroyed during this Battle Phase.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('57182235', 'Token Thanksgiving', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57182235.jpg', 'Destroy all tokens on the field. Increase your Life Points by the number of tokens destroyed x 800 points.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('82361206', 'Tokkosho of Ghost Destroying', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/82361206.jpg', 'When the equipped monster inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent, you can select up to 2 monsters in your opponent''s Graveyard, and remove them from play.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('50357013', 'Tokusano Shinkyojin', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/50357013.jpg', 'Send monster(s) from your hand and/or face-up field to the GY whose total Levels equal 10; draw 2 cards.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('82003859', 'Toll', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/82003859.jpg', 'Each player must pay 500 Life Points to declare an attack.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('44716890', 'Toll Hike', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/44716890.jpg', 'Each player must send 1 card from their hand to the GY to declare an attack.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('46457856', 'Tomozaurus', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46457856.jpg', 'Small but vicious, this monster even attacks its own kind.', '2', '500', '400', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('91250514', 'Tongue Twister', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91250514.jpg', 'If this card was Tribute Summoned, when it is sent from the field to the Graveyard, draw 2 cards and remove this card from play.', '6', '400', '300', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('69572024', 'Tongyo', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/69572024.jpg', 'This monster captures other fish with its long tongue and sucks the energy out of them.', '4', '1350', '800', 'WATER', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('70508653', 'Tool Box', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70508653.jpg', 'If you control a monster: You can reveal 2 Equip Spells from your Deck with different names, your opponent randomly picks 1 for you to add to your hand, also place the remaining card on the bottom of your Deck. You can only use this effect of "Tool Box" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('59383041', 'Toon Alligator', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59383041.jpg', 'An alligator monster straight from the cartoons.', '4', '800', '1600', 'WATER', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('7171149', 'Toon Ancient Gear Golem', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/7171149.jpg', 'Cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon monsters, this card can attack your opponent directly. If this card attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage to your opponent. If this card attacks, your opponent cannot activate any Spell/Trap Cards until the end of the Damage Step.', '8', '3000', '3000', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('28112535', 'Toon Barrel Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/28112535.jpg', 'Cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon monsters, this card can attack your opponent directly. Once per turn: You can target 1 card on the field; toss a coin 3 times and destroy it if at least 2 of the results are Heads.', '7', '2600', '2200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('28711704', 'Toon Black Luster Soldier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/28711704.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by Tributing Toon monsters from your hand or field, whose total Levels equal 8 or more. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon monsters, this card can attack directly. Once per turn, if you control "Toon World": You can target 1 card on the field; banish it, also this card cannot attack the turn this effect is activated.', '8', '3000', '2500', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('91500017', 'Toon Bookmark', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91500017.jpg', 'Add 1 "Toon World", or 1 card that specifically lists the card "Toon World" in its text, from your Deck to your hand, except "Toon Bookmark". If a "Toon World(s)" you control would be destroyed by card effect, you can banish this card from your GY instead. You can only activate 1 "Toon Bookmark" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('5832914', 'Toon Briefcase', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/5832914.jpg', 'When your opponent Summons a monster(s) while you control a Toon monster: Shuffle that monster(s) into the Deck.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('61190918', 'Toon Buster Blader', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/61190918.jpg', 'Cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. Gains 500 ATK for each Dragon monster your opponent controls or is in their GY. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon monsters, this card can attack your opponent directly.', '7', '2600', '2300', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('79875176', 'Toon Cannon Soldier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/79875176.jpg', 'This card cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. If "Toon World" on the field is destroyed, destroy this card. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon Monsters, this card can attack your opponent directly. You can Tribute 1 monster; inflict 500 damage to your opponent.', '4', '1400', '1300', 'DARK', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('14883228', 'Typhoon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14883228.jpg', 'Target 1 face-up Spell/Trap on the field; destroy it. If your opponent controls 2 or more Spells/Traps and you control no Spells/Traps, you can activate this card from your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('21296502', 'Toon Dark Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/21296502.jpg', 'Cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon monsters, this card can attack your opponent directly. Once per turn: You can discard 1 "Toon" card, then activate 1 of these effects;\\n● Special Summon 1 Toon monster from your Deck, except "Toon Dark Magician", ignoring its Summoning conditions.\\n● Add 1 "Toon" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand.', '7', '2500', '2100', 'DARK', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('90960358', 'Toon Dark Magician Girl', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90960358.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by Tributing 1 monster, while you control "Toon World". If "Toon World" on the field is destroyed, destroy this card. Can attack your opponent directly, unless they control a Toon monster, in which case this card must target a Toon monster for its attacks. Gains 300 ATK for every "Dark Magician" or "Magician of Black Chaos" in either player''s GY.', '6', '2000', '1700', 'DARK', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('43509019', 'Toon Defense', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43509019.jpg', 'When an opponent''s monster declares an attack targeting a face-up Level 4 or lower Toon Monster you control: You can make the attack a direct attack instead.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('42386471', 'Toon Gemini Elf', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/42386471.jpg', 'Cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. If "Toon World" on the field is destroyed, destroy this card. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon monsters, this card can attack your opponent directly. If this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent: Discard 1 random card from your opponent''s hand.', '4', '1900', '900', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('15270885', 'Toon Goblin Attack Force', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/15270885.jpg', 'This card cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. If "Toon World" on the field is destroyed, destroy this card. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon Monsters, this card can attack your opponent directly. If this card attacks, it is changed to Defense Position at the end of the Battle Phase, and its battle position cannot be changed until the End Phase of your next turn.', '4', '2300', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('64116319', 'Toon Harpie Lady', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/64116319.jpg', 'Cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. If you control "Toon World": You can Special Summon this card from your hand, then, if you control another Toon monster, you can destroy 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls. You can only use this effect of "Toon Harpie Lady" once per turn. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon monsters, this card can attack directly.', '4', '1300', '1400', 'WIND', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('43175858', 'Toon Kingdom', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/43175858.jpg', 'When this card is activated: Banish 3 cards from the top of your Deck, face-down. This card''s name becomes "Toon World" while in the Field Zone. Your opponent cannot target Toon monsters you control with card effects. If a Toon monster(s) you control would be destroyed by battle or card effect, you can banish 1 card from the top of your Deck, face-down, for each of those monster(s) instead.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('79447365', 'Toon Mask', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/79447365.jpg', 'If you control "Toon World": Target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; Special Summon 1 Toon monster from your hand or Deck, whose Level is less than or equal to the Level/Rank of that monster, ignoring its Summoning conditions.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('16392422', 'Toon Masked Sorcerer', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/16392422.jpg', 'Cannot attack the turn it is Summoned. If "Toon World" on the field is destroyed, destroy this card. While you control "Toon World" and your opponent controls no Toon monsters, this card can attack your opponent directly. If this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent: Draw 1 card.', '4', '900', '1400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('65458948', 'Toon Mermaid', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65458948.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand), while you control "Toon World". Cannot attack the turn it is Special Summoned. You must pay 500 LP to declare an attack with this monster. If "Toon World" on the field is destroyed, destroy this card. Can attack your opponent directly, unless they control a Toon monster, in which case this card must target a Toon monster for its attacks.', '4', '1400', '1500', 'WATER', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('27699122', 'Toon Page-Flip', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/27699122.jpg', 'If you control "Toon World": Reveal 3 Toon monsters with different names from your Deck, your opponent randomly picks 1 for you to Special Summon, ignoring its Summoning conditions, also shuffle the rest into your Deck. You can only activate 1 "Toon Page-Flip" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('70560957', 'Toon Rollback', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70560957.jpg', 'Target 1 Toon monster you control; it can make a second attack during each Battle Phase this turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('91842653', 'Toon Summoned Skull', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91842653.jpg', '(This card is always treated as an "Archfiend" card.)\\nCannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by Tributing 1 monster, while you control "Toon World". Cannot attack the turn it is Special Summoned. You must pay 500 LP to declare an attack with this monster. If "Toon World" on the field is destroyed, destroy this card. Can attack your opponent directly, unless they control a Toon monster, in which case this card must target a Toon monster for its attacks.', '6', '2500', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Toon Monster'),
('89997728', 'Toon Table of Contents', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/89997728.jpg', 'Add 1 "Toon" card from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('53094821', 'Toon Terror', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53094821.jpg', 'When a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, is activated, while you control both "Toon World" and a Toon monster(s): Negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card. You can only activate 1 "Toon Terror" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Counter Trap'),
('15259703', 'Toon World', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/15259703.jpg', 'Activate this card by paying 1000 LP.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('53623827', 'Top Runner', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53623827.jpg', 'All face-up Synchro Monsters you control gain 600 ATK.', '4', '1100', '800', 'WIND', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('90359458', 'Top Share', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90359458.jpg', 'Reveal 1 card from your Deck and place it on top of your Deck, then your opponent reveals 1 card from their Deck and places it on top of their Deck. You can only activate 1 "Top Share" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('70825459', 'Trap Tracks', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70825459.jpg', 'Target 1 monster you control; destroy it, and if you do, Set 1 Normal Trap directly from your Deck, except "Trap Tracks". It can be activated this turn. You can only activate 1 Trap Card for the rest of this turn after this card resolves. You can only activate 1 "Trap Tracks" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('30064423', 'Topologic Blaster Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30064423.jpg', '2+ Effect Monsters\\r\\nYou cannot Summon/Set monsters to any Extra Monster Zone this card points to. If a monster(s) is Special Summoned to a zone a Link Monster points to, while this card is in the Extra Monster Zone: Apply 1 of these effects, but you cannot apply that same effect of "Topologic Blaster Dragon" again this turn.\\r\\n● Shuffle all other monsters on the field into the Deck.\\r\\n● Shuffle all Spells and Traps on the field into the Deck.\\r\\n● Look at your opponent''s Extra Deck and banish 1 card from it.', '0', '3500', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('5821478', 'Topologic Bomber Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/5821478.jpg', '2+ Effect Monsters\\nIf another monster is Special Summoned to a zone a Link Monster points to, while this monster is on the field: Destroy all monsters in the Main Monster Zones, also your other monsters cannot attack for the rest of this turn. After damage calculation, if this card attacked an opponent''s monster: Inflict damage to your opponent equal to that monster''s original ATK.', '0', '3000', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('22593417', 'Topologic Gumblar Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22593417.jpg', '2+ Effect Monsters\\r\\nIf another monster is Special Summoned to a zone a Link Monster points to, while this monster is on the field: Discard 1 or 2 random cards, then your opponent discards the same number. During your Main Phase, if this card is Extra Linked and your opponent has at least 1 card in their hand: You can make your opponent discard 1 or 2 cards (whichever is higher), then, if they have no more cards in their hand, inflict 3000 damage to them. You can only use 1 "Topologic Gumblar Dragon" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '3000', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('72529749', 'Topologic Trisbaena', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/72529749.jpg', '2+ Effect Monsters\\r\\nIf a monster(s) is Special Summoned to a zone(s) this card points to: Banish as many of those monster(s) as possible, also as many Spells/Traps on the field as possible, and if you do, inflict 500 damage to your opponent for each of their cards banished by this effect.', '0', '2500', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('66403530', 'Topologic Zeroboros', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66403530.jpg', '2+ Effect Monsters\\r\\nYou cannot Summon/Set monsters to any Extra Monster Zone this card points to. Gains 200 ATK for each banished card. If another monster is Special Summoned to a zone a Link Monster points to, while this monster is on the field: Banish all cards on the field. Once per turn, during the Standby Phase of the next turn after this card was banished by its own effect: Special Summon this banished card.', '0', '3000', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('83370323', 'Torapart', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/83370323.jpg', 'This card cannot be used as a Synchro Material Monster, except for the Synchro Summon of a Warrior-Type Synchro Monster. If the Synchro Monster that used this card as a Synchro Material Monster attacks, your opponent cannot activate Trap Cards until the end of the Damage Step.', '2', '600', '600', 'DARK', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('80813021', 'Torike', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/80813021.jpg', '''''Although a poor defender, this monster''s sharp horn gives it an edge when attacking.''''', '3', '1200', '600', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('61068510', 'Tornado', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/61068510.jpg', 'Activate only when there are 3 or more cards in your opponent''s Spell & Trap Card Zone. Destroy 1 card in your opponent''s Spell & Trap Card Zone.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('71283180', 'Tornado Bird', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/71283180.jpg', 'FLIP: Return 2 Spell or Trap Cards on the field to their owners'' hands.', '4', '1100', '1000', 'WIND', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('6983839', 'Tornado Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/6983839.jpg', '2 Level 4 monsters\\nOnce per turn (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card, then target 1 Spell/Trap on the field; destroy it.', '4', '2100', '2000', 'WIND', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('18605135', 'Tornado Wall', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/18605135.jpg', 'Activate only while "Umi" is on the field. While "Umi" is face-up on the field, you take no Battle Damage from attacking monsters. Destroy this card when "Umi" leaves the field.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('90337190', 'Torpedo Fish', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90337190.jpg', 'While "Umi" is face-up on the field, this card is unaffected by any Spell Cards.', '3', '1000', '1000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('45943123', 'Torpedo Takedown', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/45943123.jpg', 'Target 1 WATER Xyz Monster you control; detach 1 material from it, inflict 400 damage to your opponent for each card in your hand, and if you do, that monster gains ATK equal to the damage inflicted, until the end of this turn. You can banish this card and 1 WATER Xyz Monster from your GY; draw 2 cards. You can only use 1 "Torpedo Takedown" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('79538761', 'Torque Tune Gear', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/79538761.jpg', 'Once per turn, you can either: Target 1 monster you control; equip this card to that target, OR: Unequip this card and Special Summon it. A monster equipped with this card is treated as a Tuner, it gains 500 ATK/DEF, also if the equipped monster would be destroyed by battle or card effect, destroy this card instead.', '1', '0', '0', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('7092142', 'Torrential Reborn', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/7092142.jpg', 'When a face-up WATER monster you control is destroyed by battle or by a card effect and sent to the Graveyard: Special Summon the monsters destroyed and sent from the field to your Graveyard at that time, then inflict 500 damage to your opponent for each of those Special Summoned monsters. You can only activate 1 "Torrential Reborn" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('53582587', 'Torrential Tribute', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53582587.jpg', 'When a monster(s) is Summoned: Destroy all monsters on the field.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('75372290', 'Total Defense Shogun', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75372290.jpg', 'This card is changed to Defense Position when it is Normal Summoned or Flip Summoned successfully. This card can attack while it is in Defense Position. If this card attacks while in Defense Position, apply the ATK of this card for damage calculation.', '6', '1550', '2500', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('71068247', 'Totem Bird', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/71068247.jpg', '2 Level 3 WIND monsters\\nDuring either player''s turn, when a Spell/Trap Card is activated: You can detach 2 Xyz Materials from this card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy it. This card loses 300 ATK while it has no Xyz Materials.', '3', '1900', '1400', 'WIND', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('564541', 'Totem Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/564541.jpg', 'This card can be treated as 2 Tributes for the Tribute Summon of a Dragon-Type monster. If this card is in your Graveyard during your Standby Phase and you control no monsters, you can Special Summon this card in Attack Position. You cannot activate this effect if there are any monsters in your Graveyard that are not Dragon-Type. If this card is Special Summoned with this effect, remove it from play when it is removed from the field.', '2', '400', '200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('47873397', 'Totem Pole', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/47873397.jpg', 'Your opponent cannot target Rock monsters you control with 0 original ATK, with card effects. Once per battle, when an opponent''s monster declares an attack: You can negate that attack, and if you do, place 1 counter on this card. If this card has 3 counters, send it to the GY. If you have 3 or more Rock monsters in your GY with 0 ATK and different names from each other: You can banish this card from your GY; any effect damage your opponent takes this turn is doubled.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('52823314', 'Tour Bus From the Underworld', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52823314.jpg', 'When this card is sent to the Graveyard: Target 1 monster in either player''s Graveyard, except "Tour Bus From the Underworld"; shuffle that target into the Deck.', '3', '1000', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('89732524', 'Tour Bus To Forbidden Realms', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/89732524.jpg', 'FLIP: Add 1 Fiend-Type monster from your Deck to your hand, except a DARK or LIGHT monster.', '3', '600', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Flip Effect Monster'),
('10802915', 'Tour Guide From the Underworld', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/10802915.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 Level 3 Fiend monster from your hand or Deck, but negate its effects, also it cannot be used as Synchro Material.', '3', '1000', '600', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('62784717', 'Tour of Doom', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/62784717.jpg', 'During your opponent''s Standby Phase, toss a coin. ● Heads: Your opponent cannot Normal Summon or Flip Summon until the End Phase. ● Tails: You cannot Normal Summon or Flip Summon during your next turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('94256039', 'Tower of Babel', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94256039.jpg', 'Each time a Spell Card is activated, place 1 Spell Counter on this card when that Spell Card resolves. If the 4th Spell Counter is placed on this card: Destroy this card, and if you do, the player who activated the Spell Card at that time takes 3000 damage.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('48882106', 'Toxic Boxfish', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/48882106.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters\\r\\nIf this card is Synchro Summoned: You can target 1 card in either GY; banish it. If this card is banished: You can target 1 face-up card your opponent controls; negate its effects until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of "Toxic Boxfish" once per turn.', '4', '1800', '800', 'WATER', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('24878656', 'Toy Box', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/24878656.jpg', 'Once per turn, when an opponent''s monster declares an attack: You can send 1 face-down card you control to the GY; destroy that opponent''s monster. Once per turn: You can activate 1 of these effects;\\r\\n● From your hand, Deck, face-up Monster Zone, and/or GY, choose up to 2 monsters with "Toy" in their original names that can Set themselves from the hand as a Spell, and Set them in your Spell & Trap Zone as Spells.\\r\\n● Destroy up to 2 cards in your Spell & Trap Zone.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('1826676', 'Toy Knight', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1826676.jpg', 'Cannot be Special Summoned from the Deck. If your opponent controls more monsters than you do, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). When this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 "Toy Knight" from your hand.', '4', '200', '1200', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('58132856', 'Toy Magician', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/58132856.jpg', 'You can Set this card from your hand to your Spell & Trap Zone as a Spell. During the End Phase, if this Set card in your Spell & Trap Zone was destroyed by an opponent''s card effect and sent to the GY this turn: Special Summon this card. If this card is Flip Summoned: Destroy Spells and Traps on the field, equal to the number of "Toy Magicians" on the field.', '4', '1600', '1500', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('92607427', 'Toy Parade', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/92607427.jpg', '(This card is always treated as a "Frightfur" card.)\\r\\nTarget 1 DARK monster you control Special Summoned from the Extra Deck; for the rest of this turn, you cannot declare attacks except with that monster, also each time that monster destroys a monster by battle and sends it to the GY, it can attack again in a row. If you control a Fairy monster, except the turn this card was sent to the GY: You can banish this card from your GY; add 1 Level 4 or lower DARK monster from your GY to your hand. You can only use 1 "Toy Parade" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('65504487', 'Toy Soldier', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/65504487.jpg', 'You can Set this card from your hand to your Spell & Trap Zone as a Spell. You can only use each of the following effects of "Toy Soldier" once per turn. If this Set card in the Spell & Trap Zone is sent to the GY: You can Special Summon this card. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Toy Box" from your Deck to your hand, or, if you control "Toy Box", you can add 1 Level 4 LIGHT monster instead.', '4', '1500', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('69925461', 'Toy Tank', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/69925461.jpg', 'You can Set this card from your hand to your Spell & Trap Zone as a Spell. You can only use each of the following effects of "Toy Tank" once per turn. If this Set card in the Spell & Trap Zone is sent to the GY: You can Special Summon this card. You can Tribute this monster; Special Summon 1 Level 6 or lower monster from your hand, or, if you control "Toy Box", you can Special Summon 1 Level 6 or lower monster from your GY instead, except "Toy Tank".', '4', '1000', '2100', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('70245411', 'Toy Vendor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/70245411.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can discard 1 card; draw 1 card and show it, then if it is a "Fluffal" monster, you can Special Summon 1 monster from your hand. Otherwise, discard the card you drew. If this card is sent to the Graveyard: You can add 1 "Edge Imp Sabres" or 1 "Fluffal" monster from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('66226132', 'Trackblack', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66226132.jpg', '2 Effect Monsters\\r\\nYou can target 1 monster you control this card points to; this turn, each time it destroys an opponent''s monster by battle, draw 1 card. You can only use this effect of "Trackblack" once per turn.', '0', '1200', '0', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('38120068', 'Trade-In', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38120068.jpg', 'Discard 1 Level 8 monster; draw 2 cards.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('23408872', 'Tradetoad', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/23408872.jpg', 'Once per turn, you can Tribute 1 Aqua-Type monster to select 1 "Frog" monster in your Graveyard, except "Frog the Jam". Special Summon that monster from your Graveyard.', '1', '100', '2000', 'WATER', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('63875853', 'Trading Places', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/63875853.jpg', 'If your LP is higher than your opponent''s, switch your LP with your opponent.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('41248270', 'Traffic Ghost', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41248270.jpg', '3 monsters', '0', '1800', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('81143465', 'Tragic Twin Twined Jewels', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/81143465.jpg', 'Equip only to a monster you control that was Special Summoned from the Extra Deck. If your opponent Special Summons a monster(s) from the Extra Deck with ATK higher than the equipped monster (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 of them; destroy the targeted monster, destroy the equipped monster, and if you destroyed at least one of them, you take damage equal to their combined original ATK. Then, inflict damage to your opponent equal to the damage you took.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('98777036', 'Tragoedia', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/98777036.jpg', 'When you take battle damage: You can Special Summon this card from your hand. Gains 600 ATK/DEF for each card in your hand. Once per turn: You can send 1 monster from your hand to the GY, then target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls with the same Level the sent monster had in the hand; take control of that face-up monster. Once per turn: You can target 1 monster in your GY; this card''s Level becomes the same as that target''s, until the end of this turn.', '10', '0', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('60879050', 'Train Connection', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/60879050.jpg', 'Must be equipped to an EARTH Machine-Type monster, by banishing 2 Level 10 or higher Machine-Type monsters from your Graveyard, and cannot be equipped by other ways. The equipped monster''s ATK becomes double its original ATK, also if it attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage to your opponent. Other monsters you control cannot attack.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('37890974', 'Training Fur Hire, Fur All Your Training Needs', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/37890974.jpg', 'If a face-up monster(s) "Fur Hire" you control is destroyed by battle or an opponent''s card effect: You can target 1 of those monsters; Special Summon 1 monster "Fur Hire" from your Deck, whose Level is lower than that target''s original Level. You can only use this effect of "Training Fur Hire, Fur All Your Training Needs" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('42348802', 'Trakodon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/42348802.jpg', 'A tiger-striped dragon that is often seen racing across the wasteland at tremendous speeds.', '3', '1300', '800', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
