('952523', 'Traptrix Cularia', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/952523.jpg', '2 Insect and/or Plant monsters\\r\\nThis Link Summoned card is unaffected by Trap effects. You can only use each of the following effects of "Traptrix Cularia" once per turn. After you activate a "Hole" Normal Trap Card, you can Set it instead of sending it to the GY. During your End Phase: You can target 1 "Traptrix" monster in your GY; Special Summon it in Defense Position.', '0', '1800', '0', 'EARTH', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
