('46759931', 'Vision HERO Trinity', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46759931.jpg', '3 "HERO" monsters\\r\\nAfter this card is Fusion Summoned, for the rest of this turn, this card''s ATK becomes double its original ATK. This Fusion Summoned card can make a second and third attack during each Battle Phase. Cannot attack directly.', '8', '2500', '2000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('27780618', 'Vision HERO Vyon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/27780618.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can send 1 "HERO" monster from your Deck to the GY. You can only use this effect of "Vision HERO Vyon" once per turn. Once per turn: You can banish 1 "HERO" monster from your GY; add 1 "Polymerization" from your Deck to your hand.', '4', '1000', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('82697428', 'Vision HERO Witch Raider', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/82697428.jpg', 'To Tribute Summon this card face-up, you can Tribute Trap(s) you control, as well as monsters. When this card is Normal Summoned: You can destroy all Spells and Traps your opponent controls. You cannot Special Summon monsters during the turn you activate this effect, except "HERO" monsters.', '8', '2700', '1900', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('19186123', 'Vision Release', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/19186123.jpg', 'Target 1 "Vision HERO" Monster Card in your Spell & Trap Zone; Special Summon it. During your Main Phase, except the turn this card was sent to the GY: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 "Vision HERO" monster in your GY; add it to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('98396890', 'Vision Resonator', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/98396890.jpg', 'If a Level 5 or higher DARK monster is on the field, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You can only Special Summon "Vision Resonator" once per turn this way. If this card is sent to the GY: You can add 1 Spell/Trap that mentions "Red Dragon Archfiend" from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Vision Resonator" once per turn.', '2', '400', '400', 'DARK', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('35659410', 'Vision with Eyes of Blue', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/35659410.jpg', 'When you activate this card: You can reveal 1 "Blue-Eyes White Dragon" in your hand; Special Summon 1 monster from your hand. Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster you control; return that face-up monster to the hand, then you can apply the following effect, based on the original name of the card returned to the hand.\\r\\n● "Blue-Eyes White Dragon": Special Summon 1 monster from your hand.\\r\\n● Other: Special Summon 1 "Blue-Eyes" monster from your hand.\\r\\nYou can only activate 1 "Vision with Eyes of Blue" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('52575195', 'Vivid Knight', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52575195.jpg', 'During either player''s turn (except during the Damage Step), when your opponent targets exactly 1 LIGHT Beast-Warrior-Type monster you control (and no other cards) for an attack, or with a card effect: Banish that monster you control until your next Standby Phase, and if you do, Special Summon this card from your hand.', '4', '1700', '800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('7608148', 'Vivid Tail', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/7608148.jpg', 'Target 1 card you control; return it to the hand. If this card is in your GY: You can target 1 face-up card you control; Set this card (but banish it when it leaves the field), and if you do, return that face-up card to the hand, but for the rest of this turn, you cannot activate cards, or the effects of cards, with the same name that card had once it returned to the hand. You can only use 1 "Vivid Tail" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('41773061', 'Voici la Carte (Today''s Menu)', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41773061.jpg', 'Reveal 2 "Nouvelles" monsters with different names from your Deck, your opponent chooses 1 for you to add to your hand, and you shuffle the other into your Deck, then you can add 1 of these cards from your Deck or GY to your hand based on the Monster Type added to your hand by this effect.\\r\\n● Beast-Warrior: "Recette de Poisson (Fish Recipe)"\\r\\n● Warrior: "Recette de Viande (Meat Recipe)"\\r\\nYou can only activate 1 "Voici la Carte (Today''s Menu)" per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('7337976', 'Void Apocalypse', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/7337976.jpg', 'You can discard 1 card; send 1 Fiend monster from your Deck to the GY. You can send this face-up card from your Spell & Trap Zone to the GY; send "Infernoid" monsters with different names from your hand and/or Deck to the GY, up to the number of monsters your opponent controls that were Special Summoned from the Extra Deck. You can only use 1 "Void Apocalypse" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('96235944', 'Void Breach', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/96235944.jpg', '"Infernoid" monsters you control gain 100 ATK for each of your banished "Infernoid" monsters. If you control no monsters, or all monsters you control are Fiend monsters: You can activate 1 of these effects;\\r\\n● Add 1 of your banished "Infernoid" monsters to your hand.\\r\\n● Special Summon 1 "Infernoid" monster from your hand, ignoring its Summoning conditions.\\r\\nYou can only use this effect of "Void Breach" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('45313724', 'Void Cauldron', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/45313724.jpg', 'This card is sent to the GY if you have any cards in your hand. If an "Infernity" monster(s) and/or a Level 8 DARK Dragon Synchro Monster(s) you control would be destroyed by your opponent''s card effect, you can banish 1 "Infernity" card from your GY instead.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('34822850', 'Void Expansion', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/34822850.jpg', 'During your Standby Phase: You can Special Summon 1 "Infernoid Token" (Fiend-Type/FIRE/Level 1/ATK 0/DEF 0). To Special Summon an "Infernoid" monster using its own procedure, you can banish "Infernoid" monster(s) you control instead of those in the Graveyard (or any combination of both). Your opponent cannot target "Infernoid" monsters you control for attacks or with card effects, except the "Infernoid" monster you control with the highest Level (either, if tied).', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Field Spell'),
('31548814', 'Void Feast', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31548814.jpg', 'Send 1 "Void" Spell/Trap Card from your hand or face-up from your field to the Graveyard; Special Summon up to 3 "Infernoid" monsters from your Deck, whose total Levels exactly equal 8, ignoring their Summoning conditions.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('31444249', 'Void Imagination', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/31444249.jpg', '"Infernoid" monsters you control whose original Levels are 2 or higher become Level 1 and all battle damage they inflict to your opponent is halved. You can send this card to the Graveyard; Fusion Summon 1 "Infernoid" Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or your side of the field as Fusion Materials. If your opponent controls a monster that was Special Summoned from the Extra Deck, and you do not, you can also use up to 6 monsters in your Deck as Fusion Materials.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('94432298', 'Void Launch', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/94432298.jpg', 'During each of your Standby Phases: You can send up to 2 "Infernoid" monsters from your Deck to the Graveyard. If you control a monster that is not an "Infernoid" monster, send this card to the Graveyard.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('61965407', 'Void Purification', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/61965407.jpg', 'If you control a monster that is not an "Infernoid" monster, send this card to the Graveyard. You can only use each of these effects of "Void Purification" once per turn.\\n● During each of your opponent''s Standby Phases: You can target 1 "Infernoid" monster in your Graveyard; add it to your hand.\\n● During each of your Standby Phases: You can target 1 of your banished "Infernoid" monsters; return it to the Graveyard.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('60830240', 'Void Reignition', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/60830240.jpg', 'Reveal 1 "Infernoid" monster or 1 "Void" Spell/Trap in your hand; discard your entire hand, then draw the same number of cards you discarded. If you control no monsters, or all monsters you control are Fiend monsters, except the turn this card was sent to the GY: You can banish this card from your GY, then target up to 11 of your banished "Infernoid" monsters with different names; return them to the GY. You can only use this effect of "Void Reignition" once per Duel.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Spell'),
('8437145', 'Void Seer', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/8437145.jpg', 'Target 1 "Infernoid" monster you control; that target is unaffected by the opponent''s card effects this turn. If an "Infernoid" monster(s) you control would be destroyed by a card effect, you can banish this card from your Graveyard instead of destroying 1 of those monsters.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Quick-Play Spell'),
('1005587', 'Void Trap Hole', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/1005587.jpg', 'When your opponent Special Summons a monster(s) with 2000 or more ATK: Negate the effects of 1 of those monsters with 2000 or more ATK, and if you do, destroy it.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('78748366', 'Void Vanishment', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78748366.jpg', 'You can discard 1 card; add 1 "Void" Spell/Trap Card from your Deck to your hand, except "Void Vanishment" or "Null and Void", also you cannot Normal or Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except "Infernoid" monsters. You can only use this effect of "Void Vanishment" once per turn. If an "Infernoid" monster you control battles an opponent''s monster, after damage calculation: You can send this card to the Graveyard; banish those monsters.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('38026562', 'Vola-Chemicritter Methydraco', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38026562.jpg', '2 Level 8 Gemini monsters\\nWhen this card is Xyz Summoned: You can target 1 Gemini monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it. While this card has Xyz Material, monsters your opponent controls cannot target Gemini monsters you control for attacks, also your opponent cannot target Gemini monsters you control with card effects. When a Gemini monster is Normal Summoned: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; make your opponent send 1 card from their hand or field to the Graveyard (their choice).', '8', '3000', '3000', 'FIRE', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('81020140', 'Volcanic Blaster', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/81020140.jpg', 'When this card is destroyed and sent to the Graveyard by battle, you can place 1 "Volcanic" monster in your Deck on top of your Deck.', '3', '1200', '600', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('85250352', 'Volcanic Blaze Accelerator', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85250352.jpg', 'Activate this card by sending 1 "Blaze Accelerator" from your hand, Deck, or face-up field to the GY. You can only control 1 "Volcanic Blaze Accelerator". Once per turn, during your Main Phase: You can Special Summon 1 "Volcanic" monster from your hand. Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; send 1 Level 1 Pyro monster from your Deck to the GY, and if you do, destroy that monster.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('66436257', 'Volcanic Counter', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/66436257.jpg', 'When you take battle damage while this card is in your Graveyard: Banish it from your Graveyard, then if there is a FIRE monster other than "Volcanic Counter" in your Graveyard, inflict damage to your opponent equal to the amount of battle damage you took.', '3', '300', '1300', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('32543380', 'Volcanic Doomfire', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32543380.jpg', 'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card can only be Special Summoned by sending a face-up "Tri-Blaze Accelerator" you control to the Graveyard. During your opponent''s Battle Phase, your opponent must attack this monster with any Attack Position monsters they control. When this card destroys a monster and sends it to the Graveyard, destroy all monsters your opponent controls and inflict 500 damage to your opponent for each monster destroyed by this effect.', '8', '3000', '1800', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('58143766', 'Volcanic Emission', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/58143766.jpg', 'Activate 1 of these effects (but you can only use each effect of "Volcanic Emission" once per turn);\\r\\n● Take 1 "Volcanic" monster from your Deck, and either add it to your hand or Special Summon it, ignoring its Summoning conditions, but return it to the hand during the End Phase.\\r\\n● Target 1 Pyro monster on the field; inflict damage to your opponent equal to that monster''s original ATK, or if you targeted a monster you control, the damage is halved.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('46412900', 'Volcanic Emperor', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46412900.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand or GY) by banishing 3 Pyro monsters or 1 "Blaze Accelerator" card from your face-up field and/or GY. You can only Special Summon "Volcanic Emperor" once per turn. When Summoned this way: You can inflict 500 damage to your opponent for each banished Pyro monster, then you can Set 1 "Volcanic" Trap directly from your Deck. Each time your opponent Special Summons a monster(s), inflict 500 damage to your opponent.', '8', '3100', '2400', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('42175079', 'Volcanic Eruption', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/42175079.jpg', 'During your End Phase, if you control "Jurassic World": Destroy all cards on the field.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('54514594', 'Volcanic Hammerer', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54514594.jpg', 'Once per turn, you can inflict damage to your opponent equal to the number of "Volcanic" monsters in your Graveyard x 200. If you activate this effect, this card cannot attack during this turn.', '5', '2400', '1500', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('84138874', 'Volcanic Inferno', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/84138874.jpg', 'When your opponent activates a monster effect on the field: You can banish 1 Pyro monster from your GY; inflict 500 damage to your opponent, then, if you banished a "Volcanic" monster to activate this effect, you can negate that effect. During your opponent''s End Phase: You can target up to 2 of your "Volcanic" monsters that are banished and/or in your GY; place them on the bottom of your Deck in any order. You can only use each effect of "Volcanic Inferno" once per turn.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Trap'),
('74657662', 'Vylon Material', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/74657662.jpg', 'Equip only to a "Vylon" monster. It gains 600 ATK. If this face-up card is sent from the field to the Graveyard: You can add 1 "Vylon" Spell Card from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('63014935', 'Volcanic Queen', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/63014935.jpg', 'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card can only be Special Summoned from your hand to your opponent''s side of the field by Tributing 1 monster your opponent controls. If you Special Summon this card, you cannot Normal Summon or Set this turn.\\nOnce per turn, you can send 1 other card you control to the Graveyard to inflict 1000 damage to your opponent. During your End Phase, either Tribute 1 other monster or take 1000 damage.', '6', '2500', '1200', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('33112041', 'Volcanic Rat', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33112041.jpg', 'This mutated mouse dwells in the core of active volcanoes. No amount of heat is too much for it to bear.', '1', '500', '500', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('33725271', 'Volcanic Recharge', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33725271.jpg', 'Return up to 3 "Volcanic" Monster Cards from your Graveyard to your Deck.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Normal Trap'),
('59805313', 'Volcanic Rimfire', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59805313.jpg', 'If this card is sent to the GY: You can activate 1 of these effects (but you can only use each effect of "Volcanic Rimfire" once per turn);\\r\\n● Banish this card from your GY, and if you do, send 1 "Volcanic" monster from your Deck to the GY, except "Volcanic Rimfire".\\r\\n● Banish 1 "Blaze Accelerator" card from your face-up field or GY, and if you do, place 1 "Blaze Accelerator" Continuous Spell/Trap from your hand or Deck face-up on your field.', '1', '300', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('76459806', 'Volcanic Rocket', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/76459806.jpg', 'When this card is Summoned: You can add 1 "Blaze Accelerator" card from your Deck or Graveyard to your hand.', '4', '1900', '1400', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('69750546', 'Volcanic Scattershot', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/69750546.jpg', 'If this card is sent to the Graveyard: Inflict 500 damage to your opponent. If this card is sent to the Graveyard by the effect of a "Blaze Accelerator" card: You can send 2 "Volcanic Scattershots" from your hand and/or Deck to the Graveyard; destroy all monsters your opponent controls.', '2', '500', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('33365932', 'Volcanic Shell', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/33365932.jpg', 'Once per turn: You can pay 500 LP; add 1 "Volcanic Shell" from your Deck to your hand. This card must be in the GY to activate and to resolve this effect.', '1', '100', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('17415895', 'Volcanic Slicer', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/17415895.jpg', 'Once per turn, you can inflict 500 damage to your opponent. If you activate this effect, this card cannot attack during this turn.', '4', '1800', '1200', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('22411609', 'Volcanic Trooper', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22411609.jpg', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Volcanic" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Volcanic Trooper". You can discard 1 card; Special Summon 1 "Bomb Token" (Pyro/FIRE/Level 1/ATK 1000/DEF 1000) to your opponent''s field. Each time 1 is destroyed, its controller takes 500 damage. You can only use each effect of "Volcanic Trooper" once per turn.', '3', '1000', '1000', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('38694052', 'Voloferniges, the Darkest Dragon Doomrider', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38694052.jpg', '2 Level 7 monsters\\r\\nOnce per turn: You can detach 2 materials from this card, then target 1 face-up card on the field; destroy it, and if you destroyed a monster, you can make 1 face-up monster you control gain ATK equal to the destroyed monster''s original Level/Rank x 300 until the end of the next turn. This card cannot attack the turn you activate this effect. This is a Quick Effect if this card has a Dragon monster as material, but cannot be activated in the Damage Step.', '7', '2500', '2100', 'DARK', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('20951752', 'Voltanis the Adjudicator', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/20951752.jpg', 'After 1 of your Counter Trap Cards has been activated and has resolved, you can Tribute all monsters you control to Special Summon this card. If this card is Special Summoned in this way, you can destroy cards your opponent controls up to the number of Fairy-Type monsters you Tributed.', '8', '2800', '1400', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('18585765', 'Voltester', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/18585765.jpg', 'If this card is Special Summoned to a zone a Link Monster points to: Destroy all Link Monsters that point to this card, then destroy all other monsters that those Link Monsters pointed to, and follow the Link Arrows of all those destroyed monsters, destroying everything they point to, and repeating the process, until there are no more to destroy. (This card cannot be destroyed by this effect.) You can only use this effect of "Voltester" once per turn.', '7', '2500', '1000', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('13995824', 'Voltic Bicorn', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/13995824.jpg', '1 Beast-Type Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters\\nIf this card is destroyed by your opponent''s card (either by battle or by card effect), both players send the top 7 cards of their Deck to the Graveyard.', '7', '2500', '2000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('93151201', 'Voltic Kong', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/93151201.jpg', 'When this card inflicts Battle Damage to your opponent: Send 1 card from the top of your opponent''s Deck to the Graveyard for each face-up LIGHT monster you control.', '4', '1800', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('14898066', 'Vorse Raider', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14898066.jpg', 'This wicked Beast-Warrior does every horrid thing imaginable, and loves it! His axe bears the marks of his countless victims.', '4', '1900', '1200', 'DARK', NULL, 'Normal Monster'),
('25373678', 'Vortex the Whirlwind', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/25373678.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner Winged Beast-Type monsters\\nWhen this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard, you can Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower Winged Beast-Type monster from your Deck.', '5', '2100', '700', 'WIND', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('7736719', 'Vortex Trooper', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/7736719.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can shuffle 2 cards from your hand into the Deck, then draw 2 cards. If this card is destroyed: Draw 1 card.', '3', '0', '600', 'WIND', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('739444', 'Vorticular Drumgon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/739444.jpg', '3 DARK Dragon monsters\\r\\nIf this card is Special Summoned: You can draw 1 card. You can only use this effect of "Vorticular Drumgon" once per turn. If this effect resolves, the unused Monster Zones this card points to cannot be used for the rest of this turn.', '0', '1000', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Link Monster'),
('75311421', 'Votis', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75311421.jpg', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can excavate the top 3 cards of your Deck, and if you do, you can banish 1 excavated monster to add 1 monster with its same name to your hand, from either your Deck or the other excavated cards, also shuffle the rest into the Deck. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card is in your GY because it was sent there this turn after being Normal Summoned/Set: You can excavate the top 3 cards of your Deck, and if you do, place them on top of the Deck in any order.', '4', '1700', '1900', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster');
INSERT INTO card (id, name, img_url, description, level, atk, def, attribute, type, card_type) VALUES
('36974120', 'Vouiburial, the Dragon Undertaker', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/36974120.jpg', 'If this card battles a monster, neither can be destroyed by that battle. During the Main Phase, if a monster(s) your opponent controls is sent to the GY: You can activate the following effect, based on where this card is at activation (but you can only use each effect of "Vouiburial, the Dragon Undertaker" once per turn);\\r\\n● Hand: Special Summon this card.\\r\\n● Field: Make 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls lose 1500 ATK, then if its ATK becomes 0 by this effect, you can destroy it.', '10', '3000', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('77387463', 'Vulcan Dragni the Cubic King', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/77387463.jpg', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by sending 2 "Cubic" monsters you control to the Graveyard. If Summoned this way, this card gains 1600 ATK. If this card is Special Summoned from the hand: Inflict 800 damage to your opponent. At the end of the Damage Step, if this card battled: You can target up to 3 "Vijam the Cubic Seed" in your Graveyard; send this card to the Graveyard, and if you do, Special Summon them, then you can add 1 "Indiora Doom Volt the Cubic Emperor" from your Deck to your hand.', '3', '0', '0', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('98012938', 'Vulcan the Divine', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/98012938.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters\\nIf this card is Synchro Summoned: Target 1 face-up card you control and 1 face-up card your opponent controls; return those targets to the hand, but for the rest of this turn, you cannot activate cards, or the effects of cards, with the same name as those returned to the hand by this effect. You can only use this effect of "Vulcan the Divine" once per turn.', '6', '2000', '1600', 'FIRE', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('58354899', 'Vulcarrion the Rotting Phoenix', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/58354899.jpg', 'If you control a Zombie monster: You can Special Summon this card from your hand. During your Main Phase: You can return this card from the field to the hand, then you can Special Summon 1 Zombie monster from your hand. You can only use each effect of "Vulcarrion the Rotting Phoenix" once per turn.', '4', '1600', '0', 'DARK', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('93683815', 'Vulmina, Statue of the Sacred Dragon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/93683815.jpg', '[ Pendulum Effect ] \\nIf a monster(s) is Special Summoned by your Trap effect (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 card on the field; return it to the hand, then you can Special Summon this card. You can only use this effect of "Vulmina, Statue of the Sacred Dragon" once per turn.\\n\\n[ Monster Effect ] \\nWhen an opponent''s monster declares an attack: You can place this monster in your Pendulum Zone, and if you do, return the opponent''s monster to the hand. You can only use this effect of "Vulmina, Statue of the Sacred Dragon" once per turn. If this card in the Monster Zone is destroyed: You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone.', '2', '200', '1800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Pendulum Effect Monster'),
('58859575', 'VW-Tiger Catapult', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/58859575.jpg', '"V-Tiger Jet" + "W-Wing Catapult"\\r\\nMust first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by banishing the above cards you control. (You do not use "Polymerization".) You can discard 1 card, then target 1 monster your opponent controls; change that target''s battle position. (Flip Effects are not activated.)', '6', '2000', '2100', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('84243274', 'VWXYZ-Dragon Catapult Cannon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/84243274.jpg', '"VW-Tiger Catapult" + "XYZ-Dragon Cannon"\\r\\nMust first be Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by banishing the above cards you control. (You do not use "Polymerization".) Once per turn: You can target 1 card your opponent controls; banish that target. When this card declares an attack on an opponent''s monster: You can target the attack target; change that attack target''s battle position. (Flip Effects are not activated.)', '8', '3000', '2800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Fusion Monster'),
('56768355', 'Vylon Alpha', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/56768355.jpg', '1 "Vylon" Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters\\nWhen this card is Synchro Summoned: You can target 1 Equip Spell Card in your Graveyard; equip that target to this card. While this card is equipped with an Equip Card, it cannot be destroyed by Spell/Trap effects, except for Equip Cards.', '9', '2200', '1100', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('13220032', 'Vylon Charger', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/13220032.jpg', 'All face-up LIGHT monsters you control gain 300 ATK for each Equip Card equipped to this card.', '4', '1000', '1000', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Effect Monster'),
('55046718', 'Vylon Component', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/55046718.jpg', 'Equip only to a "Vylon" monster. If it attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing Battle Damage to your opponent. If this face-up card on the field is sent to the Graveyard: You can add 1 "Vylon" Spell Card from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
('41431329', 'Vylon Cube', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/41431329.jpg', 'If this card is sent to the Graveyard for the Synchro Summon of a LIGHT monster: You can add 1 Equip Spell Card from your Deck to your hand.', '3', '800', '800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Tuner Monster'),
('45215453', 'Vylon Delta', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/45215453.jpg', '1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner LIGHT monsters\\r\\nIf this card is in face-up Defense Position during your End Phase, you can add 1 Equip Spell Card from your Deck to your hand.', '7', '1700', '2800', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('39987164', 'Vylon Disigma', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/39987164.jpg', '3 Level 4 monsters\\nOnce per turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card to target 1 face-up Attack Position Effect Monster your opponent controls; equip that target to this card. At the start of the Damage Step, if this card battles a monster whose Attribute is the same as a card equipped by this effect: Destroy that monster.', '4', '2500', '2100', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'XYZ Monster'),
('92035412', 'Vylon Element', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/92035412.jpg', 'When any face-up "Vylon" Equip Card(s) you control are destroyed (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon an equal or lower number of "Vylon" Tuner monsters from your Deck. They cannot be used as Synchro Material Monsters, except for the Synchro Summon of a "Vylon" Synchro Monster.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Continuous Spell'),
('75779210', 'Vylon Epsilon', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75779210.jpg', '1 LIGHT Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters\\nEquip Cards equipped to this card cannot be targeted by cards or effects. Once per turn: You can send 1 Equip Card equipped to this card to the Graveyard to target 1 monster your opponent controls; destroy that target.', '8', '2800', '1200', 'LIGHT', NULL, 'Synchro Monster'),
('90592429', 'Vylon Filament', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90592429.jpg', 'Equip only to a "Vylon" monster. If the equipped monster attacks, your opponent cannot activate any Spell/Trap Cards until the end of the Damage Step. If this face-up card on the field is sent to the Graveyard: You can add 1 "Vylon" Spell Card from your Deck to your hand.', '0', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, 'Equip Spell'),
